('rowid-90','GHBC-REQ-000090','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.6','1.6.1.1.1','GHBC-C-000051','Instead of an individual permit for each alteration to an already approved electrical, gas, mechanical or plumbing installation, the Head of Works is authorized to issue an annual permit upon application therefor to any person, firm or corporation regularly employing one or more qualified tradespersons in the building, structure or on the premises owned or operated by the applicant for the permit.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9bc166a2aec942b44b70abce716eab525296b5fab81863eb30e541571953a6e8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-91','GHBC-REQ-000091','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.6','1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-000052','The person to whom an annual permit is issued shall keep a detailed record of alterations made under such annual permit.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56f0ff2f93aa3d2367019a8e25232d65413620d6a49368224c7f38446f9e6bcc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
