('rowid-204','GHBC-REQ-000204','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.1.1','GHBC-C-000074','(i) access to fire appliances/vehicles with details of vehicular turning circle and clear motorable accessway around the building; (ii) width of main and alternative staircases along with balcony approach, corridor, ventilated lobby approach; (iii) location and details of lift enclosures; (iv) location and size of fire lift; (v) smoke stop lobby/door, where provided; (vi) refuse chutes, refuse chamber, service duct, etc; (vii) vehicular parking spaces; (viii) refuse area, if any; (ix)  details of building services.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb65b819831e146d10a582dc33ff27d1b901a3fa58abf7a63590c2c45e08039d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
