('rowid-210','GHBC-REQ-000210','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-000075','In other than occupancies in Groups R-2, R-3, and I-1, the construction documents shall designate the number of occupants to be accommodated on every floor, and in all rooms and spaces.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ef2366967c7c0c2650f82ffa683184491ee8cff0209d1d7391eecc9092d5c520','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-211','GHBC-REQ-000211','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.4','GHBC-C-000076','Construction documents for all buildings shall describe the exterior wall envelope in sufficient detail to determine compliance with this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93e3e810d91dea9db2884d4b616cb63b3ec9174edad6284aba33b3dc081d9beb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
