('rowid-219','GHBC-REQ-000219','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.6','GHBC-C-000078','location of new construction and existing structures on the site, distances from plot lines, the established street grades and the proposed finished grades and, as applicable, flood hazard areas, floodways, and design flood elevations; and it shall be drawn in accordance with an accurate boundary line survey.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cfea22e297a0d57434f9deace48e47c2ccd49b8e776f23eef62d8fca2dcb767c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-220','GHBC-REQ-000220','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.6','GHBC-C-000078','In the case of demolition, the site plan shall show construction to be demolished and the location and size of existing structures and construction that are to remain on the site or pplot.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','78a7d236b1e5b38e1bf14eaac43b94c0972547506b1197817c6aee08e180ca2b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-221','GHBC-REQ-000221','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.6','GHBC-C-000078','The Head of Works is authorized to waive or modify the requirement for a site plan where the application for permit is for alteration or repair or where otherwise warranted.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ecbc7620165629ebf3802f1426f90cb9e80494b44433e5a68f17fcaf59ece741','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-222','GHBC-REQ-000222','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.6.1','GHBC-C-000079','Where design flood elevations are not specified, they shall be established in accordance with this Code.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6bcf007cd92edd18057950b40bbfa2ae93f1f23880fb315f68ffff23a6b5a124','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-223','GHBC-REQ-000223','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.7','GHBC-C-000080','The construction documents shall provide the information specified in this Code.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed70320ad9ebae9beb3c5e5c5c5df56d45474bd7f6c591183df234b5084fa1e3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-224','GHBC-REQ-000224','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.2.8','GHBC-C-000081','Construction documents for relocatable buildings shall comply with this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0eee4e49cdd8ead9415448ac8269de2273724e407b7ad5fae64d4efa585000a6','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-225','GHBC-REQ-000225','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3','GHBC-C-000082','The Head of Works shall examine or cause to be examined the accompanying Submission documents and shall ascertain by such examinations whether the construction indicated and described is in accordance with the requirements of this Code or legislation.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d67a643e1c138d8b0494a88ee6eebf0978d9b486119764639f69981c426a1d07','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-226','GHBC-REQ-000226','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.1','GHBC-C-000083','When the Head of Works issues a permit, the construction documents shall be approved, in writing or by stamp, as ―Reviewed for Code Compliance.‖ One set of construction documents so reviewed shall be retained by the Head of Works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5b6c231409b076bd35d06fe6a21a2c032f406d1ef2c0924dd4b3c72e955dc678','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-227','GHBC-REQ-000227','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.1','GHBC-C-000083','The other set shall be returned to the applicant, shall be kept at the site of work and shall be open to inspection by the Head of Works or a duly authorized representative.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','351f218f9635b16809627f0258dd28e955e9b67cdf376f27f6b639741cc961db','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-228','GHBC-REQ-000228','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.2','GHBC-C-000084','This Code shall not require changes in the construction documents, construction or designated occupancy of a structure for which a lawful permit has been heretofore issued or otherwise lawfully authorized, and the construction of which has been pursued in good faith within 180 days after the effective date of this Code and has not been abandoned.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":180,"unit":"days","operator":null,"context":" pursued in good faith within 180 days after the effective date of t"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e65440ac81a24a070eb79cc49ffa2657ea1cb7c88df80bf028ad70e04968633d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-229','GHBC-REQ-000229','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.3','GHBC-C-000085','The Head of Works is authorized to issue a permit for the construction of foundations or any other part of a building or structure before the construction documents for the whole building or structure have been submitted, provided that adequate information and detailed statements have been filed complying with pertinent requirements of this Code.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c330c2931cc276012231851d08d6edb112517552e1068025ce6c1d501cf0b08c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-230','GHBC-REQ-000230','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.3','GHBC-C-000085','The holder of such permit for the foundation or other parts of a building or structure shall proceed at the holder‘s own risk with the building operation and without assurance that a permit for the entire structure will be granted.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19a385f8df45e3110ec17fafa388e584db78469c57275a68258f16febb32f578','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-231','GHBC-REQ-000231','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4','GHBC-C-000086','charge.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72272fe9eb6aef1d51c4ec541826b3b5e93db249aa5dbb469349d6e1b9467b24','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-232','GHBC-REQ-000232','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4','GHBC-C-000086','Where it is required that documents be prepared by a registered design professional, the Head of Works shall be authorized to require the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent to engage and designate on the building permit application a registered design professional who shall act as the registered design professional in responsible charge.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','075be72047658e6a32b2f0a77753e2c7ef3c0b5c9a163c7f2f9fd6e720ba61e6','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-233','GHBC-REQ-000233','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4','GHBC-C-000086','If the circumstances require, the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent shall designate a substitute registered design professional in responsible charge who shall perform the duties required of the original registered design professional in responsible charge.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea950e32cb39c8c5b60603de266550a73535a57f1a9b044181965a1d943ff225','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-234','GHBC-REQ-000234','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4','GHBC-C-000086','The Head of Works shall be notified in writing by the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent if the registered design professional in responsible charge is changed or is unable to continue to perform the duties.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','425b63d8d912c0e023b1fa091343d7a56b3d7eef74a602fe6894c71059256072','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-235','GHBC-REQ-000235','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4','GHBC-C-000086','The registered design professional in responsible charge shall be responsible for reviewing and coordinating Submission documents prepared by others, including phased and deferred Submission items, for compatibility with the design of the building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f395a8ded5965bd2710d0fa920a72057f136688abe540b1213798e7f1dcf50a2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-236','GHBC-REQ-000236','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4.1','GHBC-C-000087','Deferral of any Submission items shall have the prior approval of the Head of Works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9ab9490677bf55e175290580f6d17b162c85fa46ab1ae1d7a266eac5a0bcf20a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-237','GHBC-REQ-000237','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4.1','GHBC-C-000087','The registered design professional in responsible charge shall list the deferred Submissions on the construction documents for review by the Head of Works.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a340943f79956e54ae87d96451b07718417a0ccb539aa240c1b12b60f460dcbe','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-238','GHBC-REQ-000238','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4.1','GHBC-C-000087','Documents for deferred Submission items shall be submitted to the registered design professional in responsible charge who shall review them and forward them to the Head of Works with a notation indicating that the deferred Submission documents have been reviewed and found to be in general conformance to the design of the building.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f111a8023ce80746e98a9d4dab53ab3835e16f0ba9594f084daddebbb932b348','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-239','GHBC-REQ-000239','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.3.4.1','GHBC-C-000087','The deferred Submission items shall not be installed until the deferred Submission documents have been approved by the Head of Works.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7d048f98a7c790c9bc47a2f6100f6a23e76ad4d693ee60ef54802e1bcf416577','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-240','GHBC-REQ-000240','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.4','GHBC-C-000088','Work shall be installed in accordance with the approved construction documents, and any changes made during construction that are not in compliance with the approved construction documents shall be resubmitted for approval as an amended set of construction documents.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0c19b2d976b041c21d42db4b1ece9ddaa46e6e3167e1af70d9ac880e0c09798','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-241','GHBC-REQ-000241','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.9','1.9.5','GHBC-C-000089','One set of approved construction documents shall be retained by the Head of Works for a period of not less than 180 days from date of completion of the permitted work, or as required by this Code.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":180,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"Head of Works for a period of not less than 180 days from date of completion "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":180,"unit":"days","operator":null,"context":"for a period of not less than 180 days from date of completion of th"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','15af9fe07d5c73cd61da17f2c93cf91071ee84cb11310aa25ff3dcfbeed19fdb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-242','GHBC-REQ-000242','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.1','GHBC-C-000090','The Head of Works is authorized to issue a permit for temporary structures and temporary uses.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0c2e11165d8b504ffa3d798d0e40ab1d855a61946a96307112b2768ec8d43710','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-243','GHBC-REQ-000243','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.1','GHBC-C-000090','Such permits shall be limited as to time of service, but shall not be permitted for more than 180 days.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":180,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ut shall not be permitted for more than 180 days."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":180,"unit":"days","operator":null,"context":"ot be permitted for more than 180 days."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2bb1f1b61dc58df8b44253596be18d03c12e515fd49c243494d7133f54fcf37b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-244','GHBC-REQ-000244','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.1','GHBC-C-000090','The Head of Works is authorized to grant extensions for demonstrated cause.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f2e4109368cf5fdd51c717b2d4fbb3f6492c543dde378a08112c859d396a60ef','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-245','GHBC-REQ-000245','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.2','GHBC-C-000091','Temporary structures and uses shall comply with the requirements in this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','84d8ebbf257c65ab1dc8dccde66f2a09edad6a78e2cf8b31691588879f2da754','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-246','GHBC-REQ-000246','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.3','GHBC-C-000092','The Head of Works is authorized to give permission to temporarily supply and use power in part of an electric installation before such installation has been fully completed and the final certificate of completion has been issued.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e36bda6b35610a81718c4f486be34f5667bd3b53da3120320ebf70f714f9201d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-247','GHBC-REQ-000247','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.3','GHBC-C-000092','The part covered by the temporary certificate shall comply with the requirements specified for temporary lighting, heat or power in Ghana Wiring Code','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4ade5129dfcb9527a69524696e1a64378e7d16125b25c18120c97d509751192a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-248','GHBC-REQ-000248','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.10','1.10.4','GHBC-C-000093','The Head of Works is authorized to terminate such permit for a temporary structure or use and to order the temporary structure or use to be discontinued.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a69e24a7d0574fdfc5c7fbd23cab25ad759bf422926ceac7784af6e4e3a59343','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-249','GHBC-REQ-000249','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.1','GHBC-C-000094','A permit shall not be valid until the fees prescribed by law have been paid, nor shall an amendment to a permit be released until the additional fee, if any, has been paid.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3184ff63f61be1694a9dbb22c193d4f1806d9399508008b1063f2c1d6ecad597','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-250','GHBC-REQ-000250','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.2','GHBC-C-000095','On buildings, structures, electrical, gas, mechanical, and plumbing systems or alterations requiring a permit, a fee for each permit shall be paid as required, in accordance with the schedule as established by the applicable governing authority.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bf0877445b623472231ba33171c876620d3fb9a1c6d7cec037a49731b72e979','2026-08-15 13:56:12');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-251','GHBC-REQ-000251','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.3','GHBC-C-000096','The applicant for a permit shall provide an estimated permit value at time of application.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3709669f524a68e20d326fb3a7d6fcd9e9eacaf471101f0f62b319ce9a77e82','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-252','GHBC-REQ-000252','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.3','GHBC-C-000096','Permit valuations shall include total value of work, including materials and labor, for which the permit is being issued, such as electrical, gas, mechanical, plumbing equipment and permanent systems.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c2e7fac291216448c3e7ea6096cf1b8723ceed6d9202da532bdeac1ced11f102','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-253','GHBC-REQ-000253','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.3','GHBC-C-000096','If, in the opinion of the Head of Works, the valuation is underestimated on the application, the permit shall be denied, unless the applicant can show detailed estimates to meet the approval of the Head of Works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9c0c77fc4c266e1ce622dbef1e91cc825af863142ad1e8872d6dac9c3542517d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-254','GHBC-REQ-000254','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.3','GHBC-C-000096','Final building permit valuation shall be set by the Head of Works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a036267fd745dab4b272f6dc74f0bcca46b42c178a6887379af64af1f56ed01','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-255','GHBC-REQ-000255','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.4','GHBC-C-000097','issuance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b5010786a50c8eaaa8022f6fca2ff739734a979089c21d243973cb008a015802','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-256','GHBC-REQ-000256','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.4','GHBC-C-000097','Any person who commences any work on a building, structure, electrical, gas, mechanical or plumbing system before obtaining the necessary permits shall be subject to a fee established by the Head of Works that shall be in addition to the required permit fees.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','493e6f6e7538dd38548704b5b0131e0d954ba0809cdf76b5f5091ed5d0d1256e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-257','GHBC-REQ-000257','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.5','GHBC-C-000098','The payment of the fee for the construction, alteration, removal or demolition for work done in connection to or concurrently with the work authorized by a building permit shall not relieve the applicant or holder of the permit from the payment of other fees that are prescribed by law.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2efd40d8a16ce973751de503777a157b894022932c4a9dd51540641e27217015','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-258','GHBC-REQ-000258','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.11','1.11.6','GHBC-C-000099','The Head of Works is authorized to establish a refund policy.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc58bc50ccbde15357bbc7934a398828317d80afd8d409d3668d2f334a62a7da','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-259','GHBC-REQ-000259','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.1','GHBC-C-000100','Construction or work for which a permit is required shall be subject to inspection by the Head of Works and such construction or work shall remain visible and able to be accessed for inspection purposes until approved.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf034e820efc296d8fbda014d788325e40b12d6d2268656cb62e7b4345bde43a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-260','GHBC-REQ-000260','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.1','GHBC-C-000100','Approval as a result of an inspection shall not be construed to be an approval of a violation of the provisions of this Code or of other ordinances of the jurisdiction.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0baa6af2a3581a808a4b227344201ef913bb675dee29ff5f8ce716223a9d14ef','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-261','GHBC-REQ-000261','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.1','GHBC-C-000100','Inspections presuming to give authority to violate or cancel the provisions of this Code or of other ordinances of the jurisdiction shall not be valid.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','68cfd91df2aed982d5797d389535144f644573531490c4a65df6c78e13ed67ca','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-262','GHBC-REQ-000262','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.1','GHBC-C-000100','It shall be the duty of the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent to cause the work to remain visible and able to be accessed for inspection purposes.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32114c6f416dfa82aa7fc86e14fe9df93d7d48b6cc1e1dcddc76b890e8d4f8b2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-263','GHBC-REQ-000263','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.1','GHBC-C-000100','Neither the Head of Works nor the jurisdiction shall be liable for expense entailed in the removal or replacement of any material required to allow inspection.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3be58f59ca511855c59e284579456ba31b00d373d7a5cfd2a5633efb364e39c9','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-264','GHBC-REQ-000264','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.2','GHBC-C-000101','Before issuing a permit, the Head of Works is authorized to examine or cause to be examined','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b6752e9724f01f59271b7043b9fa9f6d13a92562fd5998012a37207453831bca','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-265','GHBC-REQ-000265','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.2','GHBC-C-000101','buildings, structures and sites for which an application has been filed.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','37e6378b91040c241f633289d6960661448f0bae00c3a4c37a3e100aabd6a2a2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-266','GHBC-REQ-000266','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3','GHBC-C-000102','The Head of Works, upon notification, shall make the inspections set forth in Clauses 1.12.3.1 through 1.12.3.11.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dada698ce1cf72e33873ae7f607b350a8bf71d4dbf3951fe0a56fdb4f6d0c922','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-267','GHBC-REQ-000267','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.1','GHBC-C-000103','Footing and foundation inspections shall be made after excavations for footings are complete and any required reinforcing steel is in place.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e548ca5f8c53ab1b03bf3d26553cea302ce6d45f711e4515758192520f3bf61','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-268','GHBC-REQ-000268','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.1','GHBC-C-000103','For concrete foundations, any required forms shall be in place prior to inspection.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71511dfa8534641d8e77639378156885d91105ad1687ee60cde56ff0806ac1a1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-269','GHBC-REQ-000269','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.1','GHBC-C-000103','Materials for the foundation shall be on the job, except where concrete is ready mixed in accordance with ASTM C94, the concrete need not be on the job.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','edb779908e7345d9d44f1a3fed65bdbe438618e52f391e7867388de169fd786b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-270','GHBC-REQ-000270','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.2','GHBC-C-000104','inspection.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f0932c1f74a45160084e935a84f5d3f294fe9c9e9e5ad2739001049b7bc85fca','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-271','GHBC-REQ-000271','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.2','GHBC-C-000104','Concrete slab and under-floor inspections shall be made after in-slab or under-floor reinforcing steel and building service equipment, conduit, piping accessories and other ancillary equipment items are in place, but before any concrete is placed or floor sheathing installed, including the subfloor.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','15e213d4b34fd9b1542e422baf1837fea3a5a4fd9acf3cae0ba43719a35127f0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-272','GHBC-REQ-000272','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.3','GHBC-C-000105','In flood hazard areas, upon placement of the lowest floor, including the basement, and prior to further vertical construction, the elevation certification required in this Code shall be submitted to the Head of Works.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae226890bc4af4517aad75e84d05906237d72515c0b693fbee1d9003055b28b0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-273','GHBC-REQ-000273','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.4','GHBC-C-000106','Framing inspections shall be made after the roof deck or sheathing, all framing, fire-blocking and bracing are in place and pipes, chimneys and vents to be concealed are complete and the rough electrical, plumbing, heating wires, pipes and ducts are approved.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39201fff684ba542b6d2d65749ab3aa622293524729c02f6dc762267cc39c0cf','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-274','GHBC-REQ-000274','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','panel product inspection.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c1b1823c083415bfcd6919f741989885cdbf9282e1a13ffa73f941b067a7f5f5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-275','GHBC-REQ-000275','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','Lath, gypsum board and gypsum panel product inspections shall be made after lathing, gypsum board and gypsum panel products, interior and exterior, are in place, but before any plastering is applied or gypsum board and gypsum panel product joints and fasteners are taped and finished.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b07a2737723214bd008ab87e0cec712cde3d8af56d4aab1cf869b41ee772d7a0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-276','GHBC-REQ-000276','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','1.12.3.6 Weather-exposed balcony and walking surface waterproofing.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5c2d89a32629f47dfeaedcc0491fa709f597eefddca96e6eb5a1a3e4583fd009','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-277','GHBC-REQ-000277','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','Where balconies or other elevated walking surfaces are exposed to water from direct or blowing rain, snow or irrigation, and the structural framing is protected by an impervious moisture barrier, all elements of the impervious moisture barrier system shall not be concealed until inspected and approved.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','432eba7b4ae68f24f09fee4fcbdc70a9a5a690999c80591c653cf7620053cc22','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-278','GHBC-REQ-000278','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','1.12.3.7 Fireand smoke-resistant penetrations.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd9fe14836ae36f2a5b571d1349b94c1193af5c13c475787539acd44365c96bc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-279','GHBC-REQ-000279','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','Protection of joints and penetrations in fireresistance-rated assemblies, smoke barriers and smoke partitions shall not be concealed from view until inspected and approved.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7e883df6eecbedda72673f3d4749463bfbb3b34439d46cddc5ccf42d282e7485','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-280','GHBC-REQ-000280','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.5','GHBC-C-000107','EXCEPTIONS: Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly. Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Gypsum board and gypsum panel products that are not part of a fire-resistancerated assembly or a shear assembly.","Where special inspections are provided in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5805a766257302101a9a25762a7214f66581b084864b1b9f05a59bf0e1047752','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-281','GHBC-REQ-000281','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.8','GHBC-C-000108','Inspections shall be made to determine compliance with Part 14 and shall include, but not be limited to, inspections for: envelope insulation R- and U-values, fenestration Uvalue, duct system R-value, and HVAC and water-heating equipment efficiency.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','80be87dadb3d16f3cd3bee9b9f75b10d0ef2f1144c1fbd6db26600afc7d61f8e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-282','GHBC-REQ-000282','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.9','GHBC-C-000109','In addition to the inspections specified in Clauses 1.12.3.1 through 1.12.3.8, the Head of Works is authorized to make or require other inspections of any construction work to ascertain compliance with the provisions of this Code that are enforced by the department of building safety.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c4b70741e29a295efcc9428c591838d3fcbd020a91d97b623969cb5bd874607','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-283','GHBC-REQ-000283','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.10','GHBC-C-000110','For special inspections, see Part 19.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b6eea1660b0ddbda5c8e35941c3f1b90ffa76714b16f62c8abf2a9b14cf48bcf','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-284','GHBC-REQ-000284','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.11','GHBC-C-000111','The final inspection shall be made after all work required by the building permit is completed.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d3555515961767a1ba1ddf35a306741f5432ee740dcd15ea3f4402cb444d9845','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-285','GHBC-REQ-000285','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.3.11.1','GHBC-C-000112','If located in a flood hazard area, documentation of the elevation of the lowest floor as required in this Code shall be submitted to the Head of Works prior to the final inspection.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c59bd1fbe3b62f9c295909d36dc00044bbcb4f458d6c4524a5844f36eeb9db4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-286','GHBC-REQ-000286','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.4','GHBC-C-000113','The Head of Works is authorized to accept reports of approved inspection agencies, provided that such agencies satisfy the requirements as to qualifications and reliability.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','101f3082c59fe3c9c8b01c3acd69d8918b03bda0a4f1e3bc4e91390b5d56a751','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-287','GHBC-REQ-000287','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.5','GHBC-C-000114','It shall be the duty of the holder of the building permit or their duly authorized agent to notify the Head of Works when work is ready for inspection.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5777ca647c90d50290631d843104d2355f87d90c7bacbf23bcd03cd413946674','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-288','GHBC-REQ-000288','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.5','GHBC-C-000114','It shall be the duty of the permit holder to provide access to and means for inspections of such work that are required by this Code.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bce8c8b9f7a3eba6822f1c7c42cb5d4b1a524faa15099186cd2c10cfd644be21','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-289','GHBC-REQ-000289','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.6','GHBC-C-000115','Work shall not be done beyond the point indicated in each successive inspection without first obtaining the approval of the Head of Works.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c9f19256a40c31f9e0cd92d38e12aafbfa227af5dae9c9261dd4c5910d218ede','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-290','GHBC-REQ-000290','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.6','GHBC-C-000115','The Head of Works, upon notification, shall make the requested inspections and shall either indicate the portion of the construction that is satisfactory as completed, or notify the permit holder or his or her agent wherein the same fails to comply with this Code.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','303f13c48237159f3be152cb380e2f7ab2873a724f8e9365ee87ca78ce03e206','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-291','GHBC-REQ-000291','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.12','1.12.6','GHBC-C-000115','Any portions that do not comply shall be corrected and such portion shall not be covered or concealed until authorized by the Head of Works.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b04d13e3f4f8c688b9665fc3031feae3de000552df8858239deea904567aa423','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-292','GHBC-REQ-000292','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.1','GHBC-C-000116','A building or structure shall not be used or occupied, and a change of occupancy of a building or structure or portion thereof shall not be made, until the Head of Works has issued a certificate of occupancy therefore as provided herein.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Certificates of occupancy are not required for work exempt from permits in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d4b92cd140c1f5ac68ca4f17a8f57d7d0dfbdddb50e0d845d0c2dd12de3ec41a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-293','GHBC-REQ-000293','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.1','GHBC-C-000116','Issuance of a certificate of occupancy shall not be construed as an approval of a violation of the provisions of this Code or legislation.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Certificates of occupancy are not required for work exempt from permits in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b225aa3e06782000c895afc4d1bf7e0b52ba54f14f71bef4b512677fc7d430b7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-294','GHBC-REQ-000294','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.1','GHBC-C-000116','EXCEPTIONS: Certificates of occupancy are not required for work exempt from permits in accordance with this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Certificates of occupancy are not required for work exempt from permits in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27ae56acf56b0e9928a2b862ee3490dc6f0038fe6feb7739ad7ce9a475ddf1e6','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
