('rowid-317','GHBC-REQ-000317','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.2','GHBC-C-000117','If an automatic sprinkler system is provided, whether the sprinkler system is required.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6866ec77fe5b4efccde0ecdff1590ea5f2e8c9d1b8a33d8c82591c2f6cea6bcf','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-318','GHBC-REQ-000318','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.2','GHBC-C-000117','12.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd1ef5d6c091dce29faccb07a5098466b6b18ed8435fbd570c093757fde894d9','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-319','GHBC-REQ-000319','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.2','GHBC-C-000117','Any special stipulations and conditions of the building permit.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c42911ed51f46221f7cc9759ff5dbfe3012dbde2affec78a149eacf403d9d92e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-320','GHBC-REQ-000320','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.3','GHBC-C-000118','The Head of Works is authorized to issue a temporary certificate of occupancy before the completion of the entire work covered by the permit, provided that such portion or portions shall be occupied safely.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9673a9a9f9b52b8f1fb6f542c23f9cfcfe11cbb691c47f3e28bdd28bb93b6e84','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-321','GHBC-REQ-000321','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.3','GHBC-C-000118','The Head of Works shall set a time period during which the temporary certificate of occupancy is valid.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc655cbf015a8a30cccb9130cc628cf375fa834ff206aa27298c6ab88bd1ded5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-322','GHBC-REQ-000322','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.13','1.13.4','GHBC-C-000119','The Head of Works is authorized to, in writing, suspend or revoke a certificate of occupancy or completion issued under the provisions of this Code wherever the certificate is issued in error, or on the basis of incorrect information supplied, or where it is determined that the building or structure or portion thereof is in violation of any ordinance or regulation or any of the provisions of this Code.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','364f9f9fbb2fb5b107b04387b83e91274b7af623a823dc6afebd55468b1f2b43','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-323','GHBC-REQ-000323','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.1','GHBC-C-000120','A person shall not make connections from a utility, source of energy, fuel or power to any building or system that is regulated by this Code for which a permit is required, until released by the Head of Works.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','37bec9a51305a9d3a4802315d8c117824833ff26c0c6d7b4f4ff65b4e20152aa','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-324','GHBC-REQ-000324','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.2','GHBC-C-000121','The Head of Works shall have the authority to authorize the temporary connection of the building or system to the utility, source of energy, fuel or power.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b94cbd65043878667b7d3d3f4bcba29bcdd2591aa6b9f31649cdc9974328c8f4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-325','GHBC-REQ-000325','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.2','GHBC-C-000121','1.14.3 Authority to disconnect service utilities.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6e36792a5b5372cecfcdd21c8b8a73bd106122e2c2824f4eb411c343b719fe30','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-326','GHBC-REQ-000326','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.2','GHBC-C-000121','The Head of Works shall have the authority to authorize disconnection of utility service to the building, structure or system regulated by this Code and the referenced Codes and standards set forth in Clause 1.1.4 in case of emergency where necessary to eliminate an immediate hazard to life or property or where such utility','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"andards set forth in Clause 1.1.4 in case of emergency where neces"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce31bef537143690919f7eb9298928d2b0dc984fb12cb5457d486b294560dcc1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-327','GHBC-REQ-000327','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.2','GHBC-C-000121','connection has been made without the approval required by Clause 1.14.1 or 1.14.2.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','503ceccc2f38ecdd764f79969145c3f73fb7f13efb2f2d1ecea3a01ae3ac8957','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-328','GHBC-REQ-000328','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.2','GHBC-C-000121','The Head of Works shall notify the serving utility, and wherever possible the owner and occupant of the building, structure or service system of the decision to disconnect prior to taking such action.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b057b4fcdbfe42b3b4d2292416f6d2a86841945e698332a8a168cb59909cd6c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-329','GHBC-REQ-000329','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.14','1.14.2','GHBC-C-000121','If not notified prior to disconnecting, the owner or occupant of the building, structure or service system shall be notified in writing, as soon as practical thereafter.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b58d4d0ec97ba3a64ce5d7abc682d9dc715a4d92d3377fbe7bd6275238cd9cd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-330','GHBC-REQ-000330','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.1','GHBC-C-000122','In order to hear and decide appeals of orders, decisions or determinations made by the Head of Works relative to the application and interpretation of this Code, there shall be a board of appeals.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c144134c7011eee5836389a49822a97d3dc653b5e03370e69ff9cbe9d2d9041','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-331','GHBC-REQ-000331','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.1','GHBC-C-000122','The board of appeals shall be appointed by the applicable governing authority and shall hold office at its pleasure.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eebf03979c71418c47afef6ef0397483117fd0947826dcece875dccc84a7e0a3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-332','GHBC-REQ-000332','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.1','GHBC-C-000122','The board shall adopt rules of procedure for conducting its business.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c6542f9054ca9ecd8eec6243b626ca0c71d2d990095b38db6c72a1ec976b193','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-333','GHBC-REQ-000333','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.1','GHBC-C-000123','for a Board of Appeal, the authority having jurisdiction may create such a board and if created it shall have the following establishment and terms of reference.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','68cc7cba871e32a1bf967283187ae3add60bc763d40dc83e6efdd37ceef75573','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-334','GHBC-REQ-000334','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.2','GHBC-C-000124','An application for appeal shall be based on a claim that the true intent of this Code or the rules legally adopted thereunder have been incorrectly interpreted, the provisions of this Code do not fully apply or an equally good or better form of construction is proposed.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da610c25b796f82a8aa8b98cee2c129fdcf975e14b04480b5d2e02c9a30a2f2d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-335','GHBC-REQ-000335','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.2','GHBC-C-000124','The board shall not have authority to waive requirements of this Code.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5422dbff2e891c6bf6a5902fdd079453ae5c6b51ba93cdaf1668490cea00116c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-336','GHBC-REQ-000336','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.3','GHBC-C-000125','The board of appeals shall consist of members who are qualified by experience and training to pass on matters pertaining to building construction and are not employees of the jurisdiction.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b906ffb78536844994d52ec0e1b2a2cc84e1c5e83405212ae20586ffb15f394a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-337','GHBC-REQ-000337','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.4','GHBC-C-000126','The Board of Appeal shall consist of at least 7 members, each with a minimum of 15 years professional experience and good standing members of the Ghana Institute of Architects, Ghana Institute of Planners, Ghana Institution of Engineering and the Ghana Institution of Surveyors, plus other members','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":7,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"rd of Appeal shall consist of at least 7 members, each with a minimum "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":15,"unit":null,"operator":"minimum of","context":" least 7 members, each with a minimum of 15 years professional experience"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"eal shall consist of at least 7 members, each with a minimum of"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2eb285bab8a4b77f48fa6662d16077efa9fa9de653851d59fa8a1e1577ee62b1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-338','GHBC-REQ-000338','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.15','1.15.4','GHBC-C-000126','from other government agencies (e.g. Ghana National Fire Service, Environmental Protection Agency, etc.)','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3823c434664f1f21ce719cfef14c4075f7a8e1ea0e2b97cb4fc254b83e8a6c39','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-339','GHBC-REQ-000339','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.16','1.16.1','GHBC-C-000127','It shall be unlawful for any person, firm or corporation to erect, construct, alter, extend, repair, move, remove, demolish or occupy any building, structure or equipment regulated by this Code, or cause same to be done, in conflict with or in violation of any of the provisions of this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','034f8fbd67f43c7af46eb3050ca4c977febba786e2ba1b044af24f2da96dfa9c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-340','GHBC-REQ-000340','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.16','1.16.2','GHBC-C-000128','The Head of Works is authorized to serve a notice of violation or order on the person responsible for the erection, construction, alteration, extension, repair, moving, removal, demolition or occupancy of a building or structure in violation of the provisions of this Code, or in violation of a permit or certificate issued under the provisions of this Code.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','82e0eb68911c9a618f54f6b2605e1bdb742483a321ff75d1b730ab3ae210faef','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-341','GHBC-REQ-000341','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.16','1.16.2','GHBC-C-000128','Such order shall direct the discontinuance of the illegal action or condition and the abatement of the violation.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad25732c970e1b3fe519ec3f99c6b42dd1af17241490c88b8f72622ec5c476fb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-342','GHBC-REQ-000342','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.16','1.16.3','GHBC-C-000129','If the notice of violation is not complied with promptly, the Head of Works is authorized to request the legal counsel of the jurisdiction to institute the appropriate proceeding at law or in equity to restrain, correct or abate such violation, or to require the removal or termination of the unlawful occupancy of the building or structure in violation of the provisions of this Code or of the order or direction made pursuant thereto.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2401255ccfc1b1b7c3caa59d2c4d33e5a5751be13ffa912eaa51f05382122918','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-343','GHBC-REQ-000343','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.16','1.16.4','GHBC-C-000130','Any person who violates a provision of this Code or fails to comply with any of the requirements thereof or who erects, constructs, alters or repairs a building or structure in violation of the approved construction documents or directive of the Head of Works, or of a permit or certificate issued under the provisions of this Code, shall be subject to penalties as prescribed by law.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72c8c1d47c8ec2d619d863f0c80acd22aecbef9c14fa87919cda94868a220e65','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-344','GHBC-REQ-000344','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.17','1.17.1','GHBC-C-000131','Where the Head of Works finds any work regulated by this Code being performed in a manner either contrary to the provisions of this Code or dangerous or unsafe, the Head of Works is authorized to issue a stop work order.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b0a2f04e9ea84f67cf94d540464054d54a39c55d054318aeadbb8973716e86fa','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-345','GHBC-REQ-000345','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.17','1.17.2','GHBC-C-000132','The stop work order shall be in writing and shall be given to the owner of the property involved, the owner‘s authorized agent or the person performing the work.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c597a9dd84a08515b3aa4cf20b0ecc01408c7ed9c46780be81e1b526ee6ecc80','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-346','GHBC-REQ-000346','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.17','1.17.2','GHBC-C-000132','Upon issuance of a stop work order, the cited work shall immediately cease.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','726427b9771adfc614ea365bc9789bc90ad0a058c43106cab8894c408a80e4f2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-347','GHBC-REQ-000347','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.17','1.17.2','GHBC-C-000132','The stop work order shall state the reason for the order and the conditions under which the cited work will be permitted to resume.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1ae023d0aa09c0e2bd98b7ea3d00362697d882db5cbd57f38121ad6be5a42c21','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-348','GHBC-REQ-000348','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.17','1.17.3','GHBC-C-000133','Any person who shall continue any work after having been served with a stop work order, except such work as that person is directed to perform to remove a violation or unsafe condition, shall be subject to penalties as prescribed by law.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb8e1ccdd07f40ac9db67581df77e3414d3bd764509519848c2d2f58f75fa073','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-349','GHBC-REQ-000349','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.1','GHBC-C-000134','Structures or existing equipment that are or hereafter become unsafe, insanitary or deficient because of inadequate means of escape facilities, inadequate light and ventilation, or that constitute a fire hazard, or are otherwise dangerous to human life or the public welfare, or that involve illegal or improper occupancy or inadequate maintenance, shall be deemed an unsafe condition.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','99823b3c2c2d700ca1e0c612e4b5947bed1d0509e1a8540c9f1e4ff3ff330334','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-350','GHBC-REQ-000350','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.1','GHBC-C-000134','Unsafe structures shall be taken down and removed or made safe, as the Head of Works deems necessary and as provided for in this clause.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ec88f15bcbd60b30493ac64c6d933ed2d2d5173867972c0f4b717d429390dc9','2026-08-15 13:56:12');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-351','GHBC-REQ-000351','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.1','GHBC-C-000134','A vacant structure that is not secured against entry shall be deemed unsafe.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54faee0cece0a0817efe1f6ce789cd786dccbe65b97c34b953f9a6b583cb66cf','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-352','GHBC-REQ-000352','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.2','GHBC-C-000135','The Head of Works shall cause a report to be filed on an unsafe condition.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3d52ab84e58b891f3f628bdefdf9fdcf373e4b4145fc297c479363fa9f2f3d6','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-353','GHBC-REQ-000353','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.2','GHBC-C-000135','The report shall state the occupancy of the structure and the nature of the unsafe condition.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6922a60e8839ae2a0ff5f9ab33b6c47759ec9786081fe6dd97dc4b188f386f3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-354','GHBC-REQ-000354','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.3','GHBC-C-000136','If an unsafe condition is found, the Head of Works shall serve on the owner, agent or person in control of the structure, a written notice that describes the condition deemed unsafe and specifies the required repairs or improvements to be made to abate the unsafe condition, or that requires the unsafe structure to be demolished within a stipulated time.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6f3214f6dbc2740df530f887686ddeff990f915e88642fc4b545519c4cfbfb01','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-355','GHBC-REQ-000355','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.3','GHBC-C-000136','Such notice shall require the person thus notified to declare immediately to the Head of Works acceptance or rejection of the terms of the order.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6942a37228fccda5d62e9778d9a1b9eb93080c6c564ce3b45c3cbc560a50bcfc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-356','GHBC-REQ-000356','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.4','GHBC-C-000137','Such notice shall be deemed properly served if a copy thereof is: delivered to the owner personally; sent by certified or registered mail addressed to the owner at the last known address with the return receipt requested; or delivered in any other manner as prescribed by local law.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c12390b8c961262fa5340b0cdf4d2b5bccf96b7bb3cd972bd74522bad69c15b1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-357','GHBC-REQ-000357','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.4','GHBC-C-000137','If the certified or registered letter is returned showing that the letter was not delivered, a copy thereof shall be posted in a conspicuous place in or about the structure affected by such notice.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d1250fa24f4c30059b0c9c204fab5a501b2d19963e49c62ed1b87478f3cb6eb9','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-358','GHBC-REQ-000358','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.4','GHBC-C-000137','Service of such notice in the foregoing manner on the owner‘s agent or on the person responsible for the structure shall constitute service of notice on the owner.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f609c85665edaba3d9e47519f43fc1ee669fd791758821962103ffb8691e9951','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-359','GHBC-REQ-000359','GS 1207:2018',1,'1.18','1.18.5','GHBC-C-000138','Where the structure or equipment determined to be unsafe by the Head of Works is restored to a safe condition, to the extent that repairs, alterations or additions are made or a change of occupancy occurs during the restoration of the structure, such repairs, alterations, additions and change of occupancy shall comply with the requirements of the International Existing Building Code.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','91612907ad292817c1b42a17ddbe19984ffed30b0e66d423485b76c3779f3dd2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-360','GHBC-REQ-000360','GS 1207:2018',2,'2.1','2.1.1','GHBC-C-000139','Unless otherwise expressly stated, the following words and terms shall, for the purposes of this Code, have the meanings shown in this part.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e59a34a9528e67fbdd399f537e1ae7462b479d30657baa82d9d6aa5c2d943240','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-361','GHBC-REQ-000361','GS 1207:2018',2,'2.1','2.1.2','GHBC-C-000140','Words used in the present tense include the future; words stated in the masculine gender include the feminine and neuter; the singular number includes the plural and the plural, the singular.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8164bdb477433784e7bcfd293dc1132fa2068d92c78274b5cd06c96d4285efb0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-362','GHBC-REQ-000362','GS 1207:2018',2,'2.1','2.1.3','GHBC-C-000141','Where terms are not defined in this Code and are defined in the Ghana Fire Code such terms shall have the meanings ascribed to them as in those Codes.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6ba30099ca835721c8c37763229008d1009f93abbba03a442664ecb379af7131','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
