('rowid-1711','GHBC-REQ-001711','GS 1207:2018',3,'3.8','3.8.1','GHBC-C-000740','Institutional Group I occupancy includes, among others, the use of a building or structure, or a portion thereof, in which care or supervision is provided to persons who are or are not capable of self-preservation without physical assistance or in which persons are detained for penal or correctional purposes or in which the liberty of the occupants is restricted.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','986b45996d40a970c9adfad419f5bc5518136a53b23e92648f459ee1f644be1d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
