('rowid-1902','GHBC-REQ-001902','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.7.4','GHBC-C-000814','Rooms or areas containing controls for airconditioning systems, automatic fireextinguishing systems, automatic sprinkler systems or other detection, suppression or control elements shall be identified for use by the fire department.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9b3f9d5f2b2012ff0e6135009ca5b4c96358adbcf380ef327fd2052dfce3b0a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1903','GHBC-REQ-001903','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8','GHBC-C-000815','Covered mall buildings, open mall buildings and each tenant space within a mall building shall be provided with means of escape as required by this clause and this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','904894d25ed006b55b618ce7cd77e70d8f94c57d4ba98dac50ddca36d6cc50ca','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1904','GHBC-REQ-001904','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8','GHBC-C-000815','Where there is a conflict between the requirements of this Code and the requirements of Clauses 4.2.8.1 through 4.2.8.8, the requirements of Clauses 4.2.8.1 through 4.2.8.8 shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8.8,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"f Clauses 4.2.8.1 through 4.2.8.8 shall apply."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d218f0635a9fbf084482b95ff4f486ee4079b41bea917dfc9945e9b59cc1569b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1905','GHBC-REQ-001905','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.1','GHBC-C-000816','For the purpose of providing required escape, malls are permitted to be considered as corridors but need not comply with the requirements of this Code where the width of the mall is as specified in this clause.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1939d23cf3706d53ca2ffa859ef300896d9fd2c6fb5ae50a5d6a73de6fe4110c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1906','GHBC-REQ-001906','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.1.1','GHBC-C-000817','The aggregate clear escape width of the mall in either a covered or open mall building shall be not less than 6096 mm (20 feet).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6096,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"r open mall building shall be not less than 6096 mm (20 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6096,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ilding shall be not less than 6096 mm (20 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"all be not less than 6096 mm (20 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9fe24092da6d9ef1d662400b2656332082683b6d022b1c22b14e80c5717b5556','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1907','GHBC-REQ-001907','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.1.1','GHBC-C-000817','The mall width shall be sufficient to accommodate the occupant load served.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2bd6a49672f4cac8c50aa58c4d063acd3bf5fdae61d91ff256d8efb08aaa156b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1908','GHBC-REQ-001908','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.1.1','GHBC-C-000817','Any portion of the minimum required aggregate escape width shall be not less than 3048 mm (10 feet) measured to a height of 2438 mm (8 feet) between any projection of a tenant space bordering the mall and the nearest kiosk, vending machine, bench, display opening, food court or other obstruction to means of escape travel.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3048,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"gregate escape width shall be not less than 3048 mm (10 feet) measured to a he"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3048,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" width shall be not less than 3048 mm (10 feet) measured to a heigh"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"all be not less than 3048 mm (10 feet) measured to a height of 2438"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2438,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"feet) measured to a height of 2438 mm (8 feet) between any projecti"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"sured to a height of 2438 mm (8 feet) between any projection of a "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67888976f69b6a9f47623337cc6ce2aff07511a97d390f99f89cc7a9e5b1f9fe','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1909','GHBC-REQ-001909','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2','GHBC-C-000818','The occupant load permitted in any individual tenant space in a covered or open mall building shall be determined as required by this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','adf4d78b7f4a846a0659e20610595b1639aef443a303914e1d803a36d23617f4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1910','GHBC-REQ-001910','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2','GHBC-C-000818','Means of escape requirements for individual tenant spaces shall be based on the occupant load thus determined.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d57a8a74269b6716a787420d9d1a39bfc79c92ab3ede016c9a01c11e32848e4b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1911','GHBC-REQ-001911','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.1','GHBC-C-000819','In determining required means of escape of the mall, the number of occupants for whom means','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','49b384b16ab6da162d8ea8990650fc643da24ea6cd0274024477081fcaaedf49','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1912','GHBC-REQ-001912','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.1','GHBC-C-000819','of escape are to be provided shall be based on gross leasable area of the covered or open mall building (excluding anchor buildings) and the occupant load factor as determined by Equation 4-1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d76d11498aa0f517361e007724959bcbdc88cf63cf984e9c4a56ceba84f73d1e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1913','GHBC-REQ-001913','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.1','GHBC-C-000819','OLF = (0.00007)(GLA) + 25','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e82661adba80b34476447908ab0083c04150818e83f9b5266b4f93e8fdfcbaa0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1914','GHBC-REQ-001914','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.1','GHBC-C-000819','Where:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1bb50e55ed0680cd5a816f2b7a5ce706d42be42908001411c0ef20d10bfb1bde','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1915','GHBC-REQ-001915','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.1','GHBC-C-000819','OLF = The occupant load factor (square feet pe GLA = The gross leasable area (square feet).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b1623c427d3a230fdd82e8cd9a59b22042d0ed334dc65da613fa5f8db1a334b6','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1916','GHBC-REQ-001916','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.1','GHBC-C-000819','EXCEPTIONS: Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Tenant spaces attached to a covered or open mall building but with a means of escape system that is totally independent of the open mall of an open mall building or of a covered mall building shall not be considered as gross leasable area for determining the required means of escape for the mall building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','75312907b6da9896ccf658dcc8ba681054c935e191e27585aadeceda3d652551','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1917','GHBC-REQ-001917','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.2','GHBC-C-000820','The occupant load factor (OLF) is not required to be less than 30 and shall not exceed 50.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":30,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"r (OLF) is not required to be less than 30 and shall not exceed 50."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7f12ba223c1d490c1d20833b937e110f9d96860fd4c9d71409769f35997726a3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1918','GHBC-REQ-001918','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.3','GHBC-C-000821','The occupant load of anchor buildings opening into the mall shall not be included in computing the total number of occupants for the mall.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','572ba0630f4c5daf51449855cb5db9e99afdd7c309574075a8555605fec1107d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1919','GHBC-REQ-001919','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.4','GHBC-C-000822','The occupant load of a food court shall be determined in accordance with this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','59982f42096b7bac8fcd5c8214ce2f460e06fbeafa43b7b1872cd422609bbb26','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1920','GHBC-REQ-001920','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.2.4','GHBC-C-000822','For the purposes of determining the means of escape requirements for the mall, the food court occupant load shall be added to the occupant load of the covered or open mall building as calculated in Clause 4.2.8.2.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da6a363025e5370c61e65261b510ea37696b66b1ca93398ae297dfd4e029393e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1921','GHBC-REQ-001921','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.3','GHBC-C-000823','Wherever the distance of travel to the mall from any location within a tenant space used by persons other than employees is greater than 22 860 mm (75 feet) or the tenant space has an occupant load of 50 or more, not fewer than two means of escape shall be provided.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":860,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" employees is greater than 22 860 mm (75 feet) or the tenant space"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"es is greater than 22 860 mm (75 feet) or the tenant space has an o"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','617d18c757270fb80c5a2daee405761466aa741a875eadf4a17647bb14db5908','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1922','GHBC-REQ-001922','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4','GHBC-C-000824','Assembly occupancies with an occupant load of 500 or more located within a covered mall building shall be so located such that their entrance will be immediately adjacent to a principal entrance to the mall and shall have not less than one-half of their required means of escape opening directly to the exterior of the covered mall building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4571b6367c6373f769b882a1e7c3b8125363cdff892ca01d43b9d7a271354705','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1923','GHBC-REQ-001923','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4','GHBC-C-000824','Assembly occupancies','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3354de545e251366e6fa20c51e55278cfe1c0a11de6fb30e1b45f784723cf2e8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1924','GHBC-REQ-001924','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4','GHBC-C-000824','located within the perimeter line of an open mall building shall be permitted to have their main exit open to the open mall.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a4314760cde3562cd97b6a6d62e339e3514124903862fcb0ca393e85a895b49e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1925','GHBC-REQ-001925','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4.1','GHBC-C-000825','Required means of escape for anchor buildings shall be provided independently from the mall means of escape system.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','50543b23d244366c8fffb7066656e3aaddd9fa10a98b0b485981b93fd231d41a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1926','GHBC-REQ-001926','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4.1','GHBC-C-000825','The occupant load of anchor buildings opening into the mall shall not be included in determining means of escape requirements for the mall.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','196939978d8a02ebb6d2b98d919c6da182a2c81c7e038489e66903f75b4dd900','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1927','GHBC-REQ-001927','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4.1','GHBC-C-000825','The path of escape travel of malls shall not exit through anchor buildings.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','78c33869fed879298f155d66b06b74a3ee14a58df99e6abecf5be4d5dcb3ae60','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1928','GHBC-REQ-001928','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.4.1','GHBC-C-000825','Malls terminating at an anchor building where other means of escape has not been provided shall be considered as a deadend mall.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9697ad025a3787b47fb8ac194918158063c8710ff8ebc0d27ba413cc9d7c8c27','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1929','GHBC-REQ-001929','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.5','GHBC-C-000826','Within each individual tenant space in a covered or open mall building, the distance of travel from any point to an exit or entrance to the mall shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":"entrance to the mall shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":960,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"e not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d8cb4bb2dcfbc927ca9a16efb69b5fca4879368965a9df3643050eafd0dd4cd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1930','GHBC-REQ-001930','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.5','GHBC-C-000826','The distance of travel from any point within a mall of a covered mall building to an exit shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":" building to an exit shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":960,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"e not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','919603de6c57c2167261e4d01a6e82cb5df7219cf54f4da4cd6ea90fdad51789','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1931','GHBC-REQ-001931','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.5','GHBC-C-000826','The maximum distance of travel from any point within an open mall to the perimeter line of the open mall building shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":"e open mall building shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":960,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" shall be not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"e not greater than 60 960 mm (200 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a46f588e7f54324d7b1c9375ce566703a672199a604bd462d914c8d967120fe7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1932','GHBC-REQ-001932','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.6','GHBC-C-000827','Where more than one exit is required, they shall be so arranged that it is possible to travel in either direction from any point in a mall of a covered mall building to separate exits or from any point in an open mall of an open mall building to two separate locations on the perimeter line, provided that neither location is an exterior wall of an anchor building or parking garage.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Access to exits is permitted by way of a dead-end mall that does not exceed a length equal to twice the width of the mall measured at the narrowest location within the dead-end portion of the mall."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','13027d31dfe27fbff12ad8196c38b6a965dbfeb7881473faa47254437168a96d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1933','GHBC-REQ-001933','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.6','GHBC-C-000827','The width of an exit passageway or corridor from a mall shall be not less than 1676 mm (66 inches).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Access to exits is permitted by way of a dead-end mall that does not exceed a length equal to twice the width of the mall measured at the narrowest location within the dead-end portion of the mall."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1676,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"corridor from a mall shall be not less than 1676 mm (66 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1676,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"a mall shall be not less than 1676 mm (66 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":66,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"all be not less than 1676 mm (66 inches)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','80feb20387fdc35d45d09e2d0f788216e0b4b3aa1b802d6e953606defaf4a34f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1934','GHBC-REQ-001934','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.6','GHBC-C-000827','EXCEPTIONS: Access to exits is permitted by way of a dead-end mall that does not exceed a length equal to twice the width of the mall measured at the narrowest location within the dead-end portion of the mall.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Access to exits is permitted by way of a dead-end mall that does not exceed a length equal to twice the width of the mall measured at the narrowest location within the dead-end portion of the mall."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','85ad0d0d3b70fd376a46bc26119359b944dc733455c68aac08d00bf75b98f532','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-1935','GHBC-REQ-001935','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.2','4.2.8.6.1','GHBC-C-000828','Where exit passageways provide a secondary means of escape from a tenant space, the exit passageways shall be constructed in accordance with this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','114b3b347b3609662b70fa385bda9cc0a5b37aa5663ec34f8f9090b446a009b5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
