('rowid-2153','GHBC-REQ-002153','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.1','GHBC-C-000888','A building having a floor level more than 18 288 mm (60 feet) below the finished floor of the lowest level of exit discharge shall be divided into not fewer than two compartments of approximately equal size.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The lowest storey need not be compartmented where the area is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and has an occupant load of less than 10."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":18,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"building having a floor level more than 18 288 mm (60 feet) below the fi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":288,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ng a floor level more than 18 288 mm (60 feet) below the finished "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"or level more than 18 288 mm (60 feet) below the finished floor of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4d9477f9fd2f7172d3499c0cae2916c76d865d45c24566ac5b415a32066561d4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2154','GHBC-REQ-002154','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.1','GHBC-C-000888','Such compartmentation shall extend through the highest level of exit discharge serving the underground portions of the building and all levels below.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The lowest storey need not be compartmented where the area is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and has an occupant load of less than 10."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b4dd27983a674b2c5778e138003199d8888e540cc1cb3cfda838ae8dc05068b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2155','GHBC-REQ-002155','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.1','GHBC-C-000888','EXCEPTIONS: The lowest storey need not be compartmented where the area is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and has an occupant load of less than 10.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The lowest storey need not be compartmented where the area is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and has an occupant load of less than 10."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":139,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":"mpartmented where the area is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and ha"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":10,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":") and has an occupant load of less than 10."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":139,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":" the area is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and has a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1500,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"a is not greater than 139 m2 (1,500 square feet) and has an occupan"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f298350cdba55d7011892ab5bb21bfff2449aafcb1af5e1f41b03a2cc22e69b3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2156','GHBC-REQ-002156','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.2','GHBC-C-000889','The compartments shall be separated from each other by a smoke barrier in accordance with Clause 709.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','daae48036e95a093c41e3921abd1d60a111e4f52f0467e6526b445dbc479686c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2157','GHBC-REQ-002157','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.2','GHBC-C-000889','Penetrations between the two compartments shall be limited to plumbing and electrical piping and conduit that are firestopped in accordance with this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','10fb139039162b9841d905506b0353b68dd01ecd4032ab178a00998ef76f4cdb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2158','GHBC-REQ-002158','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.2','GHBC-C-000889','Doorways shall be protected by fire door assemblies that comply with this Code automatic-closing by smoke detection in accordance with this Code and installed in accordance with this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e69cc9428daa88822548f5f4a248a8ab81c1d4154cd038dd3ece3156d9e3b0f0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2159','GHBC-REQ-002159','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.5','4.5.4.2','GHBC-C-000889','Where provided, each compartment shall have an air supply and an exhaust system independent of the other compartments.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6ac30074ec7c1b166d61d8afbc4520ff62155e1b860eff276c4011085e606efc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
