('rowid-2228','GHBC-REQ-002228','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.6','4.6.2.8.1','GHBC-C-000912','For the purpose of this clause, rooms or spaces that are not part of the living space of a dwelling unit and that communicate directly with a private garage through openings shall be considered to be part of the private garage.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Elevation of the ignition source is not required for appliances that are listed as flammable vapour ignition resistant."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e196a76003c1cddf555bacd542aed00ebbc713671fd2e80b197d1166827190f8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
