('rowid-2518','GHBC-REQ-002518','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.7','4.7.9','GHBC-C-000988','Corridor smoke detection is not required where sleeping room doors are equipped with automatic door-closing devices with integral smoke detectors on the unit sides installed in accordance with their listing, provided that the integral detectors perform the required alerting function.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abd2f0d555e1dc8ae26466a617e0b1863c092cd863d99740861189ef19c8978d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2519','GHBC-REQ-002519','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.7','4.7.10','GHBC-C-000989','Grounds are permitted to be fenced and gates therein are permitted to be equipped with locks, provided that safe dispersal areas having 2.8 m2 (30 net square feet) for bed and stretcher care recipients and 0.56 m2 (6 net square feet) for ambulatory care recipients and other occupants are located between the building and the fence.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.8,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"t safe dispersal areas having 2.8 m2 (30 net square feet) for bed "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.56,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"stretcher care recipients and 0.56 m2 (6 net square feet) for ambul"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ddc03e6d99fff9401ade5a723661b353a9ff7592e832277bef7cd6179ec1d9bb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2520','GHBC-REQ-002520','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.7','4.7.10','GHBC-C-000989','Such provided safe dispersal areas shall be located not less than 15 240 mm (50 feet) from the building they serve.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":15,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"persal areas shall be located not less than 15 240 mm (50 feet) from the bui"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":240,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"l be located not less than 15 240 mm (50 feet) from the building t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ated not less than 15 240 mm (50 feet) from the building they serve"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e21cc191e5aa037a49262c21adae83c0f16a5e2755585578e7e4996b3c5ca700','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2521','GHBC-REQ-002521','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.7','4.7.11','GHBC-C-000990','In Group I-2 occupancies, the essential electrical system for electrical components, equipment and systems shall be designed and constructed in accordance with the provisions of Part 28 and the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3edc13e55e65556947eb16f6c820d782f912bd68561fd7edc041b171b275e30d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2522','GHBC-REQ-002522','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.1','GHBC-C-000991','Occupancies in Group I-3 shall comply with the provisions of Clauses 4.8.1 through 4.8.11 and other applicable provisions of Clause 3.8.5.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":-3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"Occupancies in Group I-3 shall comply with the provision"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2e07495361832f6ae561db3b06b4cedd03b03d2342df5794568eb1acae5ed5df','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2523','GHBC-REQ-002523','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.2','GHBC-C-000992','Buildings or portions of buildings in Group I-3 occupancies where security operations necessitate the locking of required means of escape shall be permitted to be classified as a different occupancy.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["It is permissible to exit through a horizontal exit into other contiguous occupancies that do not conform to detention and correctional occupancy escape provisions but that do comply with requirements set forth in the appropriate occupancy, as long as the occupancy is not a Group H use."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5086e03e77824eb53a6c3f6b692c6e13b226bdf3acd906c70e0c797e5ee0f7ac','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2524','GHBC-REQ-002524','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.2','GHBC-C-000992','Occupancies classified as other than Group I-3 shall meet the applicable requirements of this Code for that occupancy where provisions are made for the release of occupants at all times.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["It is permissible to exit through a horizontal exit into other contiguous occupancies that do not conform to detention and correctional occupancy escape provisions but that do comply with requirements set forth in the appropriate occupancy, as long as the occupancy is not a Group H use."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":-3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"assified as other than Group I-3 shall meet the applicable requi"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','46e20d1c35c543cc1b360c3c047d60ae53d939a4a99646d821e1677e36a3f906','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2525','GHBC-REQ-002525','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.2','GHBC-C-000992','Means of escape from detention and correctional occupancies that traverse other use areas shall, as a minimum, conform to requirements for detention and correctional occupancies.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["It is permissible to exit through a horizontal exit into other contiguous occupancies that do not conform to detention and correctional occupancy escape provisions but that do comply with requirements set forth in the appropriate occupancy, as long as the occupancy is not a Group H use."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e7320d31f877e47c2668d6ad011f463817bf4c2a770569e6dd2258cc44971a7d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2526','GHBC-REQ-002526','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.2','GHBC-C-000992','EXCEPTIONS: It is permissible to exit through a horizontal exit into other contiguous occupancies that do not conform to detention and correctional occupancy escape provisions but that do comply with requirements set forth in the appropriate occupancy, as long as the occupancy is not a Group H use.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["It is permissible to exit through a horizontal exit into other contiguous occupancies that do not conform to detention and correctional occupancy escape provisions but that do comply with requirements set forth in the appropriate occupancy, as long as the occupancy is not a Group H use."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2bbb4d5ef617c9f53abaee865974b8a654f2bd0d3056d48f89afed07426a81fd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2527','GHBC-REQ-002527','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.3','GHBC-C-000993','Except as modified or as provided for in this clause, the means of escape provisions of Part 11 shall apply.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":11,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" of escape provisions of Part 11 shall apply."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bd09eea25b73421eb3979a088267022668aafbdd44cce26fb9e8ee5d39dce63','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
