('rowid-2604','GHBC-REQ-002604','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.7','GHBC-C-001014','The glazing shall be in a gasketed frame and installed in such a manner that the framing system will deflect without breaking (loading) the glass before the sprinkler system operates.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6fd498e89846a72b2279e0132773cfb3437d82bf5ceb100e19d8ccfef2b0bf91','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
