('rowid-2606','GHBC-REQ-002606','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.7','GHBC-C-001014','Obstructions, such as curtain rods, drapery traverse rods, curtains, drapes or similar materials shall not be installed between the automatic sprinklers and the glazing.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ad58c47ef47054ecde4fbcb926dcce91042c9c5c6b870bd0542c9dc798a3bbf8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2607','GHBC-REQ-002607','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8','GHBC-C-001015','Sleeping areas and any contiguous day room, group activity space or other common spaces where residents are housed shall be separated from other spaces in accordance with Clauses 4.8.8.1 through 4.8.8.4.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d97c52b36d1399526d38ea5d612efd1965aa6936a37912b10b69219c4677384b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2608','GHBC-REQ-002608','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.1','GHBC-C-001016','Each sleeping area in Occupancy Conditions 3 and 4 shall be separated from the adjacent common spaces by a smoke-tight partition where the distance of travel from the sleeping area through the common space to the corridor exceeds 15 240 mm (50 feet).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"in Occupancy Conditions 3 and 4 shall be separated from the adj"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":240,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ce to the corridor exceeds 15 240 mm (50 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"e corridor exceeds 15 240 mm (50 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','441363e82ecd15f4a4d4e0e6f46a76740ec36e0086c30d32df491c06f3860d3a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2609','GHBC-REQ-002609','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.2','GHBC-C-001017','Each sleeping area in Occupancy Condition 5 shall be separated from adjacent sleeping areas, corridors and common spaces by a smoke-tight partition.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"g area in Occupancy Condition 5 shall be separated from adjacen"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d53cb68d4b42f11eddafada11e57df759a55697f3134b6a42ea10de177a2805c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2610','GHBC-REQ-002610','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.2','GHBC-C-001017','Additionally, common spaces shall be separated from the corridor by a smoke-tight partition.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d589009717ddaf0e9eacf6a5029c6f609085bfd2ea7df1ef74f6305389c776b3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2611','GHBC-REQ-002611','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.3','GHBC-C-001018','The aggregate area of openings in a solid sleeping room face in Occupancy Conditions 2, 3, 4 and 5 shall not exceed 0.77 m2 (120 square inches).','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"upancy Conditions 2, 3, 4 and 5 shall not exceed 0.77 m2 (120 s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.77,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":", 3, 4 and 5 shall not exceed 0.77 m2 (120 square inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":120,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"d 5 shall not exceed 0.77 m2 (120 square inches)."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fd7e5a7dee97414ac299b5ac289344a05cb3dd71a324a8bdb07e74bd0d2ac216','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2612','GHBC-REQ-002612','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.3','GHBC-C-001018','The aggregate area shall include all openings including door undercuts, food passes and grilles.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','20ca15b7eebccf6249af5f71dd974abf0648ada67332387d93610130d15c3069','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
