('rowid-2614','GHBC-REQ-002614','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.3','GHBC-C-001018','In Occupancy Condition 5, the openings shall be closeable from the room side.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1e5fc22bbf38593135bd722fcb8aaa34ee2db4212d164373da1469ff2428c639','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2615','GHBC-REQ-002615','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.4','GHBC-C-001019','Doors in openings in partitions required to be smoke tight by Clause 4.8.8 shall be substantial doors, of construction that will resist the passage of smoke.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8.8,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"to be smoke tight by Clause 4.8.8 shall be substantial doors, of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','084e5a990af271faf819d6cbe4d9cfe46762d950cbd94e16da229e1765c8a6c5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2616','GHBC-REQ-002616','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.8.4','GHBC-C-001019','Latches and door closures are not required on cell doors.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1bb323c802d379a50a131494fcf2d43fdb82edc547ceeceea633121997b0d3ca','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2617','GHBC-REQ-002617','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.9','GHBC-C-001020','For the purposes of this clause, a windowless building or portion of a building is one with nonopenable windows, windows not readily breakable or without windows.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ac420d591971434cf14d58276c8560134e47420756107fe62b2833d13569ef6','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
