('rowid-2620','GHBC-REQ-002620','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.8','4.8.11','GHBC-C-001022','Group I-3 occupancies shall be equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Clause 10.3.2.6.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','438bbcf090fd535e7cfb26ec6b9c6e295dd5ef721f835d2728d0df8c7cd131f4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2621','GHBC-REQ-002621','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.1','GHBC-C-001023','The provisions of Clauses 4.9.1 through 4.9.5 shall apply to rooms in which ribbon-type cellulose acetate or other safety film is utilized in conjunction with electric arc, xenon or other light-source projection equipment that develops hazardous gases, dust or radiation.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.5,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ns of Clauses 4.9.1 through 4.9.5 shall apply to rooms in which r"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','896759c560ec6ca3107b0127bc270c9f01551c33202e6128587cf69e11e82bf7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2622','GHBC-REQ-002622','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.1','GHBC-C-001023','Where cellulose nitrate film is utilized or stored, such rooms shall comply with the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e7d0585d6bd0060d5a1813fcf0a7a15f776095bf94de59fa1f50ce6ac3f09f84','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2623','GHBC-REQ-002623','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.1.1','GHBC-C-001024','Every motion picture machine projecting film as mentioned within the scope of this clause shall be enclosed in a projection room.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17285838fb1b3b075cdf9c21775581af5afa456e6688f7c5220c87795e9a90a4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2624','GHBC-REQ-002624','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.1.1','GHBC-C-001024','Appurtenant electrical equipment, such as rheostats, transformers and generators, shall be within the projection room or in an adjacent room of equivalent construction.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc37d40bcd5c6d90fd5944f79d735598c88fc9aec50c78fbfb44e7811c6e1c88','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
