('rowid-2637','GHBC-REQ-002637','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.1','GHBC-C-001027','Air is permitted to be taken from the outside; from adjacent spaces within the building, provided that the volume and infiltration rate are sufficient; or from the building air-conditioning system, provided that it is so arranged as to provide sufficient air when other systems are not in operation.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','76fc04649031db53c13caf9a08d3303ee4502eb1225b4dc6b25595152f45dfc7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2638','GHBC-REQ-002638','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.2','GHBC-C-001028','Projection rooms are permitted to be exhausted through the lamp exhaust system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3979986dcf88dc02fb56b1d129e6cf0b83110c515498033b1435699fdba09da','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2639','GHBC-REQ-002639','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.2','GHBC-C-001028','The lamp exhaust system shall be positively interconnected with the lamp so that the lamp will not operate unless there is the required airflow.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9f80d37ce09fee39314b518c34329e76d075e795bd5bd5987ef29f18cd2792ca','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2640','GHBC-REQ-002640','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.2','GHBC-C-001028','Exhaust air ducts shall terminate at the exterior of the building in such a location that the exhaust air cannot be readily recirculated into any air supply system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7809a38d397c2ebe66b0e1e88ac1903288e7e776c688fd92676185312e21296d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2641','GHBC-REQ-002641','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.2','GHBC-C-001028','The projection room ventilation system is permitted to also serve appurtenant rooms, such as the generator and rewind rooms.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4514c0de4011edfc0cbd922bc3e55e21d7a9610741f2730d0b2f5374c048ddbc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2642','GHBC-REQ-002642','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.3','GHBC-C-001029','Each projection machine shall be provided with an exhaust duct that will draw air from each lamp and exhaust it directly to the outside of the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','215fb0392f3aa202ed66f7693fa44575d607e8ae5b8e5419c05aa2d6aedaf3dc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2643','GHBC-REQ-002643','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.3','GHBC-C-001029','The lamp exhaust is permitted to serve to exhaust air from the projection room to provide room air circulation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5f1fcce27c06d2cde5aba9411d4b9933d94da470b228d0fd60e221e1b41d3578','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2644','GHBC-REQ-002644','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.3','GHBC-C-001029','Such ducts shall be of rigid materials, except for a flexible connector approved for the purpose.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6760b2a162454d18508e570c17107b9b695190b2eba6c5ec61168ac3273c9387','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2645','GHBC-REQ-002645','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.3.3','GHBC-C-001029','The projection lamp or projection room exhaust system, or both, is permitted to be combined but shall not be interconnected with any other exhaust or return system, or both, within the building.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ef7489496bc48e4ee12d3cd3cf8bb91381344bd9cd9320994577b4454ed09c3a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2646','GHBC-REQ-002646','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.4','GHBC-C-001030','Provisions shall be made for control of the auditorium lighting and the means of escape lighting systems of theaters from inside the projection room and from not less than one other convenient point in the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','641c0b267d387d835f7df17c6564dbdc5193a9a990c5df6fc5ed21f5eca6aeb4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2647','GHBC-REQ-002647','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.9.5','GHBC-C-001031','Each projection room shall be provided with rewind and film storage facilities.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca46aeda5794290de6c0054f75f3fb7f4c62058da15f9a4186dcc91a0c24190f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2648','GHBC-REQ-002648','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10','GHBC-C-001032','STAGES, PLATFORMS AND TECHNICAL PRODUCTION AREAS','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ab3b3198d8e57e2093b07c27a34c6229401c285cad262acb62cdcbc8f196d85','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2649','GHBC-REQ-002649','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.1','GHBC-C-001033','The provisions of Clauses 4.10.1 through 4.10.7 shall apply to all parts of buildings and structures that contain stages or platforms and similar appurtenances as herein defined.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10.7,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"s of Clauses 4.10.1 through 4.10.7 shall apply to all parts of bui"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b79bafc91dfa4378045b828f2ad921e6f53d0015c961e5b6e72e3248a6a2e71b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2650','GHBC-REQ-002650','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2','GHBC-C-001034','Stage construction shall comply with Clauses 4.10.2.1 through 4.10.2.7.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bc1a37de768b2cd1247bf28cc008b965f3a4930ec90ab1dc1572383e097f869','2026-08-15 13:56:12');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-2651','GHBC-REQ-002651','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','Stages shall be constructed of materials as required for floors for the type of construction of the building in which such stages are located.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc0f77c45bfe04e91a38f950afa06cfbfda7d458c56f73774e61401906376e1e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
