('rowid-2654','GHBC-REQ-002654','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','74cf1b5d1519989d2e8c88898ef203690629ee72b1d760b264f427099bc9cc46','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2655','GHBC-REQ-002655','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','In buildings of Type IA, IIA and IVA construction, a fireresistance-rated floor is not required, provided that the space below the stage is equipped with an automatic sprinkler system or fireextinguishing system in accordance with Clause 10.3 or 10.4.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7dd6410a2629c0f2d7ba7888e82c8e2cb3b7ac3b702d76c122507c8b3b20364d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2656','GHBC-REQ-002656','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06940177ebd8dd4e00966b78c5b7d7f8653aa025c881d23d2594f2641ce77bcd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2657','GHBC-REQ-002657','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','In all types of construction, the finished floor shall be constructed of wood or approved noncombustible materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','09f59a79eec5a08f2fb23e3ca08fe66d37c1dadf7db6a5eb104ed8f49ccc2768','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2658','GHBC-REQ-002658','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','Openings through','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','600e7865093c087892f1e6e39f5459c0fbfc279b8d02ff67d45568a1778da135','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2659','GHBC-REQ-002659','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','stage floors shall be equipped with tight-fitting, solid wood trap doors with approved safety locks.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','adff962be2ecc1fc5b1f6d3d1f06b06325b2ea966847cc48021061cf3b8e4206','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2660','GHBC-REQ-002660','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-001035','EXCEPTIONS: Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Stages need not be constructed of the same materials as required for the type of construction provided that the construction complies with one of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7bde985d17d4b2ac6bb0687ab9a07e8e601e1e513ccb92758f4ab4a3a907d172','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2661','GHBC-REQ-002661','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1.1','GHBC-C-001036','Stage areas shall be measured to include the entire performance area and adjacent backstage and support areas not separated from the performance area by fire-resistancerated construction.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','551dfef7e58fa9ffe5f9ad4698df51f28d83c66282a7be548f3881ee87cf889c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2662','GHBC-REQ-002662','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1.1','GHBC-C-001036','Stage height shall be measured from the lowest point on the stage floor to the highest point of the roof or floor deck above the stage.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29813f76a4b13acb2b425e0a892c346f90fa56ed81eab6c58f59fbd78541a3c5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2663','GHBC-REQ-002663','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1.1','GHBC-C-001036','4.10.2.2 Technical production areas: galleries, gridirons and catwalks.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','362f3d20acd2fb097fe5898c422e13fd3a4076df30951ec884175acec366bce3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2664','GHBC-REQ-002664','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1.1','GHBC-C-001036','Beams designed only for the attachment of portable or fixed theater equipment, gridirons, galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of approved materials consistent with the requirements for the type of construction of the building; and a fire-resistance rating shall not be required.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','01dcdaf2d2069153100a37709b7a5b97ef48398afdd89a43b92fe2eee3ed2a91','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2665','GHBC-REQ-002665','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1.1','GHBC-C-001036','These areas shall not be considered to be floors, stories, mezzanines or levels in applying this Code.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','62961e0f971f184b6357a91f66b4d21b63b9d569017d9711313284589394a29f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2666','GHBC-REQ-002666','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.1.1','GHBC-C-001036','EXCEPTIONS: Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Floors of fly galleries and catwalks shall be constructed of any approved material."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0126332ac1f8b703918817c18de34b998a8d49776f88c635bc6b49c3c70ab8c3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2667','GHBC-REQ-002667','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.3','GHBC-C-001037','Where protection of openings is required, exterior exit doors shall be protected with fire door assemblies that comply with Clause 8.16.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d88f23f2576797cb1e2c46de2480b8810dfbc1c5bd0d0af0132789842abb268a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2668','GHBC-REQ-002668','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.3','GHBC-C-001037','Exterior openings that are located on the stage for means of escape or loading and unloading purposes, and that are likely to be open during occupancy of the theater, shall be constructed with vestibules to prevent air drafts into the auditorium.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac5ab2c9564bba0975625a1864858a715ce0753b6a28fda95d37867675dc7f01','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2669','GHBC-REQ-002669','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.4','GHBC-C-001038','Where the stage height is greater than 15 240 mm (50 feet), all portions of the stage shall be completely separated from the seating area by a proscenium wall with not less than a 2-hour fire-resistance rating extending continuously from the foundation to the roof.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":240,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"age height is greater than 15 240 mm (50 feet), all portions of th"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ht is greater than 15 240 mm (50 feet), all portions of the stage s"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a4ea77593553775d3503bce1a1030271d82b7addf6f2218490180de384002c44','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2670','GHBC-REQ-002670','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.5','GHBC-C-001039','Where a proscenium wall is required to have a fire-resistance rating, the stage opening shall be provided with a fire curtain complying with the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','273cd7f62260fabcfc060209508251db84f5fa70e789b9d8c5ef2004ce6a9c32','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2671','GHBC-REQ-002671','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.5','GHBC-C-001039','Horizontal sliding doors shall comply with Clause 8.16 and have a fire protection rating of not less than 1 hour, or an approved water curtain complying with Clause 10.3.3.1.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"e a fire protection rating of not less than 1 hour, or an approved water cu"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ction rating of not less than 1 hour, or an approved water curt"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e2feee5a30b198a4b2747b5e6efdc2816354bf71ea43fb749ab0ea4d99ec395c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2672','GHBC-REQ-002672','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.5','GHBC-C-001039','Facilities not utilizing the provisions of smoke-protected assembly seating in accordance with Clause 11.29.6.2, a smoke control system complying with Clause 10.9 or natural ventilation designed to maintain the smoke level not less than 1829 mm (6 feet) above the floor of the means of escape shall be required.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1829,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"d to maintain the smoke level not less than 1829 mm (6 feet) above the floor o"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1829,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"the smoke level not less than 1829 mm (6 feet) above the floor of t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":" level not less than 1829 mm (6 feet) above the floor of the means"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4dd4ca17b041a3682fb1fe7ec2868c4d6d75fa552b19b6d412f757c5de6eabe8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2673','GHBC-REQ-002673','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.6','GHBC-C-001040','Combustible materials used in sets and scenery shall meet the fire propagation performance criteria of Test Method 1 or Test Method 2, as appropriate, of ASTM E84, in accordance with Clause 9.6 and the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":84,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"d 2, as appropriate, of ASTM E84, in accordance with Clause 9.6 an"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d46b5cac2348729c8a2b3c46866e2cb65cc0bd76659f27b7a441053693fada9e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2674','GHBC-REQ-002674','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.6','GHBC-C-001040','Foam plastics and materials containing foam plastics shall comply with Clause 27.3 and the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65795e79cfc4408c20bc75809e7c4f49be0cefd45e3a4da3ccee2c36c18c4abf','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2675','GHBC-REQ-002675','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.7','GHBC-C-001041','Emergency ventilation shall be provided for stages larger than 93 m2 (1,000 square feet) in floor area, or with a stage height greater than 15 240 mm (50 feet).','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":93,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"ovided for stages larger than 93 m2 (1,000 square feet) in floor "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1000,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"for stages larger than 93 m2 (1,000 square feet) in floor area, or "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":240,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" stage height greater than 15 240 mm (50 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"eight greater than 15 240 mm (50 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','796574e851f0653d75488a835e547cda994c0af6e07c5f4dfc11e31359be5b1c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2676','GHBC-REQ-002676','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.7','GHBC-C-001041','Such ventilation shall comply with Clause 4.10.2.7.1 or 4.10.2.7.2.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','852179f77829df4cf22e8e36af6e41363586698bf26f43ce2f8c4455e75f486c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-2677','GHBC-REQ-002677','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.9','4.10.2.7.1','GHBC-C-001042','Two or more vents constructed to open automatically by approved heat-activated devices and with an aggregate clear opening area of not less than 5 percent of the area of the stage shall be located near the center and above the highest part of the stage area.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":5,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"gregate clear opening area of not less than 5 percent of the area of the st"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"opening area of not less than 5 percent of the area of the stage shal"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b511ee4dd5bd4039a4b71c97acde6dcb554e247570bfab00927e59b9f5ea884','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
