('rowid-3031','GHBC-REQ-003031','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.9.1.2','GHBC-C-001168','Storage tanks shall be noncombustible and protected from physical damage.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4ba84e2f876a62e61d805ca2b64ef4c2e68c5f3abf6fe537a08c51789776868c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3032','GHBC-REQ-003032','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.9.1.2','GHBC-C-001168','Fire barriers or horizontal assemblies or both around the storage tanks shall be permitted as the method of protection from physical damage.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','029b702516969da4947ed9f8b7b6ce6042815f950046a725cf1b59c456de5c03','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3033','GHBC-REQ-003033','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.9.1.3','GHBC-C-001169','Storage tanks shall be approved tanks conforming to the requirements of the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8df7a239760369286e3fd4f7e247dcd9ba17e490389687acbd55e734587cd766','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3034','GHBC-REQ-003034','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.9.1.4','GHBC-C-001170','A liquid-tight containment area compatible with the stored liquid shall be provided.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Rooms where only double-wall storage tanks conforming to Clause 4.15.9.1.3 are used to store Class I, II and IIIA flammable and combustible liquids shall not be required to have a leakage containment area."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c80fad442033743d2a6b7e892239e3be64d3823e03bd95044c9c3581b638cf15','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3035','GHBC-REQ-003035','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.9.1.4','GHBC-C-001170','The method of spill control, drainage control and secondary containment shall be in accordance with the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Rooms where only double-wall storage tanks conforming to Clause 4.15.9.1.3 are used to store Class I, II and IIIA flammable and combustible liquids shall not be required to have a leakage containment area."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df4019fbb32cbfcc644915723252e8ee187b60aa0a17f66b6ce571c6c9828893','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
