('rowid-3236','GHBC-REQ-003236','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.11.7.2.2','GHBC-C-001231','The gas detection system shall automatically close the shutoff valve at the source on gas supply piping and tubing related to the system being monitored for which gas is detected when a short-term hazard condition is detected.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is at the use location or within a gas valve enclosure of a branch line downstream of a piping distribution manifold, the shutoff valve for the branch line located in the piping distribution manifold enclosure shall automatically close."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4997bed071ceaabc6cc4cbb418563ee2567bd6bd6e5edb56d18ecfba606be47','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3237','GHBC-REQ-003237','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.11.7.2.2','GHBC-C-001231','Automatic closure of shutoff valves shall comply with the following:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is at the use location or within a gas valve enclosure of a branch line downstream of a piping distribution manifold, the shutoff valve for the branch line located in the piping distribution manifold enclosure shall automatically close."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','08a18f1798666aae19ec48720aa6219520040bcd2a754e73a6e1dca0d9bb5a16','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3238','GHBC-REQ-003238','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.11.7.2.2','GHBC-C-001231','1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is at the use location or within a gas valve enclosure of a branch line downstream of a piping distribution manifold, the shutoff valve for the branch line located in the piping distribution manifold enclosure shall automatically close."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54864f1a8e7c3d7cb5f6a51385b54c9451d5d2477261d9ad6f2d1649ee194677','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3239','GHBC-REQ-003239','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.11.7.2.2','GHBC-C-001231','Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is within a gas cabinet or exhausted enclosure, the shutoff valve in the gas cabinet or exhausted enclosure for the specific gas detected shall automatically close.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is at the use location or within a gas valve enclosure of a branch line downstream of a piping distribution manifold, the shutoff valve for the branch line located in the piping distribution manifold enclosure shall automatically close."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','af131a705bd65da447d022892d4ebd0a7d9359323d688907645a19cc071ec3e4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3240','GHBC-REQ-003240','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.11.7.2.2','GHBC-C-001231','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is at the use location or within a gas valve enclosure of a branch line downstream of a piping distribution manifold, the shutoff valve for the branch line located in the piping distribution manifold enclosure shall automatically close."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','930799547a5c798c59677faf38922960d4c279f13d6080413a3aaaf0c58b83a4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3241','GHBC-REQ-003241','GS 1207:2018',4,'4.15','4.15.11.7.2.2','GHBC-C-001231','Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is within a room and compressed gas containers are not in gas cabinets or an exhausted enclosure, the shutoff valves on all gas lines for the specific gas detected shall automatically close.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the gas detection sampling point initiating the gas detection system alarm is at the use location or within a gas valve enclosure of a branch line downstream of a piping distribution manifold, the shutoff valve for the branch line located in the piping distribution manifold enclosure shall automatically close."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34ea3ee196a88b3e06e561781122d88c31a1d0123402ffd3ba8068e2cb02c2f1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
