('rowid-3639','GHBC-REQ-003639','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.4.2','GHBC-C-001357','However, in the case of existing development on highways/other roads referred to above, the operation of this clause shall be exempted.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca43772447fc29a8176b866733d26250295e3a3c622e629ae3bec3d35f9188a5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3640','GHBC-REQ-003640','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.4.2','GHBC-C-001357','These provisions shall, however, be subject to the provisions of the relevant National Highway Act.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b8d13cc5d368aa7bd1ab59a5e15e0fcece64f2cc53a9c2479a3de3c1bd56784','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3641','GHBC-REQ-003641','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.6','GHBC-C-001358','other than residential, the following additional provisions of means of access shall be ensured: a)  The width of the main street on which the building abuts shall not be less than 12m and one end of this street shall join another street not less than 12m in width. b)  The approach to the building and open spaces on all its sides up to 6m width and the layout for the same shall be done in consultation with the Chief Fire Officer of the city and the same shall be hard surface capable of taking the weight of fire engine, weighing up to 18 tonnes.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":12,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"e building abuts shall not be less than 12m and one end of this street s"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":12,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"eet shall join another street not less than 12m in width. b)  The approach t"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":" open spaces on all its sides up to 6m width and the layout for the"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":18,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"ight of fire engine, weighing up to 18 tonnes."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" abuts shall not be less than 12m and one end of this street sh"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" another street not less than 12m in width. b)  The approach to"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"spaces on all its sides up to 6m width and the layout for the "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8dc017364395debcdcceb9ea4cccb88d332f4235242ba4eda02538dd96c2e8b4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3642','GHBC-REQ-003642','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.6','GHBC-C-001358','The said open space shall be kept free of obstructions and shall be motorable. c)  The main entrance to the plot shall be of adequate width to allow easy access to the fire engine and in no case shall it measure less than 4.5m.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":4.5,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"d in no case shall it measure less than 4.5m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"se shall it measure less than 4.5m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dd92b5f665655b47640c375fb2a31634d2fdc3d253e3da5b91fa34b4ef7f593f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3643','GHBC-REQ-003643','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.6','GHBC-C-001358','The entrance gate shall fold back against the compound wall of the premises, thus leaving exterior accessway within the plot free for movement of fire service vehicle.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','482ed31d514fdc7aea3f9a85960c0062d5ac912b67fee7debbd0ce2b58462c38','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3644','GHBC-REQ-003644','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.6','GHBC-C-001358','If the main entrance at the boundary wall is built over, the minimum clearance shall be 4.5m.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"he minimum clearance shall be 4.5m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f02937caa5ea2d66732f6e48e2d37ea9ceff361619c78d4e60325830549c0c7b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3645','GHBC-REQ-003645','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.7','GHBC-C-001359','Cul-de-sacs giving access to plots and extending from 150 to 275m in length with an additional turning space at 150m will be allowed only in residential areas, provided culde-sacs would be permissible only on straight roads and further provided the end of cul-desacs shall be higher in level than the level of the starting point of such dead end road.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":275,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ots and extending from 150 to 275m in length with an additional "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"n additional turning space at 150m will be allowed only in resid"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90865733e7da4748cb6620b9bc5a180f7758008f86c56991b1341e1335456b7e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3646','GHBC-REQ-003646','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.7','GHBC-C-001359','The turning space in this case shall be not less than 81 m in area, with no dimension less than 9m.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":81,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"g space in this case shall be not less than 81 m in area, with no dimension "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":9,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":" m in area, with no dimension less than 9m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":81,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"s case shall be not less than 81 m in area, with no dimension le"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":", with no dimension less than 9m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d27ca4aea6878bf27359ce2c6fdabef4cd72ed048bd403d784a4eab8e43814bd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3647','GHBC-REQ-003647','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.8','GHBC-C-001360','For interClause junctions of roads meeting at right angles as well as other roads meeting at right angles as well as other than rights angles, the rounding off or cut off or splay or similar treatment shall be done, to the approval of the Authority, depending upon the width of roads, the traffic generated, the sighting angle, etc. to provide clear sight distance.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dfd87fb3213b3ca23be32864056b10f99b05a871447613aa0f14882dcd0f508b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3648','GHBC-REQ-003648','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.3','5.3.9','GHBC-C-001361','The building line shall be set back at least 3m from internal means of access in a layout of buildings in a plot subject to provisions of Clause 5.6.2.1.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"ilding line shall be set back at least 3m from internal means of acces"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ne shall be set back at least 3m from internal means of access"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','94aa020975c32a18e2cd66b13e79dccd28e266599252a76838a901b9a61c0fdb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3649','GHBC-REQ-003649','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.4','5.4.1','GHBC-C-001362','In any layout or sub-division of land measuring 0.3 hectare of more in residential and commercial zones, the community open spaces shall be reserved for recreational purposes which shall as far as possible be provided in one place or planned out for the use of the community in clusters or pockets.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.3,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ub-division of land measuring 0.3 hectare of more in residential "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c959d51a573af622d8c1bdb2a5cb036950aa6cad7df6a3e0bd1eb7e21844435d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3650','GHBC-REQ-003650','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.4','5.4.1.1','GHBC-C-001363','The community open spaces shall be provided catering to the needs of area of layout, population for which the layout is planned and the category of dwelling units.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5e1440b7d4fa3a65be5a94feddb4d982490269cc2def8808bfa86a0842e51cea','2026-08-15 13:56:12');
