('rowid-3656','GHBC-REQ-003656','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.4','5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001365','The minimum average dimension of such recreational space shall be not less than 7.5m; if the average width of such recreational space is less than 24m, the length thereof shall not exceed 2.5 times the average width.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":7.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"h recreational space shall be not less than 7.5m; if the average width of suc"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":24,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"of such recreational space is less than 24m, the length thereof shall no"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" space shall be not less than 7.5m; if the average width of such"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"creational space is less than 24m, the length thereof shall not"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8edfefc24ff9e885be462e836c817166bd423f569d99a7d5661e546d21973673','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3657','GHBC-REQ-003657','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.4','5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001365','However, depending on the configuration of the site, commonly open spaces of different shapes may be permitted by the Authority, as long as the open spaces provided serve the needs of the immediate community contiguous to the open spaces.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39fd5f71d635af484aba21a75775005cbdea06407439dcef1605fdd83b11c29c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3658','GHBC-REQ-003658','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.4','5.4.2.2','GHBC-C-001366','storeyed structure as pavilion or gymnasia up to 25m2 in area may be permitted; such area may be excluded from FAR calculations; no toilet block shall be permitted.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":25,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"cture as pavilion or gymnasia up to 25m2 in area may be permitted; s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"as pavilion or gymnasia up to 25m2 in area may be permitted; suc"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2279d8a66c567a8ca1fdd876e7921b0e14b265a36d8e34f72a4badd4629451cd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
