('rowid-3705','GHBC-REQ-003705','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.1.2','GHBC-C-001388','building of wing – The open spaces shall be separate or distinct for each building and where a building has two or more wings, each wing shall have separate or distinct open spaces for the purposes of lighting and ventilation of the wings.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c46e13c6408ebfc78bd6ad1449afac0c1ed278c8a5b8dd36a769ff322ebf57b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
