('rowid-3712','GHBC-REQ-003712','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1.2','GHBC-C-001392','Subject to the condition of free ventilation, the open space left up to half the width of the plot shall also be taken into account for calculating the average width of the rear open space.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ecffc556226ea695b0b5740a2d08b4ad71d991d7a9e2609a07ec3f4f3cfea7a1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
