('rowid-3720','GHBC-REQ-003720','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1.3','GHBC-C-001393','(iii) For row-type buildings, no side open is required.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5e7f735d0c7f83886e5bfa8957eb68b209697fb2cd9ed30855bddeddb5f5dd70','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3721','GHBC-REQ-003721','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1.3','GHBC-C-001393','(b)  In the case of semi-detached buildings, the open spaces provided on one side shall be as in Clause 5.6.2.1.3 and all habitable rooms shall abut either on this side open space or front and rear open spaces or an interior open space Clause 5.6.2.5.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a01079b7c089cd12681b44cdea103f015b9f232eed6ed23a2907e66a0b1a8cb9','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3722','GHBC-REQ-003722','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.2','GHBC-C-001394','The provisions of Clause 5.6.2.1.2 and 5.6.2.1.3 are not applicable to parking lock-up garages up to 3m in height located at a distance of 7.5m from any street line or front boundary of the plot.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"le to parking lock-up garages up to 3m in height located at a dista"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"parking lock-up garages up to 3m in height located at a distan"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ight located at a distance of 7.5m from any street line or front"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','374e8b65de1bf96146800cae83054b7610c11152781f0e00cbeff90fc004ef52','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
