('rowid-3734','GHBC-REQ-003734','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.3.1','GHBC-C-001396','No further projections shall be permitted.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','98f6d100c45aee4f9dbc659c289fcad94ba00577b373c0e4839de3c6fe6220bd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3735','GHBC-REQ-003735','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.3.1','GHBC-C-001396','Note 3 – If the length or depth of the building exceeds 40m, add to Col.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"depth of the building exceeds 40m, add to Col."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','47ebb8756cfefd74c459603d87bb59ad017d9e993f0c1d2a06fff212d4d387bb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3736','GHBC-REQ-003736','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.3.1','GHBC-C-001396','3 ten percent of length or depth of building minus 4.0m.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"th or depth of building minus 4.0m."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','863b71ad8c4352a557064c011af2a5edd7e8a4750e4a7639dd3185946f77f8e3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3737','GHBC-REQ-003737','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.3.2','GHBC-C-001397','For tower-like structures, as an alternative to 5.6.2.3., open spaces shall be as below: a)  up to a height of 24m, with one set-back, the open spaces at the ground level, shall made good to satisfy 5.6.2.3.1,  through the set-backs at the upper levels; these set-backs shall not be accessible from individual rooms/flats at these levels.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" below: a)  up to a height of 24m, with one set-back, the open "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d3ed409f4b70e414116c72485a63a2ceb692ae686a86bc4b87112b97a1a92fc5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3738','GHBC-REQ-003738','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.4','GHBC-C-001398','the height of the building (see 6.5.4).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','06dd19b1e276818ee5b7128dddc3ded10684488b9de64926d39ba9eaa3703bae','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3739','GHBC-REQ-003739','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','a) Inner Courtyard – In case the whole of one side of every room excepting bath, WC and store room is not abutting on either the front, rear or side(s) open spaces, it shall abut on an inner courtyard, whose minimum width shall be 3m.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" whose minimum width shall be 3m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a276f675cf157090fb1d59eff8f6b90dc073b013cc67a9569279152320475f77','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3740','GHBC-REQ-003740','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','Further, the inner courtyard shall have an area, throughout its height, of not less','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9c3e03ba6d5bbfa356072b66dea64c40828a7bf795423c4618741f2750b7cc96','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3741','GHBC-REQ-003741','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','than the square of one-fifth the height of the highest wall abutting the courtyard.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ca5f99d16e98d97b787c29e459ab2db8466579fd0f0544f0936a6df52dbaeff2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3742','GHBC-REQ-003742','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','Provided that when any room (excluding staircase bay, bathroom and watercloset) is dependent for its light and ventilation on an inner courtyard, the dimension shall be such as is required for each wing of the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3d5b3eedd5ca953c09d10ef030a322ba01efdcdf8433a4a560c568cde7ac9fd8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3743','GHBC-REQ-003743','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','Where only water closet and bath room are abutting on the interior courtyard, the size of the interior courtyard shall be in line with the provision for ventilation shaft as given in Clause 5.6.2.5(b)) b) Ventilation Shaft – For ventilating the spaces for water closets and bath rooms, if not opening on to front, side, rear and interior open spaces, these shall open on to the ventilation shaft, the size of which shall not be less than the values given below: Note 1 – For buildings of height above 30m, a mechanical ventilation system shall be installed besides the provision of minimum ventilation shaft.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"For buildings of height above 30m, a mechanical ventilation sys"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','587ad23d84ef6777fa4694f11509c5be9346960be77fe5c7e436cddf64862e80','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3744','GHBC-REQ-003744','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','Note 2 – For fully air-conditioned residential buildings for lodging purposes, the ventilation shaft need not be insisted upon, provided the air-conditioning system works in an uninterrupted manner, also, provided there is an alternative source of power supply. c)  Outer Courtyard – The minimum width of the outer courtyard (as distinguished from its depth) shall be not less than 2.4m.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.4,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"shed from its depth) shall be not less than 2.4m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"depth) shall be not less than 2.4m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d4214c14a4d7cc5b8e50c7f3c2280e45ce956e0b618e4ba3f36135fd4b5663d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3745','GHBC-REQ-003745','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','If the width of the outer courtyard is less than 2.4m, it shall be treated as a notch and the provisions of outer courtyard shall not apply.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.4,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"dth of the outer courtyard is less than 2.4m, it shall be treated as a no"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" outer courtyard is less than 2.4m, it shall be treated as a not"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','96efd4fd17b2c4116cb744377edbe62bf7389855089007d2008767174d819f51','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3746','GHBC-REQ-003746','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.5','GHBC-C-001399','However, it the depth of the outer courtyard is more than the width, the provisions of 5.6.1.2 shall apply for the open spaces to be left between the wings.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" width, the provisions of 5.6.1.2 shall apply for the open spaces"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d2d0bedf8eafec98d0c7c76dfe78e221b544f055e07c43a43f71714f4b433f28','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3747','GHBC-REQ-003747','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.6','GHBC-C-001400','Every such interior or exterior open air space, unless the latter is a street, shall be maintained for the benefit of such building exclusively and shall be entirely within the owner‘s own premises.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b75157b6e83d9984a747eaa9fe28452437b3b48ac57184609092e6bc09bd1e7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3748','GHBC-REQ-003748','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.6.1','GHBC-C-001401','space is intended to be used for the benefit of more than one building belonging to the same owner, the width of such open air space shall be the one specified for the tallest building as specified in 5.6.2.3 abutting on such open air space.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9eaea93a860de4487484478095d729949af54cf668e90f2b1276165154e690c8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3749','GHBC-REQ-003749','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.6.2','GHBC-C-001402','space is jointly owned by more than one person, its width shall also be as specified in Clause 5.6.2, provided every such person agrees in writing to allow his portion of such joint open air space to be used for the benefit of every building abutting on such joint open air space and provided he sends such written consent to the Authority for record.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd81b4bfe71c526911867fcaca6650ed00fb3d730f2c8b9f4d7aaaa9305e9df0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3750','GHBC-REQ-003750','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.6.2','GHBC-C-001402','Such common open air space shall thenceforth be treated as a permanently open air space required for the purposes of the Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','269b905f86ff33576c18593942aab5c9b6d2b9cf31b7ac623cdd6cc41ba51ae5','2026-08-15 13:56:12');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-3751','GHBC-REQ-003751','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.2.6.2','GHBC-C-001402','No boundary wall between such joint open air space shall be erected or raised to a height of more than 2.0m.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"cted or raised to a height of more than 2.0m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ised to a height of more than 2.0m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','817e46afb20192b3ed1f4749322fd9fb2e39c166081c7366b50cf17c81bbe494','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3752','GHBC-REQ-003752','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.3.1','GHBC-C-001404','shall be as below: a) Educational Buildings – Except for nursery schools, the open spaces around the building shall be not less than 6m; b) Institutional Buildings – The open spaces around the building shall be not less than 6m; and c) Assembly Buildings – The open space at front shall be not less than 12m and the other open spaces around the building shall be not less than 6m.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" around the building shall be not less than 6m; b) Institutional Buildings "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" around the building shall be not less than 6m; and c) Assembly Buildings –"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":12,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" open space at front shall be not less than 12m and the other open spaces ar"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" around the building shall be not less than 6m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ilding shall be not less than 6m; b) Institutional Buildings –"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ilding shall be not less than 6m; and c) Assembly Buildings – "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" front shall be not less than 12m and the other open spaces aro"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ilding shall be not less than 6m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64465484b63cc15ec34b1c1ab1522fc581720aed863fed93493b3ea200a36b37','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3753','GHBC-REQ-003753','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.3.1','GHBC-C-001404','Note – However, if assembly buildings are permitted in purely residential zones, the open spaces around the building shall be not less than 12m. d) Business, Mercantile and Storage Buildings – The open spaces around the building shall be not less than 4.5m.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":12,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" around the building shall be not less than 12m. d) Business, Mercantile and"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":4.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" around the building shall be not less than 4.5m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ilding shall be not less than 12m. d) Business, Mercantile and "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ilding shall be not less than 4.5m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17c276dec1da6fafc3a77e5d40cf3d367faabc0a2ae8193f1f862b7f30169f25','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
