('rowid-3756','GHBC-REQ-003756','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.4.1','GHBC-C-001406','Every open space provided either interior or exterior shall be kept free from any erection thereon and shall be open to the sky, except as below: a) cornice, roof or weather shade not more than 0.75m wide; b) sunshades over windows/ventilators or other openings not more than 0.75m wide; c) canopy at first floor level, but not to be used as a sit out with clearance of 1.5m between the plot boundary and the canopy; d) projected balcony at higher floors of width not more than 0.9m; and e) projecting rooms/balconies (see (d) at alternate floors such that rooms of the lower two floors get light and air and the projection being not more than the height of the storey immediately below.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.75,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ornice, roof or weather shade not more than 0.75m wide; b) sunshades over wind"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.75,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ventilators or other openings not more than 0.75m wide; c) canopy at first flo"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.9,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ony at higher floors of width not more than 0.9m; and e) projecting rooms/bal"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.75,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"r weather shade not more than 0.75m wide; b) sunshades over windo"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.75,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" other openings not more than 0.75m wide; c) canopy at first floo"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"s a sit out with clearance of 1.5m between the plot boundary and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.9,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"floors of width not more than 0.9m; and e) projecting rooms/balc"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c32ebbf9cb823afd6ee76d1389816f820e62d39af30b10f50811e7fdcc7da832','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3757','GHBC-REQ-003757','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.4.1','GHBC-C-001406','However, these projections into open spaces shall not reduce the minimum required open spaces.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6a3529885538635c5e7bf3356fb7ada2480ef1270f29d503ab0cc40a35e36c06','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-3758','GHBC-REQ-003758','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.6','5.6.4.1.1','GHBC-C-001407','The following accessory buildings may be permitted in the open spaces: a) In an existing building, sanitary block of 2.4m in height subject to a maximum of 4m2 in the rear open space at a distance of 1.5m from the rear boundary may be permitted, where facilities are not adequate. b) Parking lock up garages not exceeding 2.4m in height shall be permitted in the side or rear open spaces at a distance of 7.5m form any road line or the front boundary of the plot; and c) Suction tank and pump room each up to 2.5m2 in area.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":4,"unit":null,"operator":"maximum of","context":"f 2.4m in height subject to a maximum of 4m2 in the rear open space at a"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.4,"unit":null,"operator":"not exceeding","context":"e. b) Parking lock up garages not exceeding 2.4m in height shall be permitted"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.5,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"ction tank and pump room each up to 2.5m2 in area."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"g building, sanitary block of 2.4m in height subject to a maximu"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"eight subject to a maximum of 4m2 in the rear open space at a d"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"r open space at a distance of 1.5m from the rear boundary may be"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"lock up garages not exceeding 2.4m in height shall be permitted "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" open spaces at a distance of 7.5m form any road line or the fro"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.5,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"tank and pump room each up to 2.5m2 in area."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f61d250