('rowid-3858','GHBC-REQ-003858','GS 1207:2018',5,'5.10','5.10.1','GHBC-C-001439','Where flood hazard areas, surface water bodies or wetlands, conservation areas, parklands, agricultural lands or greenfields are located on, or adjacent to, a plot, the development of the plot as a building site shall comply with the provisions of Clauses 5.10.2 through 5.10.7.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54d0c758ba547585db294ba645e14978c5b958bda9ffe0e11276d51295f062a7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
