('rowid-4355','GHBC-REQ-004355','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.3','6.3.1','GHBC-C-001502','Unless otherwise specifically modified in Part 4 and this part, building height, number of stories and building area shall not exceed the limits specified in Clause 6.4 and 6.9 based on the type of construction as determined by Clause 7.2 and the occupancies as determined by Clause 3.2 except as modified hereafter.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','966e5b6a5f66970daa6441aa5b2769771c38c083ae860cd32a0b512fbe88af34','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
