('rowid-4405','GHBC-REQ-004405','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.1','GHBC-C-001514','The limitation of area and height of buildings of different occupancy classes and types of construction shall be achieved by specifying it in terms of FAR (or FSI), which shall take into account the various aspects that govern in specifying FAR as given below:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','99f9b30098a811e73925255ad89739d92dc1d5706f46cdd3521e867ee21bb898','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4406','GHBC-REQ-004406','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.1','GHBC-C-001514','a) Occupancy class; b) Types of construction; c) Width of street fronting the building and the traffic load;','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6eaec4b679029f61daceb6a86f52d206a7ef06b0ef9287ea6805f157ea37fac0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4407','GHBC-REQ-004407','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.1','GHBC-C-001514','d) Locality where the building is proposed and the density; e) Parking facilities; f) Local fire fighting facilities; and g) Water supply and drainage facilities.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1a0018deed5a91d23e32a7676fd379a456db17dbd5c27e62d4525f8d2c09e3ff','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4408','GHBC-REQ-004408','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.2','GHBC-C-001515','occupancies and types of construction are as given in Table 6.5.1 and the Authority shall select a basic FAR for one occupancy and a type of construction and arrive at the FAR values for other combinations taking into account the other local factors see 6.5.1.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b7c63d63de615a5df26b4731862e5f782010daf644351a149fd7e4c0f1ca653e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4409','GHBC-REQ-004409','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.2.1','GHBC-C-001516','The minimum fire separation on all sides of buildings of unlimited areas (see Table 6.5.1) and of Type 1 construction shall be 9m.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" Type 1 construction shall be 9m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01bf88880e3f613de26b48f4a0ae839845b7255cafc63e07fde61a1e341e7472','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4410','GHBC-REQ-004410','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.3','GHBC-C-001517','The area limits shall apply to all buildings fronting on a street or public space not less than 9m in width accessible to a public street.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":9,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"g on a street or public space not less than 9m in width accessible to a pub"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"or public space not less than 9m in width accessible to a publ"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','98d5f427e9777215a2bcb34bc24688a472df196709ce4080178de4351b259008','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4411','GHBC-REQ-004411','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4','GHBC-C-001518','The height and number of storeys shall be related to FAR and the provisions of this Code','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14a5699d478afe1e76405b6835f971c00795d6da1379b899aca4b0b28c0abf49','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4412','GHBC-REQ-004412','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.1','GHBC-C-001519','by Table 6.5.1, the maximum height shall be limited according to the width of the street as follows:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17b16e3a8d8dd2dcc39da3800c3655741ffe1beb0cecf9f743aab4d3724ebf2e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4413','GHBC-REQ-004413','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.1','GHBC-C-001519','a) the maximum height of building shall not exceed 1.5 times the width of road abutting plus the front open space;','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5f52339d536763e07abdcc7f8f5fabf1cc68286cdc0d12230730521ccbabaf74','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4414','GHBC-REQ-004414','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.1','GHBC-C-001519','b) if a building abuts on two or more streets of different widths, the building shall be deemed to face upon the street that has the greater width and the height of the building shall be regulated by the width of that street and may be continued to this height to a depth of 24m along the narrower street subject to conformity of this Code and','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" to this height to a depth of 24m along the narrower street sub"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','84ecb260f796361891b16aae33215b376ef8673c6ba74d21256d7cdd65e8c159','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4415','GHBC-REQ-004415','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.1','GHBC-C-001519','Public Street of at Least 9m Width','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":9,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"Public Street of at Least 9m Width"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"Public Street of at Least 9m Width"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a7fe6908f709714e305d493a807b29916c88372ee6e7bed66e6bc2ad0a285d63','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4416','GHBC-REQ-004416','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.1','GHBC-C-001519','c) for buildings in the vicinity of aerodromes, provisions of Clause 6.5.5 shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5.5,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"romes, provisions of Clause 6.5.5 shall apply."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','18e808ae930ff63ef1910d965054c7da576781dd59e424fafbd1ae71897c6767','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4417','GHBC-REQ-004417','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','The following appurtenant structures shall not be included in the height of the building unless the aggregate area of such structures, including pent-houses, exceeds one-third of the area of the roof of building upon which they are erected:','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','eecfb612a700f971ce6b998df9dad4c1f5b7714ce243f31e976e66b7e5bde3a3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4418','GHBC-REQ-004418','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','a) roofs tanks and their supports; b) ventilating, airconditioning, lift rooms and similar service equipment; c) roof structures other than pent-houses; and d) chimneys and parapet walls not exceeding 1m in height.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"not exceeding","context":"d) chimneys and parapet walls not exceeding 1m in height."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"d parapet walls not exceeding 1m in height."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a78effba4aa045cab3cf15aa2f5d5bd7562fa78cbb0fa49d37c8a18a2c44de9a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4419','GHBC-REQ-004419','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','UL – Unlimited','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a703ec0a42da54ff1b733a168c9cd22a5600283b5e9b72b780724bfa9ce5aedf','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4420','GHBC-REQ-004420','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','NP – Not Permitted','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','def50f20b737bd291017c43a62885e7ebfea09d4eaf4e06e18e7bde3f4bcffbb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4421','GHBC-REQ-004421','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','Note 1 – This table has been prepared, taking into account the combustible content in the different occupancies as well as the fire resistance offered by the type of construction (see Part 3 Use and Occupancy).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a2b2f9ed202329fd58f954744539044116a6c87fb68ba47a129c7c920ef80c31','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4422','GHBC-REQ-004422','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','Note 2 – This table shall be modified by the Authority, taking into account the other aspects as given below (see 6.5.1).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c47224bb0b672fd1020db950cd186f86029b21a5a8e2ce6f12b0f3bf7906d43','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4423','GHBC-REQ-004423','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','a) density in terms of dwelling units/hectare; b) traffic considerations; c) parking spaces; d) local fire fighting facilities; and e) water supply, drainage and sanitation requirements.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a77323ae121e4ebc24ec622ce58da9a76221bb1aec1b1932f869161ed92b644a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4424','GHBC-REQ-004424','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','Note 3 – The FAR specified may be increased by 20 percent for the following:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"specified may be increased by 20 percent for the following:"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5743e90fb6bda2dcc379ebbb15bc705aaf7cb5adfd053f74cf596598f17aa532','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4425','GHBC-REQ-004425','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','a) a basement or cellar and space under a building constructed on stilts and used as a parking space, and air-conditioning plant room used as accessory to the principal use; electric cabin or substation, watchman‘s booth of maximum size of 1.6m2 with minimum width or b) diameter of 1.2m, pump house, garbage shaft, space required for location of fire hydrants, electric fittings and water tank. c) projections and accessory buildings as specifically exempted ; and d) staircase room and lift rooms above the topmost storey, architectural features; and chimneys and elevated tanks of dimensions as permissible under the Code, the area of the lift shaft shall be taken only on one floor.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.6,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"an‘s booth of maximum size of 1.6m2 with minimum width or b) diam"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"nimum width or b) diameter of 1.2m, pump house, garbage shaft, s"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acf6578fdfcf78048024e22c42c4a77add9fa4a479c292016f7cd923dc9d3847','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4426','GHBC-REQ-004426','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.1','GHBC-C-001521','Note 4 – In so far as single storey storage and hazardous occupancies are concerned, they would be further governed by volume to plot area ratio (VPR), to be decided by the Authority.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','086ce91141f450d0cc3f50daa745a741893408bab284c296997cdf53626beeeb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4427','GHBC-REQ-004427','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.4.2.2','GHBC-C-001522','sprinkler equipment is a requirement in accordance with Part 3 Use and Occupancy, all structures of Type 1, Type 2 and Type 3 construction designed for industrial, business, mercantile, low or moderate hazard storage occupancies may be erected 6m higher than specified in Table 6.5.1 when equipped with an approved one-source automatic sprinkler system.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ge occupancies may be erected 6m higher than specified in Tabl"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2b0e260c640c4308b4269706cbf321abae1c888dcfb1d5cefad5d679545d20ec','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4428','GHBC-REQ-004428','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5','GHBC-C-001523','Restrictions in the vicinity of Aerodromes','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ddb70fd8a8ff3d7d12a04f1a6294f678c8310bff0c639d6790620e249686c23','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4429','GHBC-REQ-004429','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5','GHBC-C-001523','6.5.5.1 For buildings in the vicinity of aerodromes, the maximum height of such buildings shall be decided in consultation with the Ghana Civil Aviation Authority.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01f10a74b11d50719aa3d7614244a874e12b823c684101ea78a4bd29bec0f2b3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4430','GHBC-REQ-004430','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5','GHBC-C-001523','This shall be regulated by the rules for giving no objection certificate for construction of buildings in the vicinity of aerodromes by the Director General of Civil Aviation, which are given in Appendix A.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38ac63a4b0b24414ffe769487539e4f48665810bda99dd796315250187d6eaa5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4431','GHBC-REQ-004431','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5','GHBC-C-001523','However, the latest rules of the Ghana Civil Aviation Authority shall be followed in all cases of buildings coming up in the vicinity of an aerodrome.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','307034b307472ac711c191e7bbe6f80e16016979a3ea5bf13570ead2f18dd82a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4432','GHBC-REQ-004432','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5.1.1','GHBC-C-001524','buildings structures which rise to 30m or more in height and are to be located within 20 km of the aerodrome reference point, shall be constructed only if a no objection certificate has been obtained from the Director General of Civil Aviation.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ings structures which rise to 30m or more in height and are to "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"km","operator":null,"context":" and are to be located within 20 km of the aerodrome reference po"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5f18dec4c5a6ccbbd639f4bf999a03ffc275e8820879ec537eb8f5fe80970199','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4433','GHBC-REQ-004433','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5.1.2','GHBC-C-001525','in the vicinity of defence aerodromes, the maximum height of such buildings shall be decided by the Defence Authority.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c1c01b992ee183f8cdd0d50b24d9d1ea37edfe214b6811ef7698b9c1af1f9bb0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4434','GHBC-REQ-004434','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5.2','GHBC-C-001526','constructions, overhead HT/LT lines, telephone/telegraph lines, factories, chimneys, wire/TV antennas.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','457cb99e5c4a51daa80445971669df7bd73b20099e3088be88b2203c5d7b8758','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4435','GHBC-REQ-004435','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.5','6.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-001527','factories shall be constructed within a radius of 8 km from the aerodrome reference point (ARP).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"km","operator":null,"context":"onstructed within a radius of 8 km from the aerodrome reference "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19fd2530494efcb6e73e9d8a94fb74b8e09732e99d4cfa346842e6ab97172c03','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
