('rowid-4476','GHBC-REQ-004476','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.6.3','GHBC-C-001555','a) it conforms to the standards of living rooms as regards lighting and ventilation in case the size of mezzanine floor is 9.5m2 or more b) it is so constructed as not to interfere under any circumstances with the ventilation of the space over and under it; c) such mezzanine floor is not subdivided into smaller compartments; d) such mezzanine floor or any part of it shall not be used as a kitchen; and e) in no case shall a mezzanine floor be closed so as to make it liable to be converted into unventilated compartments.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.5,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"he size of mezzanine floor is 9.5m2 or more b) it is so construct"}]','["is 9"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','24cf43f95043ab343892e3c5a46da867273fee33c3a048ae7775bd493e50368f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
