('rowid-4486','GHBC-REQ-004486','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.9.2.1','GHBC-C-001565','b) Adequate ventilation shall be provided for the basement.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a013355c6c0a242f69685fe3f321532642159f6aa4e002434bebce0e3bef0c3a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4487','GHBC-REQ-004487','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.9.2.1','GHBC-C-001565','The ventilation requirements shall be the same as required by the particular occupancy according to byelaws.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bcedd65496ef75e44f476ef32ea6ed386bc4aaca86b34579d9892ae5fc27bb46','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
