('rowid-4489','GHBC-REQ-004489','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.9.2.1','GHBC-C-001565','c) The minimum height of the ceiling of any basement shall be 0.9m and the maximum,','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.9,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ling of any basement shall be 0.9m and the maximum,"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a59867f3e7b2b3816fba9a1782d7b99fb3a81d2b5815306eef2d0f5a74afbc3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4490','GHBC-REQ-004490','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.9.2.1','GHBC-C-001565','1.2m above the average surrounding ground level.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"1.2m above the average surrounding"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','142f1d43835149c47d236a2c8799352d343030cccf18bc5e574333bc4104b296','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4491','GHBC-REQ-004491','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.9.2.1','GHBC-C-001565','d) Adequate arrangements shall be made such that surface drainage does not enter the basement.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4b554021e5d180b4d636057e94df560160bb5622a4dfbc68f939076207b2fa3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4492','GHBC-REQ-004492','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.9.2.1','GHBC-C-001565','e) The walls and floors of the basement shall be watertight and be so designed that the effects of the surrounding soil and moisture, if any, are taken into account in design and adequate damp proofing treatment is given.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b5d734d82941ddd0414d892f22daaf09fd963eac01095cb51218026190498a54','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
