('rowid-4519','GHBC-REQ-004519','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.14.2','GHBC-C-001573','ground immediately adjoining the well-head.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','95b358b08e58d43a7958a4bac347b31e02abecb1a1d961136378f17543bdbf39','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4520','GHBC-REQ-004520','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15','GHBC-C-001574','Where a septic tank is used for sewage disposal, the location, design and construction of the septic tank shall conform to requirements of 6.6.15.1 and 6.6.15.2.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','11b05fc0f4bd88fa5d63e0a3c36cb5600e4567de7b5f8e19f93dbe2cf364d04e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4521','GHBC-REQ-004521','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.1','GHBC-C-001575','Location of Septic Tanks and Subsurface Absorption Systems A subsoil dispersion system shall not be closer than 18m from any source of drinking water, such as well, to mitigate the possibility of bacterial pollution of water supply.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":18,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"stem shall not be closer than 18m from any source of drinking w"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cb7aef850c39bdf67c2f76f1f1b3275e12c93d9415f52b754150ddc123320c68','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4522','GHBC-REQ-004522','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.1','GHBC-C-001575','It shall also be far removed from the nearest habitable building as economically feasible but not closer than 6m, to avoid damage to the structures.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" feasible but not closer than 6m, to avoid damage to the struc"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e9e5fb7e76224304ce2212c6340f9ff336d16a5728ab364694c431bab7fdf4ad','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4523','GHBC-REQ-004523','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','a)  Dimensions of Septic Tanks – Septic tanks shall have a minimum width of 750mm, a minimum depth of 1 m below the water level and a minimum liquid capacity of 1m3.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":750,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"shall have a minimum width of 750mm, a minimum depth of 1 m below"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" of 750mm, a minimum depth of 1 m below the water level and a m"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m3","operator":null,"context":" a minimum liquid capacity of 1m3."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9727ca2239843a653343eef42b06a10d6b434ccff409415979972a9bb37d156d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4524','GHBC-REQ-004524','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','The length of tanks shall be 2 to 4 times the width. b)  Septic tanks may be constructed of brickwork, stone masonry, concrete or other suitable materials as approved by the Authority. c) Under no circumstances shall effluent from a septic tank be allowed into an open channel drain or body of water without adequate treatment. d) The minimum nominal diameter of the pipe shall be 100 mm.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"diameter of the pipe shall be 100 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3778fd755cad1a8f620037cbcbaf5528301675c7c7a8cefc3c162c468e2b75a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4525','GHBC-REQ-004525','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','Further, at junctions of pipes in manholes, direction of flow from a branch connection shall not make an angle exceeding 450 with the direction of flow in the main pipe; e) The gradients of land drains, under-drainage as well as the bottom of dispersion trenches and soakaways shall be between 1:300 and 1:400; f) Every septic tank shall be provided with ventilating pipe of at least 50','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"ided with ventilating pipe of at least 50"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','17f24cd71649c163a1f8b9da67f6b2f110bbc22d63a1dea8d0b6028476597145','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4526','GHBC-REQ-004526','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','mm diameter.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c15e828f625b5e0dfe64a3381946d9a9aaeb424bc238fde2f68bec1f09926d8d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4527','GHBC-REQ-004527','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','The top of the pipe shall be provided with a suitable cage of mosquito-proof wire mesh;','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','473b8bdd4ea35d838cbd39a718f0e842992cc985765bdf0cebdc7cea7ec06150','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4528','GHBC-REQ-004528','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','The ventilating pipe shall extend to a height which would cause no smell nuisance to any building in the area.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bfb09dac650636e8f9248b6d7ae25dc705d58ee3e0c8b6fa500bc187021d7720','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4529','GHBC-REQ-004529','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','Generally, the ventilating pipe may extend to a height of about 2m, when the septic tank is at least 15 m away from the nearest building and to a height of 2m above the top of the building when it is located closer than 15m; g) When the disposal of septic tank effluent is to a seepage pit, the seepage pit may be of any suitable shape with the least crossclauseal dimension of 900mm and not less than 1000mm in depth below the invert level of the inlet pipe.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":15,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"t 2m, when the septic tank is at least 15 m away from the nearest build"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":1000,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"auseal dimension of 900mm and not less than 1000mm in depth below the invert l"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"y extend to a height of about 2m, when the septic tank is at l"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"n the septic tank is at least 15 m away from the nearest buildin"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"t building and to a height of 2m above the top of the building"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"hen it is located closer than 15m; g) When the disposal of sept"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":900,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"st crossclauseal dimension of 900mm and not less than 1000mm in d"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1000,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"on of 900mm and not less than 1000mm in depth below the invert lev"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7cad52ff35e17850d6b0c31045476020ec395ef5c59470df3e1390f71326e32c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4530','GHBC-REQ-004530','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','The pit may be lined with stone, brick or concrete blocks with dry open joints which should be backed with at least 75mm of clean coarse aggregate.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":75,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"s which should be backed with at least 75mm of clean coarse aggregate."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hould be backed with at least 75mm of clean coarse aggregate."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d1e1f9ee2f4d3327f87809ee34cf8008a2cbc81786198a98d3ed85b08c4c3e88','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4531','GHBC-REQ-004531','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','The lining above the inlet level should be finished with mortar.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23592805dbe68a85027ebdda13435548abb2514aed9f23492c09fec7e5f3ee42','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4532','GHBC-REQ-004532','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.15.2','GHBC-C-001576','In the case of pits of large dimensions, the top portion may be narrowed to reduce the size of the RCC cover slabs.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','770d211842035aa4847f9be693c2d2c66673ade23f1af891210dcdc2cef0e008','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
