('rowid-4558','GHBC-REQ-004558','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.18.1.3','GHBC-C-001584','The maximum height of riser shall be 190mm for residential buildings and 150mm for other buildings and these shall be limited to 15 per flight.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":190,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"imum height of riser shall be 190mm for residential buildings and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"for residential buildings and 150mm for other buildings and these"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12f71c3da2af3b3c2a5029408bd65f7d0dd527c23de3c67a9f39697af3c819d9','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4559','GHBC-REQ-004559','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.18.2','GHBC-C-001585','The minimum head-room in a passage under the landing of a staircase shall any staircase shall be 2.2m.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" shall any staircase shall be 2.2m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8451efde1768e19dad7f5d4b9032e56ce7a315d2d26315440f980a23f1babebc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4560','GHBC-REQ-004560','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.19.1','GHBC-C-001587','The roof of a building shall be so constructed or framed as to permit effectual drainage of the rain-water therefrom by means of sufficient rain-water pipes of adequate size, wherever required, so arranged, jointed and fixed as to ensure that the rain-water is carried away from the building without causing dampness in any part of the walls or foundations of the building or those of an adjacent building.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a28b0a08e1890070da730a95fabaa1e32db39bbf91ea9eb5a73b2eaa4383330f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4561','GHBC-REQ-004561','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.19.2','GHBC-C-001588','pipes to be connected to a drain or sewer to a covered channel formed beneath the public footpath to connect the rain-water pipe to the road gutter or in any other approved manner.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f81fa08cfb484964596f56267e41a912a50da693c0e0118f4a0386823fc48d31','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4562','GHBC-REQ-004562','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.19.3','GHBC-C-001589','Rain-water pipes shall be affixed to the outside of the external walls of the building or in recesses or chases cut on formed in such','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f724f99e7d15e1bb1cc2df909807d0c17d6dda8855d65ea7f6b0d6d5c49bf8bb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4563','GHBC-REQ-004563','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.19.3','GHBC-C-001589','external walls or in such other manner as may be approved by the Authority.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','154644fb24bae4530924d04fd0897d2fd951b88813680be87f99744bc2ae984a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4564','GHBC-REQ-004564','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.6','6.6.20','GHBC-C-001590','housing shall be as given in Appendix D.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4f3fcfe40ab5d13f81ed4610cd627af37334ba8df5541ed11828a5ea51d335d3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
