('rowid-4567','GHBC-REQ-004567','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.7','6.7.1','GHBC-C-001591','designed or intended for use as a dwelling or for the handling, storage or sale of foodstuffs shall conform to the requirements as given in 6.7.2 and 6.7.3.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','813e661d2645339b7d2d1ae9e17571eb786057005b3554ecafae58c119f97ee2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4568','GHBC-REQ-004568','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.7','6.7.2','GHBC-C-001592','Every such building unless supported on posts shall have continuous foundation walls, extending from at least 600mm below ground level to at least 150mm above ground level or shall have a continuous floor of masonry or reinforced concrete or other equally effective rat-proof materials.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":600,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"ndation walls, extending from at least 600mm below ground level to at le"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":150,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"t 600mm below ground level to at least 150mm above ground level or shall"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":600,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"alls, extending from at least 600mm below ground level to at leas"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"elow ground level to at least 150mm above ground level or shall h"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd47c9f6b537935ff8303573ffb719d8ddaf0fc7910e07a6e3e3b8eae930dbe5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4569','GHBC-REQ-004569','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.7','6.7.3','GHBC-C-001593','windows and drains, and all junctions between foundation walls and building walls shall be effectively rat-proofed, that is, windows and doors shall be tight fitting, and other openings shall be securely covered with rat-proof screening or grillage or shall be tightly closed with metal sheeting, concrete or other equally effective rat-proof material.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2645c599b66465c898a2872b0a4eacd71a48e89597d29b43c921df0a957b07fd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4570','GHBC-REQ-004570','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.7','6.7.4','GHBC-C-001594','important, as the damage likely to be caused by termites to wooden structures of buildings and other household articles like furniture, clothing, stationery, etc. is considerable.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f7318355e135da916011eebbaadf0a691a01d4826ed6c08693e41061c9ccee55','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4571','GHBC-REQ-004571','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.7','6.7.4','GHBC-C-001594','Antitermite measures in buildings shall be taken in accordance with this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','70e1da64928b234ff7dc0ff58d659c71d2bb189c09ad7169e4021f0832db521b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4572','GHBC-REQ-004572','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-0.1 For the purpose of this Appendix, the following definitions shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cdb74db8b4e3bf60d3e72d1bb1cbe02d4094efd18c65f8264b55d9d183758f18','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4573','GHBC-REQ-004573','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-0.1.1 Aerodrome Reference Point (ARP) This is a designated point, which is established in the horizontal plane at or near the geometric centre of the landing area.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1d46372657f9f9eeed794b887ddd1b26cb4867b7ca85ddb238620de7a52ced83','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4574','GHBC-REQ-004574','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-0.1.2 Approach Funnel See Fig.A.1','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a10bf7d1b97f9583e5617911161bf8aefeacb4476366396a5deda6cb728c1b99','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4575','GHBC-REQ-004575','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-0.1.3 Elevation or Reduced Level This is the vertical distance of a point or a level, on or affixed to the surface of the earth, measured from the mean sea level.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f1c61dca5ea6f0aa90f55b99cbd1af12106a75ec0c7b5d3a5d0770967bcb5eb3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4576','GHBC-REQ-004576','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-0.1.4 Transitional Area It is an area which is below a specified surface sloping upwards and outwards from the edge of the approach funnel and from a line originating at the end of the inner edge of each approach 1A - Instrument Runway','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a3e19bddaf21c1978f445accc4b55e5cd83b13137d00be02444e0d05056f618d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4577','GHBC-REQ-004577','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','area, drawn parallel to the runway centre line in the direction of landing (See Fig. A.1).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','86ed18ca5e510f58ab468300e564eeece6153acce6a5cb592e647c037505a651','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4578','GHBC-REQ-004578','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-1 PROHIBITED AREA A-1.1 No building or structure shall be constructed or erected, or no tree shall be planted, on any land within the limits specified in A-1.2 and A-1.3 in respect of the aerodromes listed by the Ghana Civil Aviation Authority.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":-1.3,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"imits specified in A-1.2 and A-1.3 in respect of the aerodromes lis"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','35547bd60f480c4c4895b241d7d03e919e325c6abbc7b8d98ed67246846ed669','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4579','GHBC-REQ-004579','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-1.2 For the Aerodromes listed by the Ghana Civil Aviation Authority These requirements shall be applicable for the land enclosed in approach funnels of the runaway with a maximum distance of 360m measured from each runaway and along the extend centre line of the runway.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":360,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ay with a maximum distance of 360m measured from each runaway an"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','73528f210aa14a4287f6f72d89eadd681367107e880e991feda6f2a709cec9b8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4580','GHBC-REQ-004580','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','For the purpose of this clause, the requirements of approach funnel and an instrument runway shall be given in A-1.2.1 to A-1.2.3.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','60b503696a7eee6c742dbb6e56b2c333245eeda4ddce800592717e4f906cbf95','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4581','GHBC-REQ-004581','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-1.2.1 Approach funnel in the case of an instrument runway means the area in the shape of an isosceles trapezium having the longer parallel side 4800m long (2400m on either side of the extended centre line of the runway) and smaller parallel side 300m long (150m on either side of the extended centre line of the runway) where the smaller and longer parallel sides are placed at a distance of 60m and 15060m, respectively, from the end of the runway and at right angles to the extended centre line.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4800,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ving the longer parallel side 4800m long (2400m on either side of"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2400,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ger parallel side 4800m long (2400m on either side of the extende"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ay) and smaller parallel side 300m long (150m on either side of "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ller parallel side 300m long (150m on either side of the extende"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"s are placed at a distance of 60m and 15060m, respectively, fro"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15060,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"aced at a distance of 60m and 15060m, respectively, from the end o"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eaae2969abe7dd85b427d412899fa55df2d2fac22c9ad59c798b939e83dbafe1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4582','GHBC-REQ-004582','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','1B - Instrument Runway All Dimensions are in Metres Fig.A.1 - Runway A-1.2.2 In the case of a non-instrument runway, the approach funnel means the area in the shape of an isosceles trapezium having the longer parallel side 1800m long (900 m on either side of the extended centre line of the runway) and smaller parallel side 180m long (90m on either side of the extended centre line of the runway), where the smaller and longer parallel sides are placed at a distance of 60m and 6540m, respectively, from the end of the centre line.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"n Metres Fig.A.1 - Runway A-1.2.2 In the case of a non-instrument "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1800,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ving the longer parallel side 1800m long (900 m on either side of"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":900,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ger parallel side 1800m long (900 m on either side of the extende"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":180,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ay) and smaller parallel side 180m long (90m on either side of t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":90,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ller parallel side 180m long (90m on either side of the extende"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"s are placed at a distance of 60m and 6540m, respectively, from"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6540,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"aced at a distance of 60m and 6540m, respectively, from the end o"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f733edbd8a87306fb0294807815bcce2a8529006f3fadee6603f1d3a7ff728b7','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4583','GHBC-REQ-004583','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','Thereafter, the trapezium is followed by a contiguous rectangular area of that width for the remainder of the length up to a distance of 15060m from the end of the runway.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":15060,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"he length up to a distance of 15060m from the end of the runway."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bba6a3bdaa691c8dcfb54c50a5e61b857ffa2a93745054200a17f747d00ad14a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-4584','GHBC-REQ-004584','GS 1207:2018',6,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-001595','A-1.2.3 An instrument runway is a runway served by visual and non-visual aid or aids providing at least directional guidance','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','968fc5ba2ea721058acf01a2396c3f823079f7195ba89b9b711c8ae8e0552250','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
