('rowid-4644','GHBC-REQ-004644','GS 1207:2018',6,'6.9','6.9.1.2','GHBC-C-001608','The special provisions of Clause 6.13 permit the use of special conditions that are exempt from, or modify, the specific requirements of this part regarding the allowable areas of buildings based on the occupancy classification and type of construction, provided the special condition complies with the provisions specified in Clause 6.13.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','21c73b7106b01cb40c4bc51a2c974e5d2636ed64ca6921ca17e0956e944ef2f2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
