('rowid-5114','GHBC-REQ-005114','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.1','8.1.1','GHBC-C-001722','The provisions of this part shall govern the materials, systems and assemblies used for structural fire resistance and fire-resistancerated construction separation of adjacent spaces to safeguard against the spread of fire and smoke within a building and the spread of fire to or from buildings.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','218c6123c97b7037e287290a945c40b15b9a96c454d2c7a4ed67f8dcd0346a27','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
