('rowid-5144','GHBC-REQ-005144','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.4','GHBC-C-001731','Under the prescriptive fire-resistance requirements of this Code, the fire-resistance rating of a building element, component or assembly shall be established without the use of automatic sprinklers or any other fire suppression system being incorporated as part of the assembly tested in accordance with the fire exposure, procedures and acceptance','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4fc3b0f7066ea14896061189e29fa6481bb682221cb3a8bc451d7d1938629847','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
