('rowid-5147','GHBC-REQ-005147','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.5','GHBC-C-001732','The tests indicated in Clauses 8.3.5.1 and 8.3.5.2 shall serve as criteria for acceptance of building materials as set forth in clause 7.2.2, 7.2.3 and 7.2.4 in Types I and II construction.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5.2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ed in Clauses 8.3.5.1 and 8.3.5.2 shall serve as criteria for acc"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" in clause 7.2.2, 7.2.3 and 7.2.4 in Types I and II construction."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','af9c874fde3c166aa3c154c6c2b2c381db85b2ffdf552e3f7ff42ff519fca75d','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5148','GHBC-REQ-005148','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.5','GHBC-C-001732','The term ―non-combustible‖ does not apply to the flame spread characteristics of interior finish or trim materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a92fc48aae2639b63b0b0bd74095d597f50459a87d3fc1a5befb151846b9ebdd','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5149','GHBC-REQ-005149','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.5','GHBC-C-001732','A material shall not be classified as a noncombustible building construction material if it is subject to an increase in combustibility or flame spread beyond the limitations herein established through the effects of age, moisture or other atmospheric conditions.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','39d60960d5e60afa9126f8bc410bb42d1e4318b50e634e2755667292d7f73372','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
