('rowid-5152','GHBC-REQ-005152','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.7','GHBC-C-001734','Where there is an accessible concealed floor, floor-ceiling or attic space, fire walls, fire barriers, fire partitions, smoke barriers and smoke partitions or any other wall required to have protected openings or penetrations shall be effectively and permanently identified with signs or stenciling in the concealed space.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2caeb9f7a0bbed428e12394a6c8066867772655153a3c2c3e9aadcb5684d0da','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5153','GHBC-REQ-005153','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.7','GHBC-C-001734','Such identification shall:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','41a9f1306091711283f875ee4d43a7e95b465ddcd7f3fcb2391cc730da3b3e1a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5154','GHBC-REQ-005154','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.7','GHBC-C-001734','1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2d98ccd0e5f42758363e81a85ac74259b917ec728dc17ea18e4cfdd4c804490b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5155','GHBC-REQ-005155','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.7','GHBC-C-001734','Be located within 4572 mm (15 feet) of the end of each wall and at intervals not exceeding 9144 mm (30 feet) measured horizontally along the wall or partition.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":9144,"unit":null,"operator":"not exceeding","context":"of each wall and at intervals not exceeding 9144 mm (30 feet) measured horizon"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4572,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"Be located within 4572 mm (15 feet) of the end of each "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"Be located within 4572 mm (15 feet) of the end of each wall and "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9144,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"nd at intervals not exceeding 9144 mm (30 feet) measured horizontal"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ervals not exceeding 9144 mm (30 feet) measured horizontally along "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','783581f3eb265021a869b2cc7a5c28f14213c1c1f27b53d3e263238af0eb23c4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5156','GHBC-REQ-005156','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.7','GHBC-C-001734','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5e11f7689a11e637157fc993ff3e15a9da8af6f52aaed7bd21d49bb7be91aafc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5157','GHBC-REQ-005157','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.3','8.3.7','GHBC-C-001734','Include lettering not less than 76 mm (3 inches) in height with a minimum 9.5 mm (3/8-inch) stroke in a contrasting colour incorporating the suggested wording, ―FIRE AND/OR SMOKE BARRIER—PROTECT ALL OPENINGS,‖ or other wording.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":76,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"Include lettering not less than 76 mm (3 inches) in height with "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":76,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"clude lettering not less than 76 mm (3 inches) in height with a m"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ettering not less than 76 mm (3 inches) in height with a minimum"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.5,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hes) in height with a minimum 9.5 mm (3/8-inch) stroke in a contra"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3214e731918a7b890e1eb942bbbcb6baa89215bf594dea3b2e280e2ce5152c0','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5158','GHBC-REQ-005158','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.1','GHBC-C-001735','The fire-resistance ratings of structural members and assemblies shall comply with this clause and the requirements for the type of construction as specified in Table 7.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Fire barriers, fire partitions, smoke barriers and horizontal assemblies as provided in Clauses 8.7.5, 8.8.4, 8.9.4 and 8.11.2, respectively."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03d7c12143f8bf4b654452a5f226f99efb6b9b87e7d543451a5f327154f1ac5b','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5159','GHBC-REQ-005159','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.1','GHBC-C-001735','The fireresistance ratings shall be not less than the ratings required for the fire-resistance-rated assemblies supported by the structural members.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Fire barriers, fire partitions, smoke barriers and horizontal assemblies as provided in Clauses 8.7.5, 8.8.4, 8.9.4 and 8.11.2, respectively."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa1ffa93960494fc9694a908aba138645352d032ff431867951a2560aa625d4f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5160','GHBC-REQ-005160','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.1','GHBC-C-001735','EXCEPTIONS: Fire barriers, fire partitions, smoke barriers and horizontal assemblies as provided in Clauses 8.7.5, 8.8.4, 8.9.4 and 8.11.2, respectively.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Fire barriers, fire partitions, smoke barriers and horizontal assemblies as provided in Clauses 8.7.5, 8.8.4, 8.9.4 and 8.11.2, respectively."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c2305213fa85971a42afd27104eecdaf20ca06d05d0c533d1e801e397b47f4ec','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5161','GHBC-REQ-005161','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.2','GHBC-C-001736','Where columns are required to have protection to achieve a fire-resistance rating, the entire column shall be provided individual encasement protection by protecting it on all sides for the full column height, including connections to other structural members, with materials having the required fire-resistance rating.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Columns that meet the limitations of Clause 8.4.4.1."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','46888172d84d5878c82f99c78b6a0ce9f091bb9840327fac8cd81b6b61dbdc21','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5162','GHBC-REQ-005162','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.2','GHBC-C-001736','Where the column extends through a ceiling, the encasement protection shall be continuous from the top of the foundation or floor/ceiling assembly below through the ceiling space to the top of the column.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Columns that meet the limitations of Clause 8.4.4.1."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1b47713236a0449b3c31c7611ec678b0029a29d3a2b1354d048c868517860b90','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5163','GHBC-REQ-005163','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.2','GHBC-C-001736','EXCEPTIONS: Columns that meet the limitations of Clause 8.4.4.1.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Columns that meet the limitations of Clause 8.4.4.1."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','557233d8210d3471d8997077ec288545818c4c655c908550f418431dad71e016','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5164','GHBC-REQ-005164','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.3','GHBC-C-001737','frame other than columns.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Individual encasement protection on all sides shall be permitted on all exposed sides provided that the extent of protection is in accordance with the required fire-resistance rating, as determined in Clause 8.3."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5907282ee655ce0035dd375d705805e4715cd195c396e5c9243ca4e7ae1bcde4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5165','GHBC-REQ-005165','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.3','GHBC-C-001737','Members of the primary structural frame other than columns that are required to have protection to achieve a fire-resistance rating and support more than two floors or one floor and roof, or support a load-bearing wall or a nonload-bearing wall more than two stories high, shall be provided individual encasement protection by protecting them on all sides for the full length, including connections to other structural members, with materials having the required fire-resistance rating.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Individual encasement protection on all sides shall be permitted on all exposed sides provided that the extent of protection is in accordance with the required fire-resistance rating, as determined in Clause 8.3."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29cc058c9ffef32a625526172e5b7b9ded17becd0b781fecb341362b449dfd25','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5166','GHBC-REQ-005166','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.3','GHBC-C-001737','EXCEPTIONS: Individual encasement protection on all sides shall be permitted on all exposed sides provided that the extent of protection is in accordance with the required fire-resistance rating, as determined in Clause 8.3.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Individual encasement protection on all sides shall be permitted on all exposed sides provided that the extent of protection is in accordance with the required fire-resistance rating, as determined in Clause 8.3."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8834132d2d56bb62acaac8521653848d94eb4fe98b160b240d7cec2cad35c431','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5167','GHBC-REQ-005167','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.4','GHBC-C-001738','Secondary members that are required to have protection to achieve a fire-resistance rating shall be protected by individual encasement protection.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','85522a50214aa92e91b37a396c3198514af1e8be0630acc6aff739adf80f9390','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5168','GHBC-REQ-005168','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.4.1','GHBC-C-001739','Studs, columns and boundary elements that are integral elements in walls of light-frame construction and are located entirely between the top and bottom plates or tracks shall be permitted to have required fire-resistance ratings provided by the membrane protection provided for the wall.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f94153ccd2a7d5be3dcdaf122970291f0bbba93e109292b784ced241ade04df8','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5169','GHBC-REQ-005169','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.4.2','GHBC-C-001740','Horizontal assemblies are permitted to be protected with a membrane or ceiling where the membrane or ceiling provides the required fireresistance rating and is installed in accordance with Clause 8.11.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','649e977112988c92868485569c09103ed2c33ca3ded0cf6d380feca2a36a1b36','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5170','GHBC-REQ-005170','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.5','GHBC-C-001741','The required thickness and construction of fireresistance-rated assemblies enclosing trusses shall be based on the results of full-scale tests or combinations of tests on truss components or on approved calculations based on such tests that satisfactorily demonstrate that the assembly has the required fire resistance.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4541f52d4e978bebd96f7d6357707bfd9fb046f25e7cb4bc58765ee67b9d7a0f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5171','GHBC-REQ-005171','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.6','GHBC-C-001742','The edges of lugs, brackets, rivets and bolt heads attached to structural members shall be permitted to extend to within 25 mm (1 inch) of the surface of the fire protection.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"permitted to extend to within 25 mm (1 inch) of the surface of th"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ed to extend to within 25 mm (1 inch) of the surface of the fire"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02e66401cc72ec5f10cf27ef17cda2be5a45cd5df2e08ceb6b3ee4d561e76d55','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5172','GHBC-REQ-005172','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.7','GHBC-C-001743','Thickness of protection for concrete or masonry reinforcement shall be measured to the outside of the reinforcement except that stirrups and spiral reinforcement ties are permitted to project not more than 12.7 mm (0.5-inch) into the protection.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":12.7,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ties are permitted to project not more than 12.7 mm (0.5-inch) into the protec"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12.7,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tted to project not more than 12.7 mm (0.5-inch) into the protectio"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3ac3c3d63b1524c58d6be6cb92d197f6f17ca094d0de10687acfa97b975e746','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5173','GHBC-REQ-005173','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.8','GHBC-C-001744','Pipes, wires, conduits, ducts or other service facilities shall not be embedded in the required fire protective covering of a structural member that is required to be individually encased.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f2b8c8ea10382da0079b04c152a7e54136a7d8b0475f26c939d90efb3dd58e07','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5174','GHBC-REQ-005174','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.9','GHBC-C-001745','Where the fire protective covering of a structural member is subject to impact damage from moving vehicles, the handling of merchandise or other activity, the fire protective covering shall be protected by corner guards or by a substantial jacket of metal or other noncombustible material to a height adequate to provide full protection, but not less than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the finished floor.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Corner protection is not required on concrete columns in parking garages."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1524,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" provide full protection, but not less than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the finished"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1524,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"protection, but not less than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the finished fl"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"n, but not less than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the finished floor."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4a1282afe49f1e52f4654b0ee73d8964012c9b3d33c6a2ca1df88cd13ca2b0f3','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5175','GHBC-REQ-005175','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.9','GHBC-C-001745','EXCEPTIONS: Corner protection is not required on concrete columns in parking garages.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Corner protection is not required on concrete columns in parking garages."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e21045bb3cc7ddb90df6102fde940b742feba9f0ff5f4f1d22722a76d97f2d06','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5176','GHBC-REQ-005176','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','Load-bearing structural members located within the exterior walls or on the outside of a building or structure shall be provided with the highest fire-resistance rating as determined in accordance with the following:','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1a5220313350da32895a1fe0e9880011c05f1deb3e61945e7850da30c4e4a947','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5177','GHBC-REQ-005177','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','463fb83d350d0294adc2684b998dfee7717aa3833905f54e526c55f2b72f4537','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5178','GHBC-REQ-005178','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','As required by Table 7.1 for the type of building element based on the type of construction of the building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3695fe19e16ef4df40630b6fceeb29d4ae08305314e6a80fd4ba94cb4e30141f','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5179','GHBC-REQ-005179','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71591e5f0a5abcad389b976c07a90498a301791f8186061311bb258f08cd1064','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5180','GHBC-REQ-005180','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','As required by Table 7.1 for exterior bearing walls based on the type of construction.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','058fbaa5e06e776f05131f6977007629d1093f01c59e5f784430f8407a74f942','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5181','GHBC-REQ-005181','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34512885e8b7562824e1e0a2194254a600202801a89070dcb108091101ca7e5a','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5182','GHBC-REQ-005182','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.10','GHBC-C-001746','As required by Table 7.2 for exterior walls based on the fire separation distance.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ecbc1728c8299ce6fc8df18a90e3cd2e9d7cf37cabdf9869dbdd36e075f30d2','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5183','GHBC-REQ-005183','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.11','GHBC-C-001747','Fire protection is not required at the bottom flange of lintels, shelf angles and plates, spanning not more than 1931 mm (6 feet 4 inches) whether part of the primary structural frame or not, and from the bottom flange of lintels, shelf angles and plates not part of the structural frame, regardless of span.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1931,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"f angles and plates, spanning not more than 1931 mm (6 feet 4 inches) whether "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1931,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"lates, spanning not more than 1931 mm (6 feet 4 inches) whether par"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"anning not more than 1931 mm (6 feet 4 inches) whether part of the"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"not more than 1931 mm (6 feet 4 inches) whether part of the prim"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ab43e9935c68e98402bce52e0b36616bd0b4f4b58e1385fb4d7ba1c11cc03ed','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5184','GHBC-REQ-005184','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','Fire-resistance ratings for the isolation system shall meet the fire-resistance rating required for the columns, walls or other structural elements in which the isolation system is installed in','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89aedc47cbfb5ec8a26d1c46de1d6f835a852a41d507adf595e8c904351fe2df','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5185','GHBC-REQ-005185','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','accordance with Table 7.1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c6c8d4cc84870c196026f753d27922c6de9db573bd652fdfdaf78e8c51ebf758','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5186','GHBC-REQ-005186','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','Isolation systems required to have a fire-resistance rating shall be protected with approved materials or construction assemblies designed to provide the same degree of fire resistance as the structural element in which the system is installed when tested in accordance with ASTM E119 (see Clause 8.3.2).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aeb4f9e7ad2bbff1bc6a8b5d84738fabf9c9112ca936ea3c87f719b6aa3fa2d5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5187','GHBC-REQ-005187','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','Such isolation system protection applied to isolator units shall be capable of retarding the transfer of heat to the isolator unit in such a manner that the required gravity load-carrying capacity of the isolator unit will not be impaired after exposure to the standard timetemperature curve fire test prescribed in ASTM E119 for a duration not less than that required for the fire-resistance rating of the structure element in which the system is installed.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cab0db3b37289abc813fde33a2450de4a34dbe6139b7d0ad787d056dbe563043','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5188','GHBC-REQ-005188','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','Such isolation system protection applied to isolator units shall be suitably designed and securely installed so as not to dislodge, loosen, sustain damage or otherwise impair its ability to accommodate the seismic movements for which the isolator unit is designed and to maintain its integrity for the purpose of providing the required fire-resistance protection.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01166b80d5d6f329c2babba0c2d0987d257ca19cf20efe40b403b0036d0be5a4','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5189','GHBC-REQ-005189','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','8.4.13 Sprayed fire-resistant materials (SFRM).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.13,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"8.4.13 Sprayed fire-resistant material"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6af1643c87468918541e7e34d9b6ad76fe1d68a3350d519a98f9e41ffa8cebf5','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5190','GHBC-REQ-005190','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.12','GHBC-C-001748','Sprayed fire-resistant materials (SFRM) shall comply with Clauses 8.4.13.1 through 8.4.13.5.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12eebba1c4d5e59f15a70feb4f0c00683de77db78997aa68a8309e08904f00f9','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5191','GHBC-REQ-005191','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.13.1','GHBC-C-001749','The application of SFRM shall be consistent with the fire-resistance rating and the listing, including, but not limited to, minimum thickness and dry density of the applied SFRM, method of application, substrate surface conditions and the use of bonding adhesives, sealants, reinforcing or other materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05467960c32448a23aaeafcb7f0b1ae357c9bd98f7260f1b31a956509721f9ef','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5192','GHBC-REQ-005192','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.13.1','GHBC-C-001749','8.4.13.2 Manufacturer‘s installation instructions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":13.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"8.4.13.2 Manufacturer‘s installation ins"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ced6f25f7312f2ccfcef85d67a8c6854293315032df5ef1e24e3cb2a441c6cc','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
