('rowid-5199','GHBC-REQ-005199','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.4','8.4.13.3.2','GHBC-C-001752','Where the SFRM is to be applied over primers, paints or encapsulants other than those specified in the listing, the material shall be field tested in accordance with ASTM E736.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d5d7bc88555d7de400f63894e1ec80fc0d5d489a9225310dc5205c01caf522b1','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
