('rowid-5235','GHBC-REQ-005235','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.3','GHBC-C-001762','Where a new building is to be erected on the same plot as an existing building, the location of the assumed imaginary line with relation to the existing building shall be such that the exterior wall and opening protection of the existing building meet the criteria as set forth in Clauses 8.5.5 and 8.5.8.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c53191d66c36907e4286d068408a7a75e0a1e522dea08b3356514338571ed44','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
