('rowid-5237','GHBC-REQ-005237','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.3','GHBC-C-001762','Two or more buildings on the same plot shall be either regulated as separate buildings or shall be considered as portions of one building if the aggregate area of such buildings is within the limits specified in Part 6 for a single building.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','991fed0b95f285106f97731b4a9e704fa3e6161f3370795dcb655134e30796cb','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5238','GHBC-REQ-005238','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.3','GHBC-C-001762','Where the buildings contain different occupancy groups or are of different types of construction, the area shall be that allowed for the most restrictive occupancy or construction.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0b4ae33dff031b5caff988d3600574bf132082b0d250d48af0693504043eb86','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
