('rowid-5240','GHBC-REQ-005240','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.3','GHBC-C-001762','Where an S-2 parking garage of Construction Type I or IIA is erected on the same plot as a Group R-2 building, and there is no fire separation distance between these buildings, then the adjoining exterior walls between the buildings are permitted to have occupant use openings in accordance with Clause 8.6.8.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffce0f23850690b66e59cc6d9a24050ee26bdeb612428f8f4cbbae23fb3bb079','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
('rowid-5241','GHBC-REQ-005241','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.3','GHBC-C-001762','However, opening protectives in such openings shall only be required in the exterior wall of the S-2 parking garage, not in the exterior wall','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6109ff286307c41119781ad461637c108c4de6da7c4a2be004a7ee41f7d88c44','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
