('rowid-5287','GHBC-REQ-005287','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.8.4','GHBC-C-001771','Where both unprotected and protected openings are located in the exterior wall in any storey of a building, the total area of openings shall be determined in accordance with the following: (Ap/ap) + (Au/au) ≤1','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','258a43eef8cbb9a69c10f78bcf21422686f2a5ce9ef4bb431da3aa12fd97ca8c','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
