('rowid-5293','GHBC-REQ-005293','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.5','8.5.8.5','GHBC-C-001772','The unexposed surface temperature limitations specified in ASTM E119 shall not apply to the flame barriers unless otherwise required by the provisions of this Code.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":119,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"imitations specified in ASTM E119 shall not apply to the flame ba"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bb338eaa93a48d35c0b68ac69e54fac1eea976e8bab8e0942ff9752d53deba4e','2026-08-15 13:56:12'),
