('rowid-5708','GHBC-REQ-005708','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.13','8.13.11','GHBC-C-001906','They shall be enclosed at the lowest level with construction of the same fire-resistance rating as the lowest floor through which the shaft passes, but not less than the rating required for the shaft enclosure.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e760b549362fbeef0022b5494fe565666420fce40f94d977d4932ee932dd64df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
