('rowid-5717','GHBC-REQ-005717','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.13','8.13.11','GHBC-C-001906','The fire-resistance-rated room separation is not required, provided that the only openings in or penetrations of the shaft enclosure to the interior of the building occur at the bottom.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c36eee6fd855c824ed2412a5a7aa7a8f90d2d2f0ef20aee489819dc8da5921cb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
