('rowid-5722','GHBC-REQ-005722','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.13','8.13.11','GHBC-C-001906','The fire-resistance-rated room separation and the protection at the bottom of the shaft are not required provided that there are no combustibles in the shaft and there are no openings or other penetrations through the shaft enclosure to the interior of the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','63e7ece570166d31a95d4133204bcd581bb71117676100e3b7ff583ef842eed7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
