('rowid-5888','GHBC-REQ-005888','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.1.1','GHBC-C-001934','The void created at the interclause of a floor/ceiling assembly and an exterior curtain wall assembly shall be protected in accordance with Clause 8.15.4.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b3a8ac91b66d89458c413dd9101985915d349eb955d3f87983bb1230362c7482','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5889','GHBC-REQ-005889','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.2','GHBC-C-001935','A fire-resistant joint system shall be securely installed in accordance with the manufacturer‘s installation instructions and the listing criteria in or on the joint for its entire length so as not to impair its ability to accommodate expected building movements and to resist the passage of fire and hot gases.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3bd637e38331b6930201aadf52020bc1268ac7d2850b5df6a9416e0200b3f189','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5890','GHBC-REQ-005890','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.3','GHBC-C-001936','Fire-resistant joint systems shall be tested in accordance with the requirements of either ASTM E1966.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a horizontal fire separation distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be required to be tested for interior fire exposure only."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','04bcd03148afc692b6f624cd72b1a94c29f316708674938d4555ff057ca33ffa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5891','GHBC-REQ-005891','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.3','GHBC-C-001936','Nonsymmetrical wall joint systems shall be tested with both faces exposed to the furnace, and the assigned fireresistance rating shall be the shortest duration obtained from the two tests.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a horizontal fire separation distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be required to be tested for interior fire exposure only."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90f1e72cd023a329fa6e975a25be3f8725b157a88bcfe6ebd85f40dc169a5808','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5892','GHBC-REQ-005892','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.3','GHBC-C-001936','Where evidence is','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a horizontal fire separation distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be required to be tested for interior fire exposure only."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','888ec11616f569c90d440a77592212d01f09ed3830d7f05d1ad3c157ab9a154c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5893','GHBC-REQ-005893','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.3','GHBC-C-001936','furnished to show that the wall was tested with the least fire-resistant side exposed to the furnace, subject to acceptance of the building official, the wall need not be subjected to tests from the opposite side.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a horizontal fire separation distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be required to be tested for interior fire exposure only."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','69c8003b0ce17fc5d887b78ea6cf23b5da4aeb149aa727c0a4eb37e6dbc339e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5894','GHBC-REQ-005894','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.3','GHBC-C-001936','EXCEPTIONS: For exterior walls with a horizontal fire separation distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be required to be tested for interior fire exposure only.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a horizontal fire separation distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be required to be tested for interior fire exposure only."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"aration distance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3048,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"istance greater than 10 feet (3048 mm), the joint system shall be r"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','66a5665cd93a387fddf39e67e3b2ccf243854ccd491cb4ba8bd52a920238702f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5895','GHBC-REQ-005895','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.4','GHBC-C-001937','Where fire-resistance-rated floor or floor/ceiling assemblies are required, voids created at the interclause of the exterior curtain wall assemblies and such floor assemblies shall be sealed with an approved system to prevent the interior spread of fire.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Voids created at the interclause of the exterior curtain wall assemblies and such floor assemblies where the vision glass extends to the finished floor level shall be permitted to be sealed with an approved material to prevent the interior spread of fire. Such material shall be securely installed and capable of preventing the passage of flame and hot gases sufficient to ignite cotton waste where subjected to ASTM E119 time-temperature fire conditions under a minimum positive pressure differential of 0.01 inch (0.254 mm) of water column (2.5 Pa) for the time period not less than the fire-resistance rating of the floor assembly."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3c839437b9dac62bca8c2482e009c1c5909d8ef972e4c1b9e84093b330f395eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5896','GHBC-REQ-005896','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.4','GHBC-C-001937','Such systems shall be securely installed and tested in accordance with ASTM E2307 to provide an F rating for a time period not less than the fire-resistance rating of the floor assembly.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Voids created at the interclause of the exterior curtain wall assemblies and such floor assemblies where the vision glass extends to the finished floor level shall be permitted to be sealed with an approved material to prevent the interior spread of fire. Such material shall be securely installed and capable of preventing the passage of flame and hot gases sufficient to ignite cotton waste where subjected to ASTM E119 time-temperature fire conditions under a minimum positive pressure differential of 0.01 inch (0.254 mm) of water column (2.5 Pa) for the time period not less than the fire-resistance rating of the floor assembly."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc130ac70eaebf728757cc1418e5163d81d3ac72e6b4e136b3b43905b3512296','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5897','GHBC-REQ-005897','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.4','GHBC-C-001937','Height and fireresistance requirements for curtain wall spandrels shall comply with Clause 8.5.8.5.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Voids created at the interclause of the exterior curtain wall assemblies and such floor assemblies where the vision glass extends to the finished floor level shall be permitted to be sealed with an approved material to prevent the interior spread of fire. Such material shall be securely installed and capable of preventing the passage of flame and hot gases sufficient to ignite cotton waste where subjected to ASTM E119 time-temperature fire conditions under a minimum positive pressure differential of 0.01 inch (0.254 mm) of water column (2.5 Pa) for the time period not less than the fire-resistance rating of the floor assembly."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad6d050f9eb9c3db6878b9961337c6fe3c39ca7ecaf2a03c70efbb3ecb30cfdd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5898','GHBC-REQ-005898','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.4','GHBC-C-001937','8.15.4.1 Exterior curtain wall/nonfireresistance-rated floor assembly interclauses.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Voids created at the interclause of the exterior curtain wall assemblies and such floor assemblies where the vision glass extends to the finished floor level shall be permitted to be sealed with an approved material to prevent the interior spread of fire. Such material shall be securely installed and capable of preventing the passage of flame and hot gases sufficient to ignite cotton waste where subjected to ASTM E119 time-temperature fire conditions under a minimum positive pressure differential of 0.01 inch (0.254 mm) of water column (2.5 Pa) for the time period not less than the fire-resistance rating of the floor assembly."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0fb1b46c788fbc492e86450510e640854991af29daab3854e81d092be93ed02','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-5899','GHBC-REQ-005899','GS 1207:2018',8,'8.15','8.15.4','GHBC-C-001937','Voids created at the interclause of exterior curtain wall assemblies and nonfire-resistancerated floor or floor/ceiling assemblies shall be sealed with an approved material or system to retard the interior spread of fire and hot gases between stories.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Voids created at the interclause of the exterior curtain wall assemblies and such floor assemblies where the vision glass extends to the finished floor level shall be permitted to be sealed with an approved material to prevent the interior spread of fire. Such material shall be securely installed and capable of preventing the passage of flame and hot gases sufficient to ignite cotton waste where subjected to ASTM E119 time-temperature fire conditions under a minimum positive pressure differential of 0.01 inch (0.254 mm) of water column (2.5 Pa) for the time period not less than the fire-resistance rating of the floor assembly."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7467243b6cb06310e6920f24d3b300fa90842f561808d820af0c8abd5ee4c5a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
