('rowid-5936','GHBC-REQ-005936','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.16.1.2.2.1','GHBC-C-001945','For fire-protection-rated glazing, the label shall bear the following identification required in Tables 8.16.1(1) and 8.16.1(3): ―OH – XXX.‖ ―OH‖ indicates that the glazing meets both the fire protection and the hose-stream requirements of the Ghana Fire Code and is permitted to be used in fire window openings.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','541977124525430cd723bade6e43294ffe9e3520b2d46beb14b611f386748bd8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
