('rowid-6052','GHBC-REQ-006052','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.16.2.9.2','GHBC-C-001983','Where a certificate of inspection is furnished by an approved testing agency, the certificate shall state that the door conforms to the requirements of design, materials and construction, but has not been subjected to the fire test.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df531ea98af22191da258c91bb2c5b09e5c175f0b89dd00c6d682042d0a4821c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
