('rowid-6668','GHBC-REQ-006668','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3','GHBC-C-002111','In case of differences between the values determined from Table 8.22.2.3(4) or 8.22.2.3(5), it is permitted to use the smaller value.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8be02f22dc0613031cabbb5dc2563b258fa0bba2c9c9515ca84525d435251310','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6669','GHBC-REQ-006669','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3','GHBC-C-002111','The concrete cover shall be calculated in accordance with Clause 8.22.2.3.3.1.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9e9539ff95e8377095303d58111e23b9172c5904e378782d1cb4181f0590c58d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6670','GHBC-REQ-006670','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3','GHBC-C-002111','The minimum concrete cover for nonprestressed reinforcement in prestressed concrete beams shall comply with Clause 8.22.2.3.2.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5681dea16fda7003d8ac3393139253aa755f7932d5b90e7bc2d4ab48feab038a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6671','GHBC-REQ-006671','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3.1','GHBC-C-002112','The concrete cover for an individual tendon is the minimum thickness of concrete between the surface of the tendon and the fire-exposed surface of the beam, except that for ungrouted ducts, the assumed cover thickness is the minimum thickness of concrete between the surface of the duct and the fire-exposed surface of the beam.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9971625087624a465b4ec5c16e9d11b82a7bf1c82b90e7157a3a115b0d0fb2e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6672','GHBC-REQ-006672','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3.1','GHBC-C-002112','For beams in which two or more tendons are used, the cover is assumed to be the average of the minimum cover of the individual tendons.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fe675cdd65c710ed70bdd7cf892a3e5ce5396c71dfbcb0480e46d207a436f987','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6673','GHBC-REQ-006673','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3.1','GHBC-C-002112','For corner tendons (tendons equal distance from the bottom and side), the minimum cover used in the calculation shall be one-half the actual value.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','062152fef6a3c4ba07114332022394faeb22a24e36c4ff1fa7b16943f99b72d4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6674','GHBC-REQ-006674','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3.1','GHBC-C-002112','For stemmed members with two or more prestressing tendons located along the vertical centerline of the stem, the average cover shall be the distance from the bottom of the member to the centroid of the tendons.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3e70f775f29be0bf6c4e742733d3ac9f1ef6bcc02465dcc57b46804c2e076c7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6675','GHBC-REQ-006675','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.2.3.3.1','GHBC-C-002112','The actual cover for any individual tendon shall be not less than one-half the smaller value shown in Tables 8.22.2.3(4) and 8.22.2.3(5), or 1 inch (25 mm), whichever is greater.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"22.2.3(4) and 8.22.2.3(5), or 1 inch (25 mm), whichever is great"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":") and 8.22.2.3(5), or 1 inch (25 mm), whichever is greater."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bfd113d10477c57601056e34ecd76c6d03d35e70b0ed6fe5acd4bb713247507e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
