('rowid-6717','GHBC-REQ-006717','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2','GHBC-C-002126','Values between those shown in the table can be determined by direct interpolation. b.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65c2e9b791a3abe9765bad32222cd2fc68c9291c572985b2620bd17a0af6d381','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6718','GHBC-REQ-006718','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2','GHBC-C-002126','Where combustible members are framed into the wall, the thickness of solid material between the end of each member and the opposite face of the wall, or between members set in from opposite sides, shall be not less than 93 percent of the thickness shown in the table. c.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":93,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"from opposite sides, shall be not less than 93 percent of the thickness show"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":93,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"sides, shall be not less than 93 percent of the thickness shown in the"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','55dfe62ae65fa3974e7c03449315d3809c60b9eafa5d5f0c50de31917d4318b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6719','GHBC-REQ-006719','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2','GHBC-C-002126','Requirements of ASTM C55, ASTM C73, ASTM C90 or ASTM C744 shall apply. d.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":744,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":", ASTM C73, ASTM C90 or ASTM C744 shall apply. d."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a6da62a1f1cc555449e5e99236aed58bdc24893d59aecbbf6ea7212d03ac418','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6720','GHBC-REQ-006720','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2','GHBC-C-002126','Minimum required equivalent thickness corresponding to the hourly fire-resistance rating for units with a combination of aggregate shall be determined by linear interpolation based on the percent by volume of each aggregate used in manufacture.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d986c1c63fb333e2ff9b952c98015dddf755f48842c8fd2bc361a0e944a1c0a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6721','GHBC-REQ-006721','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2.1','GHBC-C-002127','Where plaster or gypsum wallboard is applied to the side of the wall not exposed to fire, the contribution of the finish to the total fireresistance rating shall be determined as follows: The thickness of gypsum wallboard or plaster shall be corrected by multiplying the actual thickness of the finish by applicable factor determined from Table 8.22.2.1.4(1).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b3bd89a7eaf0dda36b6baa18f050438ea3c2bd14978c78ccb88f9f3ce8cdd1a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6722','GHBC-REQ-006722','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2.1','GHBC-C-002127','This corrected thickness of finish shall be added to the equivalent thickness of masonry and the fire-resistance rating of the masonry and finish determined from Table 8.22.3.2.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64ca82abfd17f90292d73f866377cb2402ebe54de63fd98caa5a5075822bcf27','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6723','GHBC-REQ-006723','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2.2','GHBC-C-002128','Where plaster or gypsum wallboard is applied to the fire-exposed side of the wall, the contribution of the finish to the total fireresistance rating shall be determined as follows: The time assigned to the finish as established by Table 8.22.2.1.4(2) shall be added to the fire-resistance rating determined in Clause 8.22.3.2 for the masonry alone, or in Clause 8.22.3.2.1 for the masonry and finish on the nonfire-exposed side.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','81f1561c9b05fdfd999c1d57e9014fbb3e5b4aa1e6deb6fce3dd0101957bc091','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6724','GHBC-REQ-006724','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2.3','GHBC-C-002129','For a wall without finish on one side or having different types or thicknesses of finish on each side, the calculation procedures of this clause shall be performed twice, assuming either side of the wall to be the fire-exposed side.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a fire separation distance greater than 1524 mm (5 feet), the fire shall be assumed to occur on the interior side only."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5831933287c8053ff020fa1a8734d6395a8233f1f7022bd540f77fa123f552d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6725','GHBC-REQ-006725','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.3.2.3','GHBC-C-002129','The fireresistance rating of the wall shall not exceed the lower of the two values calculated.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["For exterior walls with a fire separation distance greater than 1524 mm (5 feet), the fire shall be assumed to occur on the interior side only."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4935435de6d4e588358e0148436ffdb8b117696449a8f10e28249af885394119','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
