('rowid-6861','GHBC-REQ-006861','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.5.1.1','GHBC-C-002145','These procedures establish a basis for determining the fire resistance of column assemblies as a function of the thickness of fire-resistant material and, the weight, W, and heated perimeter, D, of structural steel columns.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0c770735f7c97f268eeee10a334812b24cdae1d1777ff38061533fdb2092dce6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
