('rowid-6924','GHBC-REQ-006924','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.5.2','GHBC-C-002161','The fire-resistance ratings of structural steel beams and girders shall be based on the size of the element and the type of protection provided in accordance with this clause.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e16a7d877602fa024ee3a4357100f0584e3f273c5d72f921dcdee489adfac715','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-6925','GHBC-REQ-006925','GS 1207:2018',8,NULL,'8.22.5.2.1','GHBC-C-002162','These procedures establish a basis for determining resistance of structural steel beams and girders that differ in size from that specified in approved fire-resistance-rated assemblies as a function of the thickness of fire-resistant material and the weight (W) and heated perimeter (D) of the beam or girder.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a7400602db0eb33b3b8d006ef8d8e51c360bcd8f14c94756be787db9a8e92618','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
