('rowid-7227','GHBC-REQ-007227','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.1','10.1.7','GHBC-C-002267','Where buildings, or portions thereof, are divided into fire areas so as not to exceed the limits established for requiring a fire protection system in accordance with this part, such fire areas shall be separated by fire walls constructed in accordance with Clause 8.6, fire barriers constructed in accordance with Clause 8.7, or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Clause 8.11, or a combination thereof having a fire-resistance rating of not less than that determined in accordance with Clause 8.7.3.10.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2966eda85c1bc492a493ff653265e08c12d64768b8a5ca7937383779b45eaa3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
