('rowid-7285','GHBC-REQ-007285','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.3','10.3.2.1.6','GHBC-C-002283','Where an occupied roof has an assembly occupancy with an occupant load exceeding 100 for Group A-2 and 300 for other Group A occupancies, all floors between the occupied roof and the level of exit discharge shall be equipped with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Clause 10.3.3.1.1 or 10.3.3.1.2.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Open parking garages of Type I or Type II construction."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0090c2ea242541035835f81084d168c23199be3ef2a2e3472fbd86d029f7256','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
