('rowid-7287','GHBC-REQ-007287','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.3','10.3.2.1.7','GHBC-C-002284','An automatic sprinkler system shall be provided where multiple fire areas of Group A1, A-2, A-3 or A-4 occupancies share exit or exit access components and the combined occupant load of theses fire areas is 300 or more.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 300"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67932cd31039fed57bc3d837ec4570b6fa1a6ddc40035c2c327cd0569c1f735d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
