('rowid-7710','GHBC-REQ-007710','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.5','10.5.4','GHBC-C-002394','connections.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A single hose connection shall be permitted to be installed in the open corridor or open breezeway between open stairs that are not greater than 22 860 mm (75 feet) apart."," Where floor areas adjacent to a horizontal exit are reachable from an interior exit stairway hose connection by a 9144 mm (30-foot) hose stream from a nozzle attached to 30 480 mm (100 feet) of hose, a hose connection shall not be required at the horizontal exit."," Where floor areas adjacent to an exit passageway are reachable from an interior exit stairway hose connection by a 9144 mm (30-foot) hose stream from a nozzle attached to 30 480 mm (100 feet) of hose, a hose connection shall not be required at the entrance from the exit passageway to other areas of the building."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a5e1e0698919c316b86a0b750aab64956f26e97adb5eee28d3be1746c272458','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
