('rowid-7727','GHBC-REQ-007727','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.5','10.5.4.1','GHBC-C-002395','Risers and laterals of Class I Fire hydrantsystems not located within an interior exit stairway shall be protected by a degree of fire resistance equal to that required for vertical enclosures in the building in which they are located.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In buildings equipped throughout with an approved automatic sprinkler system, laterals that are not located within an interior exit stairway are not required to be enclosed within fire-resistance-rated construction."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56c9444a34acd876e781827254889b95ca877d0a0e7c78caea84d346c292347a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
