('rowid-7833','GHBC-REQ-007833','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.2','GHBC-C-002434','An approved fire alarm system installed in accordance with the provisions of this Code and ISO 7240 shall be provided in new buildings and structures in accordance with Clauses 10.7.2.1 through 10.7.2.23 and provide occupant notification in accordance with Clause 10.7.5, unless other requirements are provided by another clause of this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":7240,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ovisions of this Code and ISO 7240 shall be provided in new buildi"}]','["ISO 7240"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','047361faa07f6f2020f88a95d1c56632ef7ab432ee0278e80b82d8512730a83e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
