('rowid-8018','GHBC-REQ-008018','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.2.10.5','GHBC-C-002467','Where more than one smoke alarm is required to be installed within an individual dwelling unit or sleeping unit in Group R or I-1 occupancies, the smoke alarms shall be interconnected in such a manner that the activation of one alarm will activate all of the alarms in the individual unit.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb4419450d9fcd0ca891cfdcd17cde47cd35375fdd571c8aacbaf960b98cf0e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
