('rowid-8174','GHBC-REQ-008174','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.4.2.4','GHBC-C-002505','Where fire alarm systems are not monitored by a supervising station, an approved permanent sign shall be installed adjacent to each manual fire alarm box that reads: WHEN ALARM SOUNDS CALL FIRE DEPARTMENT.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the manufacturer has permanently provided this information on the manual fire alarm box."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3be0945067d02d543a33c1b363bb4dcae413eb54fda637af420666ee1dd8bc3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
