('rowid-8208','GHBC-REQ-008208','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1','GHBC-C-002513','Where provided, audible notification appliances located in each enclosed occupant evacuation elevator lobby in accordance with Clause 31.8.9.1 shall be connected to a separate notification zone for manual paging only.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.1,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"n accordance with Clause 31.8.9.1 shall be connected to a separat"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8f3a93c771172e20599ceb75091082aa430116f502b294ec60b0538c156e181d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8209','GHBC-REQ-008209','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-002514','The audible alarm notification appliances shall provide a sound pressure level of 15 decibels (dBA) above the average ambient sound level or 5 dBA above the maximum sound level having a duration of not less than 60 seconds, whichever is greater, in every occupiable space within the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"nd level having a duration of not less than 60 seconds, whichever is greater"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"g a duration of not less than 60 seconds, whichever is greater, "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e11b358cb8c044cdedcc887e30828faf0b297c27a8f305ede2c066794fc9e49','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8210','GHBC-REQ-008210','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-002515','The maximum sound pressure level for audible alarm notification appliances shall be 110 dBA at the minimum hearing distance from the audible appliance.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In Group I-1 and I-2 occupancies, the alarm shall sound in a constantly attended area and a general occupant notification shall be broadcast over the overhead page."]','[]','["ISO 7240","ISO 7240"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b73cf4c942f08abc30eddd5bd4c5ad0313c3f141fd04743abfad354db29f313f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8211','GHBC-REQ-008211','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-002515','Where the average ambient noise is greater than 95 dBA, visible alarm notification appliances shall be provided in accordance with ISO 7240 and audible alarm notification appliances shall not be required.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In Group I-1 and I-2 occupancies, the alarm shall sound in a constantly attended area and a general occupant notification shall be broadcast over the overhead page."]','[]','["ISO 7240","ISO 7240"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1cdfe897cd337356285f3d84ceaa3588c9d09932e52e29b3e818ebcbc9671bee','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8212','GHBC-REQ-008212','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-002515','10.7.5.2.2 Emergency voice/alarm communication systems.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In Group I-1 and I-2 occupancies, the alarm shall sound in a constantly attended area and a general occupant notification shall be broadcast over the overhead page."]','[]','["ISO 7240","ISO 7240"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d4f12b8f935fb35a554a474938aae78200ecf3c8933a641d64e1aba3e6b95cde','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8213','GHBC-REQ-008213','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-002515','Emergency voice/alarm communication systems required by this Code shall be designed and installed in accordance with ISO 7240.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In Group I-1 and I-2 occupancies, the alarm shall sound in a constantly attended area and a general occupant notification shall be broadcast over the overhead page."]','[]','["ISO 7240","ISO 7240"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eddd2810886b10fc0b0e80f17ac0cda23dda612712252c1c150e7be0b8617541','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8214','GHBC-REQ-008214','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-002515','The operation of any automatic fire detector, sprinkler waterflow device or manual fire alarm box shall automatically sound an alert tone followed by voice instructions giving approved information and directions for a general or staged evacuation in accordance with the building‘s fire safety and evacuation plans required by Clause 404 of the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In Group I-1 and I-2 occupancies, the alarm shall sound in a constantly attended area and a general occupant notification shall be broadcast over the overhead page."]','[]','["ISO 7240","ISO 7240"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e8a812790b811c6daa3c2819513cf10cc2652a5cc0cf4793e07e59638c773f72','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8215','GHBC-REQ-008215','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.7','10.7.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-002515','In high-rise buildings, the system shall operate on at least the alarming floor, the floor above and the floor below.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In Group I-1 and I-2 occupancies, the alarm shall sound in a constantly attended area and a general occupant notification shall be broadcast over the overhead page."]','[]','["ISO 7240","ISO 7240"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ba0e5fc9b324e010f8bf6846373a5863d561e655d07b078a65b3983ff506feb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
