('rowid-8314','GHBC-REQ-008314','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','The construction documents shall include sufficient information','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cba019ba1d3ad12ba9c95d5effeec5c78ff32845e2cbd8e398a31a6f2596d9fb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8315','GHBC-REQ-008315','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','and detail to adequately describe the elements of the design necessary for the proper implementation of the smoke control systems.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c81eaf1f79f8f51c814526711cffef3e28c58d12b8f21fbb1c1436c57435b7c0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8316','GHBC-REQ-008316','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','These documents shall be accompanied by sufficient information and analysis to demonstrate compliance with these provisions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f82b72dda2ecca5b61faef9f326ac78b6cf83ae70fa2ca99300255b49fc3996','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8317','GHBC-REQ-008317','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','10.9.3 Special inspection and test requirements.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"10.9.3 Special inspection and test req"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aeec1d2d93d0a2841eb625aaab55983fea7b71f7fe3b39754694de395e5476b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8318','GHBC-REQ-008318','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','In addition to the ordinary inspection and test requirements that buildings, structures and parts thereof are required to undergo, smoke control systems subject to the provisions of Clause 10.9 shall undergo special inspections and tests sufficient to verify the proper commissioning of the smoke control design in its final installed condition.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10.9,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"t to the provisions of Clause 10.9 shall undergo special inspectio"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','183534c0ed1bd3467fad4b53e08888beabd138763c56e62c8d8a153513b88b94','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8319','GHBC-REQ-008319','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','The design submission accompanying the construction documents shall clearly detail procedures and methods to be used and the items subject to such inspections and tests.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce72645d57b47d8788762612b5f0793b5405a6458913cdf4bd1ecfc100644526','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8320','GHBC-REQ-008320','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','Such commissioning shall be in accordance with generally accepted engineering practice and, where possible, based on published standards for the particular testing involved.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71bba048af702fdd1166527f241b83c482584da56f13930eee69851a273e4e19','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8321','GHBC-REQ-008321','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.2','GHBC-C-002542','The special inspections and tests required by this clause shall be conducted under the same terms in Clause 19.4','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2413cb57e722107ddfd4a6dd85967b46e127e84db1c794fe07d50e089874da3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8322','GHBC-REQ-008322','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.4','GHBC-C-002543','A rational analysis supporting the types of smoke control systems to be employed, their methods of operation, the systems supporting them and the methods of construction to be utilized shall accompany the submitted construction documents and shall include, but not be limited to, the items indicated in Clauses 10.9.4.1 through 10.9.4.7.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d916aa482c71d8b567f7467c994eb93cfb498d222db459a708c4d54aca4cb0e7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8323','GHBC-REQ-008323','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.4.1','GHBC-C-002544','The system shall be designed such that the maximum probable normal or reverse stack effect will not adversely interfere with the system‘s capabilities.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e591615c6556c2c76396dc17c61ee679a681a9ff8ae256c7e2649c6b706e07c6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
