('rowid-8429','GHBC-REQ-008429','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.1','GHBC-C-002571','EXCEPTIONS: Reduced T as calculated based s on the assurance of adequate dilution air.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Reduced T as calculated based s on the assurance of adequate dilution air."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4ca6d26c420256874e69fda444a637485469af3dfaacf8abca616fe3bfd9e601','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8430','GHBC-REQ-008430','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','Duct materials and joints shall be capable of withstanding the probable temperatures and pressures to which they are exposed as determined in accordance with Clause 10.9.10.1.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e23d27acfe86f4fd7c7054723dacca061b8ea2e1413798c38e82f2e2b521205','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8431','GHBC-REQ-008431','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','Ducts shall be constructed and supported in accordance with the International Mechanical Code.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','037962ced8052e0f8ac25cf5edcb0eb84d3563d73e4716c487bc426a11e4f42f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8432','GHBC-REQ-008432','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','Ducts shall be leak tested to 1.5 times the maximum design pressure in accordance with nationally accepted practices.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','78bb433a0e31d933e31da9e761d7e2686745dc24b9940bf613deed550dd4be12','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8433','GHBC-REQ-008433','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','Measured leakage shall not exceed 5 percent of design flow.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ured leakage shall not exceed 5 percent of design flow."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','889ce5341521db2817ed74248a5146562326842e6ba2f7c5af3945a67aa10880','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8434','GHBC-REQ-008434','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','Results of such testing shall be a part of the documentation procedure.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc5509997aeedd2181e85bad03e75f87917bd0334e24beea4c1cd4d2cd9b8991','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8435','GHBC-REQ-008435','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','Ducts shall be supported directly from fire-resistancerated structural elements of the building by substantial, noncombustible supports.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5f6012a0384b694c8baa252bcbfac4f73401f79ce61fe46a34b91e2150354504','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8436','GHBC-REQ-008436','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.2','GHBC-C-002572','EXCEPTIONS: Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, complying with this Code and that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c1c046578d85f6897f32b72be214e22757b09931ad7516040359a6734e30a389','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8437','GHBC-REQ-008437','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.3','GHBC-C-002573','Equipment shall be located so as to not expose uninvolved portions of the building to an additional fire hazard.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a103576b42d07e7cce1c846503b5975603dd6da82f1b536e8587e85e63aa1e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8438','GHBC-REQ-008438','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.3','GHBC-C-002573','Outside air inlets shall be located so as to minimize the potential for introducing smoke or flame into the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c8c014768f6dbae6c9c57b88e642849f3f0ed8a5011b4e07639f1e8de1639788','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8439','GHBC-REQ-008439','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.3','GHBC-C-002573','Exhaust outlets shall be so located as to minimize reintroduction of smoke into the building and to limit exposure of the building or adjacent buildings to an additional fire hazard.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e18b60f6690f2442df383bac6a21d1d7e14e7ab81269c8b77a9018b0d41d942','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8440','GHBC-REQ-008440','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.4','GHBC-C-002574','Automatic dampers, regardless of the purpose for which they are installed within the smoke control system, shall be listed and conform to the requirements of approved, recognized standards.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3fb3d624840779c85e83551eb79172a50b97362efb1dbd51b90330a3e87e849','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8441','GHBC-REQ-008441','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.5','GHBC-C-002575','In addition to other requirements, belt-driven fans shall have 1.5 times the number of belts required for the design duty, with the minimum number of belts being two.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02177d7067058c3088ecfd54c4b5ef6c1abc9e9a67f698657cd61ebd1ead0273','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8442','GHBC-REQ-008442','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.5','GHBC-C-002575','Fans shall be selected for stable performance based on normal temperature and, where applicable, elevated temperature.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e06a5c029af0d8c5804eaef769cbfaed4c5d4bdd0d392ebc0726164262d2e56c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8443','GHBC-REQ-008443','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.5','GHBC-C-002575','Calculations and manufacturer‘s fan curves shall be part of the documentation procedures.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0fef37ca1bc981528e0cef5697c162f7cd2d47bf6045c819f839f1822155ce9e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8444','GHBC-REQ-008444','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.5','GHBC-C-002575','Fans shall be supported and restrained by noncombustible devices in accordance with the requirements of this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d0aa87770debe312d2fb75ccebf1a33c91e1feb7747d6d9ee3843cd14b9188b5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8445','GHBC-REQ-008445','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.10.5','GHBC-C-002575','Motors driving fans shall not be operated beyond their nameplate horsepower (kilowatts), as determined from measurement of actual current draw, and shall have a minimum service factor of 1.15.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d3494f4605bd715c84bdc91b1e3943b372552ec09beb3680cf380f18e82d2ffe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8446','GHBC-REQ-008446','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.11','GHBC-C-002576','Smoke control systems shall be provided with standby power in accordance with Clause 28.13).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5e8dea4e75cf30949b6a0d8681c1fa5e729f8c3ee46847685ab523c0e0fe7c6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8447','GHBC-REQ-008447','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.11.1','GHBC-C-002577','The standby power source and its transfer switches shall be in a room separate from the normal power transformers and switch gears and ventilated directly to and from the exterior.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ead236d24779452c7acaf93f0487356d7c8c7fe01f736d0522e9f3b7a1c40362','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8448','GHBC-REQ-008448','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.11.1','GHBC-C-002577','The room shall be enclosed with not less than 1-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Clause 8.7 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Clause 8.11, or both.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"e room shall be enclosed with not less than 1-hour fire barriers constructe"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2b5d588155dd75ff4561105349c054328c52248ea632cfa371a6385bbbc13569','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8449','GHBC-REQ-008449','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.11.2','GHBC-C-002578','Elements of the smoke control system relying on volatile memories or the like shall be','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','336c22f53611b35713f5cd9d88ec1887a445deab4670cda6317487204ef0f6bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8450','GHBC-REQ-008450','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.11.2','GHBC-C-002578','supplied with uninterruptable power sources of sufficient duration to span 15-minute primary power interruption.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff91aae5dcc1e2ccfff730aed7d1bc93b9e97e0c834a67cea73deb50fb9e3336','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-8451','GHBC-REQ-008451','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.11.2','GHBC-C-002578','Elements of the smoke control system susceptible to power surges shall be suitably protected by conditioners, suppressors or other approved means.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','544a3bde662116d57290dd9dc8fb6f72970b9b88396f0dfd88570d7475010f80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8452','GHBC-REQ-008452','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.12','GHBC-C-002579','Fire detection systems providing control input or output signals to mechanical smoke control systems or elements thereof shall comply with the requirements of Clause 10.7.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','660e701c4bb6574b6feeaddb1b38020dd53afa07eea42448ab97f90704340464','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8453','GHBC-REQ-008453','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.12','GHBC-C-002579','Such systems shall be equipped with a control unit complying with this Code and listed as smoke control equipment.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c22fe16ff14efca7a18daa195887d7339e278597f0a128234e771bb4261c052e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8454','GHBC-REQ-008454','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.12.1','GHBC-C-002580','Control systems for mechanical smoke control systems shall include provisions for verification.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where verification of individual components tested through the preprogrammed weekly testing sequence will interfere with, and produce unwanted effects to, normal building operation, such individual components are permitted to be bypassed from the preprogrammed weekly testing, where approved by the building official and in accordance with both of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','98969ec1f95dd2b9febc7de388c977a43afd9b58fd58309533d3e692dc8ce570','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8455','GHBC-REQ-008455','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.12.1','GHBC-C-002580','Verification shall include positive confirmation of actuation, testing, manual override and the presence of power downstream of all disconnects.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where verification of individual components tested through the preprogrammed weekly testing sequence will interfere with, and produce unwanted effects to, normal building operation, such individual components are permitted to be bypassed from the preprogrammed weekly testing, where approved by the building official and in accordance with both of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca2b307a651e0e1b0227dbb9a5eed1b1a2a7f3f1020340e6352d65c6e9f551aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8456','GHBC-REQ-008456','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.12.1','GHBC-C-002580','A preprogrammed weekly test sequence shall report abnormal conditions audibly, visually and by printed report.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where verification of individual components tested through the preprogrammed weekly testing sequence will interfere with, and produce unwanted effects to, normal building operation, such individual components are permitted to be bypassed from the preprogrammed weekly testing, where approved by the building official and in accordance with both of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0be4e81117fcad7be99f91cbe85be9397a2af9fc4ca23bdd604c8e4b260a16ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8457','GHBC-REQ-008457','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.12.1','GHBC-C-002580','The preprogrammed weekly test shall operate all devices, equipment and components used for smoke control.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where verification of individual components tested through the preprogrammed weekly testing sequence will interfere with, and produce unwanted effects to, normal building operation, such individual components are permitted to be bypassed from the preprogrammed weekly testing, where approved by the building official and in accordance with both of the following:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','59bf84ee24bddd4b00c3805bbcae6c2e05848772776f8392f8a50e988b635937','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
