('rowid-8481','GHBC-REQ-008481','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.13.1','GHBC-C-002587','Entry to the enclosure shall be by copper tubing with a protective grommet of neoprene or Teflon or by suitable brass compression to male barbed adapter.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Nonmetallic tubing used within control panels and at the final connection to devices provided that all of the following conditions are met:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c198d8c60e3dfec330dfcf6f6b5e2d5abf1e0935a91cabff287b25aee74a4e55','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
