('rowid-8532','GHBC-REQ-008532','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.16.3','GHBC-C-002595','The AUTO position shall be the NORMAL, nonemergency, building control position.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Power disconnects required by Ghana Wiring Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','78da381fb76aa9a9ef05f9cee380292642f608778068c782b9fca2014c54e75c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8533','GHBC-REQ-008533','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.16.3','GHBC-C-002595','Where a fire fighter‘s control panel is in the AUTO position, the actual status of the device (on, off, open, closed) shall continue to be indicated by the status indicator described in Clause 10.9.16.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Power disconnects required by Ghana Wiring Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01f53c5bb75f04847ee9f1f904c97350c211584fdbf010330b1ee7cb63512642','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8534','GHBC-REQ-008534','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.16.3','GHBC-C-002595','Where directed by an automatic signal to assume an emergency condition, the NORMAL position shall become the emergency condition for that device or group of devices within the zone.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Power disconnects required by Ghana Wiring Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42935b8a5f57384b0ec2cca34c088e1af4182d7050aa5536f69ce1c6582772dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8535','GHBC-REQ-008535','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.16.3','GHBC-C-002595','Control actions shall not require the smoke control system to assume more than one configuration at any one time.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Power disconnects required by Ghana Wiring Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b444f26fd667318c38d67f482a9819b51c38283c0059812064c30b980c918bef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8536','GHBC-REQ-008536','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.16.3','GHBC-C-002595','EXCEPTIONS: Power disconnects required by Ghana Wiring Code.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Power disconnects required by Ghana Wiring Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4841d9f70bfa12069b60a653a7a6542e65ed32b16c8bf555cce79c78112a624b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8537','GHBC-REQ-008537','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.17','GHBC-C-002596','Smoke-control system activation shall be initiated immediately after receipt of an appropriate automatic or manual activation command.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06b40515aca84164c2ad3ada815104ef59424df4b4d7db70a1b6e59b7bf85ea3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8538','GHBC-REQ-008538','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.17','GHBC-C-002596','Smoke control systems shall activate individual components (such as dampers and fans) in the sequence necessary to prevent physical damage to the fans, dampers, ducts and other equipment.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bffe70efae8d3fede07ca8e974d71d8835f6ad67864508a79e29783bd4c3dbc9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8539','GHBC-REQ-008539','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.17','GHBC-C-002596','For purposes of smoke control, the fire fighter‘s control panel response time shall be the same for automatic or manual smoke control action initiated from any other building control point.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','79e282411e83e39d9c0e262d2174855eedee3bd84aba37e46083cea2575a0d62','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8540','GHBC-REQ-008540','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.17','GHBC-C-002596','The total response time, including that necessary for detection, shutdown of operating equipment and smoke control system startup, shall allow for full operational mode to be achieved before the conditions in the space exceed the design smoke condition.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b1bfa6df0cdecfbb7be1c4eeb8c4d61290b7696f47c04c9e9b4745ab3a5246d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8541','GHBC-REQ-008541','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.17','GHBC-C-002596','The system response time for each component and their sequential relationships shall be detailed in the required rational analysis and verification of their installed condition reported in the required final report.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d4703fa6257a15c8376bc78246facc36b53c8b993b9bbdc714d85878627d0a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8542','GHBC-REQ-008542','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.18','GHBC-C-002597','Devices, equipment, components and sequences shall be individually tested.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dd86c13643a612c9d53727a2c9e569a17034d61d469f508886ad391606c2176b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8543','GHBC-REQ-008543','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.18','GHBC-C-002597','These tests, in addition to those required by other provisions of this Code, shall consist of determination of function, sequence and, where applicable, capacity of their installed condition.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a1dc0dd2c729a488cfe80c73eba320e77da1386aa49fd40b37b2e02e78a5ddd8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8544','GHBC-REQ-008544','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.18.1','GHBC-C-002598','Smoke or fire detectors that are a part of a smoke control system shall be tested in accordance with Part 9 in their installed condition.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ested in accordance with Part 9 in their installed condition."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e2e07d637165665136281688d803893ec4385cd4e9e586287f4ea7d5450673db','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8545','GHBC-REQ-008545','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.18.1','GHBC-C-002598','Where applicable, this testing shall include verification of airflow in both minimum and maximum conditions.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bb63e3daab46486eca488d4c6e6ad9b46b451dd77fc9b2a66ae74381fc087f7a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8546','GHBC-REQ-008546','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.9','10.9.18.2','GHBC-C-002599','Ducts that are part of a smoke control system shall be traversed using generally accepted practices to determine actual air quantities.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2f152ba619435805209f0ae50dcb16d711d62c0fab6ff64d6878774eaf1b19dc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
