('rowid-8721','GHBC-REQ-008721','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.10','10.10.4.5','GHBC-C-002661','Manual controls shall be located where they are able to be accessed by the fire service from an exterior door of the building and separated from the remainder of the building by not less than 1-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Clause 8.7 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Clause 8.11, or both.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" remainder of the building by not less than 1-hour fire barriers constructe"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','958733a99dcb19e8ba70be06522cb4b4f5656632ab185032079bc142beb25f40','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
