('rowid-8785','GHBC-REQ-008785','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2','GHBC-C-002673','With respect to hydrants, driveways, buildings and landscaping, fire department connections shall be so located that fire apparatus and hose connected to supply the system will not obstruct access to the buildings for other fire apparatus.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d46a286fed33b49654b85368c1e055699f7de89f61bcae0a99708564675a75f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8786','GHBC-REQ-008786','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2','GHBC-C-002673','The location of fire department','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','847f6c277900b01ce12eb04b4c71e938a73a780f61a917addac72433c64e9f06','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8787','GHBC-REQ-008787','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2','GHBC-C-002673','connections shall be approved by the fire Code official.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','15272c11217fa51408508d0c3a9385cb4614ae93945ba3f6d81e01ea990d305a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8788','GHBC-REQ-008788','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2.1','GHBC-C-002674','Fire department connections shall be located on the street side of buildings or facing approved fire apparatus access roads, fully visible and recognizable from the street, fire apparatus access road or nearest point of fire department vehicle access or as otherwise approved by the fire Code official.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f9ebd336d447d68aaac5537fea7e90bbd8a519feaea8dcaf1b35ee8ce951fbb1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8789','GHBC-REQ-008789','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2.2','GHBC-C-002675','On existing buildings, wherever the fire department connection is not visible to approaching fire apparatus, the fire department connection shall be indicated by an approved sign mounted on the street front or on the side of the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5f7bf3f86825e6ee098d77e4fdc421c6e2aa7960b2e285d3f1e0cb7ed9c8e543','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8790','GHBC-REQ-008790','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2.2','GHBC-C-002675','Such sign shall have the letters ―FDC‖ not less than 6 inches (152 mm) high and words in letters not less than 2 inches (51 mm) high or an arrow to indicate the location.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" shall have the letters ―FDC‖ not less than 6 inches (152 mm) high and word"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"mm) high and words in letters not less than 2 inches (51 mm) high or an arr"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"e letters ―FDC‖ not less than 6 inches (152 mm) high and words i"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":152,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"―FDC‖ not less than 6 inches (152 mm) high and words in letters no"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ords in letters not less than 2 inches (51 mm) high or an arrow "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":51,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tters not less than 2 inches (51 mm) high or an arrow to indicate"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ebd0419c2743b2b8c2eac4caf1c72ee81b72bfb5116611b24cf01511561fe16','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8791','GHBC-REQ-008791','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.2.2','GHBC-C-002675','Such signs shall be subject to the approval of the fire Code official.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b5a0bb092990c12823496907183e22987f535afe3a48b803f042494fa21249bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8792','GHBC-REQ-008792','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.3','GHBC-C-002676','Fire hose threads used in connection with Fire hydrantsystems shall be approved and shall be compatible with fire department hose threads.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8870ae2ac415f2221fbaf579e0d411f207fb2615905a86bae344aa4161b8cfb1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8793','GHBC-REQ-008793','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.4','GHBC-C-002677','Immediate access to fire department connections shall be maintained at all times and without obstruction by fences, bushes, trees, walls or any other fixed or moveable object.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Fences, where provided with an access gate equipped with a sign complying with the legend requirements of this clause and a means of emergency operation. The gate and the means of emergency operation shall be approved by the fire Code official and maintained operational at all times."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c5f8593aaf31dbb5f2071e06a99f566f50576ac038981ff3c690701ff3c4dde8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8794','GHBC-REQ-008794','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.4','GHBC-C-002677','Access to fire department connections shall be approved by the fire Code official.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Fences, where provided with an access gate equipped with a sign complying with the legend requirements of this clause and a means of emergency operation. The gate and the means of emergency operation shall be approved by the fire Code official and maintained operational at all times."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f2f1421d15e9656dba81b6d68a5bc398c81ffc93eed08d9629c5d04662bd7c1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-8795','GHBC-REQ-008795','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.4','GHBC-C-002677','EXCEPTIONS: Fences, where provided with an access gate equipped with a sign complying with the legend requirements of this clause and a means of emergency operation. The gate and the means of emergency operation shall be approved by the fire Code official and maintained operational at all times.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Fences, where provided with an access gate equipped with a sign complying with the legend requirements of this clause and a means of emergency operation. The gate and the means of emergency operation shall be approved by the fire Code official and maintained operational at all times."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3eef4a18243d3f6f7363f311c5c809a84b626f643b078ce8962394f89024a1fd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
