('rowid-8797','GHBC-REQ-008797','GS 1207:2018',10,'10.12','10.12.4.1','GHBC-C-002678','The fire Code official is authorized to require locking caps on fire department connections for water-based fire protection systems where the responding fire department carries appropriate key wrenches for removal.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f199b61927cc7e274a79fc4e4d1158f932477c06ad57ffc5158311d9fe90fa13','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
