('rowid-9491','GHBC-REQ-009491','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.10','11.10.1.4.1.1','GHBC-C-002840','Each revolving door shall provide for Escape in accordance with this Code, with a breakout force of not more than 578 N (130 pounds).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":578,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ode, with a breakout force of not more than 578 N (130 pounds)."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','13ac8f69800d9dee9c80a671ddac310dfd8885d314425acbfabe3a901591e255','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9492','GHBC-REQ-009492','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.10','11.10.1.4.1.2','GHBC-C-002841','A revolving door used as other than a component of a means of escape shall comply with Clause 11.10.1.4.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A breakout force in excess of 801 N (180 pounds) is permitted if the breakout force is reduced to not more than 578 N (130 pounds) when not less than one of the following conditions is satisfied: 1. There is a power failure or power is removed to the device holding the door wings in position. 2. There is an actuation of the automatic sprinkler system where such system is provided. 3. There is an actuation of a smoke detection system that is installed in accordance with Clause 10.7 to provide coverage in areas within the building that are within 22 860 mm (75 feet) of the revolving doors. 4. There is an actuation of a manual control switch, in an approved location and clearly identified, that reduces the breakout force to not more than 578 N (130 pounds)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','28bc17f917b1588750424cd0abbb88f4054dbf92169d7179370fc099720d4b8b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9493','GHBC-REQ-009493','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.10','11.10.1.4.1.2','GHBC-C-002841','The breakout force of a revolving door not used as a component of a means of escape shall not be more than 801 N (180 pounds).','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A breakout force in excess of 801 N (180 pounds) is permitted if the breakout force is reduced to not more than 578 N (130 pounds) when not less than one of the following conditions is satisfied: 1. There is a power failure or power is removed to the device holding the door wings in position. 2. There is an actuation of the automatic sprinkler system where such system is provided. 3. There is an actuation of a smoke detection system that is installed in accordance with Clause 10.7 to provide coverage in areas within the building that are within 22 860 mm (75 feet) of the revolving doors. 4. There is an actuation of a manual control switch, in an approved location and clearly identified, that reduces the breakout force to not more than 578 N (130 pounds)."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":801,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":" means of escape shall not be more than 801 N (180 pounds)."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','05e8d67662a99163c21d54567d64573c1afae4634705255fe0b74e727efed0cb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
