es (305 mm) of the door exit hardware: 6"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9bda9f419e30f74387f8a7e1d8f0dc9357757b94fe60b2ad138e4893f1b952fe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
