('rowid-9845','GHBC-REQ-009845','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.5.4.1','GHBC-C-002880','Where the bottom or top riser adjoins a sloping public way, walkway or driveway having an established grade and serving as a landing, the bottom or top riser is permitted to be reduced along the slope to less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height, with the variation in height of the bottom or top riser not to exceed one unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (8-percent slope) of stair width.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"be reduced along the slope to less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height, with"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" along the slope to less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height, with th"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"he slope to less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height, with the vari"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4780ed55f093cc0c0d8df857f3ee7ed402706d7eb758802919d6c529bccc0d18','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9846','GHBC-REQ-009846','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.5.4.1','GHBC-C-002880','The nosings or leading edges of treads at such nonuniform height risers shall have a distinctive marking stripe, different from any other nosing marking provided on the stair flight.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','591cefb1bb856868f666371e5a3121a76196864378865cbc0bbc8a90aecf399f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
