('rowid-9903','GHBC-REQ-009903','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.11','GHBC-C-002892','Changes in room elevations of three or fewer risers within dwelling units and sleeping units in Group R-2 and R-3 do not require handrails.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b1179adc6c25d3c7b7b3ce91975fcc4d58e9b1f258628e5e6d9a8fd16ec9c2f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9904','GHBC-REQ-009904','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.12','GHBC-C-002893','In buildings four or more stories above grade plane, one stairway shall extend to the roof surface unless the roof has a slope steeper than four units vertical in 12 units horizontal (33-percent slope).','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Other than where required by Clause 11.11.12.1, in buildings without an occupied roof access to the roof from the top storey shall be permitted to be by an alternating tread device, a ships ladder or a permanent ladder."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e1a116a6698e0461e40a581314e3d6cec99327dc5fc567cb285c6184246851f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9905','GHBC-REQ-009905','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.12','GHBC-C-002893','EXCEPTIONS: Other than where required by Clause 11.11.12.1, in buildings without an occupied roof access to the roof from the top storey shall be permitted to be by an alternating tread device, a ships ladder or a permanent ladder.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Other than where required by Clause 11.11.12.1, in buildings without an occupied roof access to the roof from the top storey shall be permitted to be by an alternating tread device, a ships ladder or a permanent ladder."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"e required by Clause 11.11.12.1, in buildings without an occupied"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0253d5b48beb87cc458adbe380d010552797df91e838bd633cc1eff65383d4d0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9906','GHBC-REQ-009906','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.12.1','GHBC-C-002894','Roofs and penthouses containing elevator equipment that must be accessed for maintenance are required to be accessed by a stairway.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f77d3b3f0afdf104c26a43cd2a9011f289ca4c4ecc0d636b29aa9ad6a1671f83','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9907','GHBC-REQ-009907','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.12.2','GHBC-C-002895','Where a stairway is provided to a roof, access to the roof shall be provided through a penthouse complying with Clause 16.10.2.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In buildings without an occupied roof, access to the roof shall be permitted to be a roof hatch or trap door not less than 1.5 m2 (16 square feet) in area and having a minimum dimension of 610 mm (2 feet)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e4940e4c285defae73215e50fd1bbe958b3e29ea3e24b5f9cf50da905d6af3a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9908','GHBC-REQ-009908','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.12.2','GHBC-C-002895','EXCEPTIONS: In buildings without an occupied roof, access to the roof shall be permitted to be a roof hatch or trap door not less than 1.5 m2 (16 square feet) in area and having a minimum dimension of 610 mm (2 feet).','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In buildings without an occupied roof, access to the roof shall be permitted to be a roof hatch or trap door not less than 1.5 m2 (16 square feet) in area and having a minimum dimension of 610 mm (2 feet)."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" be a roof hatch or trap door not less than 1.5 m2 (16 square feet) in area a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"ch or trap door not less than 1.5 m2 (16 square feet) in area and "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":16,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ap door not less than 1.5 m2 (16 square feet) in area and having"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":610,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"having a minimum dimension of 610 mm (2 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":" minimum dimension of 610 mm (2 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c7fd71c8fdf48602c48f0d00f1edaa7b8294cbb950084b372bd4600e12f3570d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9909','GHBC-REQ-009909','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.13','GHBC-C-002896','Guards shall be provided along stairways and landings where required by Clause 11.15 and shall be constructed in accordance with Clause 11.15.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db0da6b6563280f2d403cd066ea2c80e5d0feb101efa32b76b586d32442d2fde','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9910','GHBC-REQ-009910','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.13','GHBC-C-002896','Where the roof hatch opening providing the required access is located within 10 feet (3049 mm) of the roof edge, such roof access or roof edge shall be protected by guards installed in accordance with Clause 11.15.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ired access is located within 10 feet (3049 mm) of the roof edge, s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3049,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ss is located within 10 feet (3049 mm) of the roof edge, such roof "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65a3a363d24ab71d97a7b54a5a52b1df1b62dc1e0ed53344536b0fa5d9ffc7d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9911','GHBC-REQ-009911','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.14','GHBC-C-002897','Alternating tread devices are limited to an element of a means of Escape in buildings of Groups F, H and S from a mezzanine not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area and that serves not more than five occupants; in buildings of Group I-3 from a guard tower, observation station or control room not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area and for access to unoccupied roofs.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":23,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"s F, H and S from a mezzanine not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":23,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ation station or control room not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":23,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"rom a mezzanine not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":250,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ezzanine not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area and that s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":23,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"or control room not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":250,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"rol room not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area and for ac"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0868f38aa867abdecc91e8d5667a50147389ab2d013987619674b432432388c7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9912','GHBC-REQ-009912','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.14','GHBC-C-002897','Alternating tread devices used as a means of Escape shall not have a rise greater than 6096 mm (20 feet) between floor levels or landings.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":6096,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" not have a rise greater than 6096 mm (20 feet) between floor level"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":" a rise greater than 6096 mm (20 feet) between floor levels or land"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','db78860c42e14bd9539f19552ad151daf1434af3dfe0229745b9ecfa54539df0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9913','GHBC-REQ-009913','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.14.1','GHBC-C-002898','devices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Alternating tread devices used as an element of a means of Escape in buildings from a mezzanine area not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area that serves not more than five occupants shall have a minimum tread depth of 76 mm (3 inches) with a minimum projected tread depth of 267 mm (101/2 inches). The rise to the next alternating tread surface shall not exceed 203 mm (8 inches)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a4f7ef88aa3bf02fefa3f5145c4095cf2083eefdaa7bcfa3990704fbd3492fee','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-9914','GHBC-REQ-009914','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.11','11.11.14.1','GHBC-C-002898','Handrails shall be provided on both sides of alternating tread devices and shall comply with Clause 11.14.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Alternating tread devices used as an element of a means of Escape in buildings from a mezzanine area not more than 23 m2 (250 square feet) in area that serves not more than five occupants shall have a minimum tread depth of 76 mm (3 inches) with a minimum projected tread depth of 267 mm (101/2 inches). The rise to the next alternating tread surface shall not exceed 203 mm (8 inches)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2777e6a0b8b0957e2142119775cb38bba1e550423b39d9e9cbbc999ee82e2600','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
