('rowid-10373','GHBC-REQ-010373','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.5','GHBC-C-002993','There shall not be penetrations or communication openings, whether protected or not, between adjacent interior exit stairways and ramps.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Membrane penetrations shall be permitted on the outside of the interior exit stairway and ramp. Such penetrations shall be protected in accordance with Clause 8.14.4.2."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','53b4dab0bb2dfbfaa6eceb28cee7990497825c4150a91e6c4e68a1f90f9e9842','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
