('rowid-10408','GHBC-REQ-010408','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.9.1','GHBC-C-002998','6.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b00c5053175e1534f6f9a63f2ce1a86f9c53a3dfdef4f3d8ec89c205c95b117c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10409','GHBC-REQ-010409','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.9.1','GHBC-C-002998','Where signs required by Clause 11.23.9 are installed in the interior exit stairways and ramps of buildings subject to Clause 11.25, the signs shall be made of the same materials as required by Clause 11.25.4.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fee4477f3e91800487935b29ff6ec90531a810957c6f1fb4e401d3699f8918e4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10410','GHBC-REQ-010410','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.10','GHBC-C-002999','At landings in interior exit stairways where two or more doors lead to the floor level, any door with direct access to an enclosed elevator lobby shall be identified by signage located on the door or directly adjacent to the door stating ―Elevator Lobby.‖ Signage shall be in accordance with Clause 11.23.9.1, Items 4, 5 and 6.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7dacbeb9556ecb9cc80af95698635cee757727ce819253481064625d00a1ef3a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10411','GHBC-REQ-010411','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.11','GHBC-C-003000','Where required by Clause 4.3.5.4, 4.5.7.2 or 4.12.2.2.1, interior exit stairways and ramps shall be smokeproof enclosures in accordance with Clause 10.9.20.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" 4.3.5.4, 4.5.7.2 or 4.12.2.2.1, interior exit stairways and ramp"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','921f09039f77811d24bf9eace9f79a6f45b0512ef8e11c82dc3c42bac8f71c98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10412','GHBC-REQ-010412','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','A smokeproof enclosure shall terminate at an exit discharge or a public way.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d464b7c389069dd31770ea7d64e9f11b35f2e23a6c8d2c9dc0564c0c1a2183aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10413','GHBC-REQ-010413','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','The smokeproof enclosure shall be permitted to be extended by an exit passageway in accordance with Clause 11.23.3.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf07995f4190e2fac7c2ceb688104183e904a45918b20fd2d64eff0a6e369afe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10414','GHBC-REQ-010414','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','The exit passageway shall be without openings other than the fire door assembly required by Clause 11.23.3.1 and those necessary for Escape from the exit passageway.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2ec3f3b0280d43f43ae2922b5fa2978beffb7d38ab215056903cc194bf6636d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10415','GHBC-REQ-010415','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','The exit passageway shall be separated from the remainder of the building by 2-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Clause 8.7 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Clause 8.11, or both.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1a11021cf9d5d3078692b4d67dbd105d3094e28349617de9632b542e9be01c44','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
