('rowid-10420','GHBC-REQ-010420','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','The fire barrier separating the smokeproof enclosure from the exit passageway is not required, provided that the exit passageway is protected and pressurized in the same manner as the smokeproof enclosure.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d643ef3d4026c6968ddf369ffed3d4e81a73bed93f71115b77ee5a562ee5212d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10421','GHBC-REQ-010421','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19e67b6dfaf4c016e71a32d25a90b2538bcc8db79b8f6f3e2b542ad12595c0d6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10422','GHBC-REQ-010422','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','1023.11.1','GHBC-C-003001','A smokeproof enclosure shall be permitted to escape through areas on the level of exit discharge or vestibules as permitted by Clause 11.28.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db440d9eae24bda5d631d68c71200d159dfa6102e34802f1eeed2bcd0a060de6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10423','GHBC-REQ-010423','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.11.2','GHBC-C-003002','Access to the stairway or ramp within a smokeproof enclosure shall be by way of a vestibule or an open exterior balcony.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Access is not required by way of a vestibule or exterior balcony for stairways and ramps using the pressurization alternative complying with Clause 10.9.20.5."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f9b7b50c9ee7b69566841e92a0bfd92bdaf988f0fa7fddf6c65e8d3d5cd7e74b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10424','GHBC-REQ-010424','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.11.2','GHBC-C-003002','EXCEPTIONS: Access is not required by way of a vestibule or exterior balcony for stairways and ramps using the pressurization alternative complying with Clause 10.9.20.5.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Access is not required by way of a vestibule or exterior balcony for stairways and ramps using the pressurization alternative complying with Clause 10.9.20.5."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','428f5c3f2cd983ad24f89319effa2ffaf592bb9fce8e16da6f8f4ecc9532f0a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10425','GHBC-REQ-010425','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.23','11.23.12','GHBC-C-003003','Standpipes and Fire hydranthose connections shall be provided where required by Clauses 10.5.3 and 10.5.4.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa7e80fcdcec2af95aba5419378215118acbb3487b5fb3eb1a8f926baf3fcee6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10426','GHBC-REQ-010426','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','11.24.1','GHBC-C-003004','Exit passageways serving as an exit component in a means of escape system shall comply with the requirements of this Clause.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4750f41c0130fb6d6c8a995724db381e8883d40eb5659a7e9efc515e5ebddfb7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10427','GHBC-REQ-010427','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','11.24.1','GHBC-C-003004','An exit passageway shall not be used for any purpose other than as a means of escape and a circulation path.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d3493b1c39dd107385a204e9d3ed5366641578b6ec3309a401090cf441d70898','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10428','GHBC-REQ-010428','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','1024.2','GHBC-C-003005','The required capacity of exit passageways shall be determined as specified in Clause 11.5.1 but the minimum width shall be not less than 1118 mm (44 inches), except that exit passageways serving an occupant load of less than 50 shall be not less than 914 mm (36 inches) in width.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Encroachments complying with Clause 11.5.7."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1118,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ut the minimum width shall be not less than 1118 mm (44 inches), except that e"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"s serving an occupant load of less than 50 shall be not less than 914 mm"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":914,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"load of less than 50 shall be not less than 914 mm (36 inches) in width."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1118,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" width shall be not less than 1118 mm (44 inches), except that exit"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":44,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"all be not less than 1118 mm (44 inches), except that exit passag"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"an occupant load of less than 50 shall be not less than 914 mm ("},{"parameter":"measurement","value":914,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"han 50 shall be not less than 914 mm (36 inches) in width."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":36,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"hall be not less than 914 mm (36 inches) in width."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5a62e30e93eda003a17702e297f5e734dc6dc4e388066325ac4ff7eb9bb4548','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10429','GHBC-REQ-010429','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','1024.2','GHBC-C-003005','The minimum width or required capacity of exit passageways shall be unobstructed.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Encroachments complying with Clause 11.5.7."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5667def853b1c33d7e667fe76a5e6b00842a0f882ac7a7d1f126354ee3747b01','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10430','GHBC-REQ-010430','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','1024.2','GHBC-C-003005','EXCEPTIONS: Encroachments complying with Clause 11.5.7.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Encroachments complying with Clause 11.5.7."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','52de778e6b8730977975c5537312c0028ab2d55108b4ab5ff309a494ff827992','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10431','GHBC-REQ-010431','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','11.24.3','GHBC-C-003006','Exit passageway enclosures shall have walls, floors and ceilings of not less than a 1-hour fireresistance rating, and not less than that required for any connecting interior exit stairway or ramp.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3445835034217510b9ef8a4912d19704b3a14725ae1e1398ec6981870f933df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10432','GHBC-REQ-010432','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','11.24.3','GHBC-C-003006','Exit passageways shall be constructed as fire barriers in accordance with Clause 8.7 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Clause 8.11, or both.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be6e04e25f4be530d35126ada682ca0824beb5d70343108d60f2e67464f09311','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10433','GHBC-REQ-010433','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','11.24.4','GHBC-C-003007','Exit passageways on the level of exit discharge shall terminate at an exit discharge.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d47727c5b3014bbdf89cb8164b26adb43c14a295c4a10e1f45142c72713cb6ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
