('rowid-10486','GHBC-REQ-010486','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.4.2','GHBC-C-003019','Perimeter demarcation lines shall be placed on the wall with the bottom edge of the stripe not more than 102 mm (4 inches) above the finished floor.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Demarcation lines shall not extend in front of exit discharge doors that lead out of an exit and through which occupants must travel to complete the exit path."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"the bottom edge of the stripe not more than 102 mm (4 inches) above the finis"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e of the stripe not more than 102 mm (4 inches) above the finished"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" stripe not more than 102 mm (4 inches) above the finished floor"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','586ba6db36df75b4823440aee9806ae15eb05de6897de6dbc95c84a88e1b8c97','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10487','GHBC-REQ-010487','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.4.2','GHBC-C-003019','At the top or bottom of the stairs, demarcation lines shall drop vertically to the floor within 51 mm (2 inches) of the step or landing edge.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Demarcation lines shall not extend in front of exit discharge doors that lead out of an exit and through which occupants must travel to complete the exit path."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":51,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ertically to the floor within 51 mm (2 inches) of the step or lan"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ly to the floor within 51 mm (2 inches) of the step or landing e"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','83c0aa160154a1b9d60d13cae18dec1d270be38ec59ac4a4e66f9337b822e508','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10488','GHBC-REQ-010488','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.4.2','GHBC-C-003019','Demarcation lines on walls shall transition vertically to the floor and then extend across the floor where a line on the floor is the only practical method of outlining the path.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Demarcation lines shall not extend in front of exit discharge doors that lead out of an exit and through which occupants must travel to complete the exit path."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6cf5d01bab12edf296041ec4843937c86f4578365fdc2b17527f8c4d9d0710e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10489','GHBC-REQ-010489','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.4.2','GHBC-C-003019','Where the wall line is broken by a door, demarcation lines on walls shall continue across the face of the door or transition to the floor and extend across the floor in front of such door.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Demarcation lines shall not extend in front of exit discharge doors that lead out of an exit and through which occupants must travel to complete the exit path."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed56796ede7ab6597d1fc9453ac2299633ad64356fe93ef4c2aa9ff08685a2b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10490','GHBC-REQ-010490','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.4.2','GHBC-C-003019','EXCEPTIONS: Demarcation lines shall not extend in front of exit discharge doors that lead out of an exit and through which occupants must travel to complete the exit path.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Demarcation lines shall not extend in front of exit discharge doors that lead out of an exit and through which occupants must travel to complete the exit path."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','72fcdc2b9a5bc3942efca9abae77e8bcd6ee0f2aa9bd8e94b00438da08a89439','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10491','GHBC-REQ-010491','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.4.3','GHBC-C-003020','Where a wall-mounted demarcation line transitions to a floor-mounted demarcation line, or vice versa, the wall-mounted demarcation line shall drop vertically to the floor to meet a complimentary extension of the floor-mounted demarcation line, thus forming a continuous marking.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df3d7aced7f5b93bd170356c87029686446a4acfa7370aa7aeddfff314f2610c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10492','GHBC-REQ-010492','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.5','GHBC-C-003021','Obstacles at or below 1981 mm (6 feet 6 inches) in height and projecting more than 102 mm (4 inches) into the Escape path shall be outlined with markings not less than 25 mm (1 inch) in width comprised of a pattern of alternating equal bands, of luminous material and black, with the alternating bands not more than 51 mm (2 inches) thick and angled at 45 degrees (0.79 rad).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to markings listed in accordance with this Code."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"hes) in height and projecting more than 102 mm (4 inches) into the Escape"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":25,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"all be outlined with markings not less than 25 mm (1 inch) in width comprise"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":51,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"k, with the alternating bands not more than 51 mm (2 inches) thick and angle"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1981,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"Obstacles at or below 1981 mm (6 feet 6 inches) in height a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"bstacles at or below 1981 mm (6 feet 6 inches) in height and proje"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"s at or below 1981 mm (6 feet 6 inches) in height and projecting"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ight and projecting more than 102 mm (4 inches) into the Escape pa"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" projecting more than 102 mm (4 inches) into the Escape path sha"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"d with markings not less than 25 mm (1 inch) in width comprised o"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"markings not less than 25 mm (1 inch) in width comprised of a pa"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":51,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ternating bands not more than 51 mm (2 inches) thick and angled a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ng bands not more than 51 mm (2 inches) thick and angled at 45 d"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ee6a7728640aa16cf4805edc0d44536d139e3ac9563fc94313667e79a7708eb7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10493','GHBC-REQ-010493','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.5','GHBC-C-003021','Obstacles shall include, but are not limited to, standpipes, hose cabinets, wall projections and restricted height areas.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to markings listed in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1cdd99a9808d3b85a9d6bfa6803e8261d736184ea0532ce0c83423b5002193cb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10494','GHBC-REQ-010494','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.5','GHBC-C-003021','However, such markings shall not conceal any required information or indicators including but not limited to instructions to occupants for the use of standpipes.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to markings listed in accordance with this Code."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','924cf740222df0209110340d74c5d5c64d757d753772cef116542fbd906be81e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10495','GHBC-REQ-010495','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.5','GHBC-C-003021','EXCEPTIONS: The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to markings listed in accordance with this Code.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to markings listed in accordance with this Code."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"EPTIONS: The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to m"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":": The minimum width of 25 mm (1 inch) shall not apply to marking"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','962bdf0b834983f81d2ca0b66e56d69c68009911983ac31144ba765ed5befc52','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10496','GHBC-REQ-010496','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6','GHBC-C-003022','Doors through which occupants must pass in order to complete the exit path shall be provided with markings complying with Clauses 11.25.2.6.1 through 11.25.2.6.3.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','afe1048287767ec27f8914da18160e7acdb6af76ff31a020e34a7cbc53f4bc14','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10497','GHBC-REQ-010497','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.1','GHBC-C-003023','The doors shall be identified by a low-location luminous emergency exit symbol complying with the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d960682ff0a4767f56673b2ed11244a748eb52d07748d6bfe52914726b3025c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10498','GHBC-REQ-010498','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.1','GHBC-C-003023','The exit symbol shall be not less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height and shall be mounted on the door, centered horizontally, with the top of the symbol not higher than 457 mm (18 inches) above the finished floor.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"The exit symbol shall be not less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height and s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"symbol shall be not less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height and shal"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"hall be not less than 102 mm (4 inches) in height and shall be m"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":457,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"of the symbol not higher than 457 mm (18 inches) above the finishe"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":18,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ymbol not higher than 457 mm (18 inches) above the finished floor"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a63b82b4ab3d74c3f4f6e647c9a728eb05524c9638b8f8ba6100e402df0bf608','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10499','GHBC-REQ-010499','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.2','GHBC-C-003024','Door hardware shall be marked with not less than 406 mm2 (16 square inches) of luminous material.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":406,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"hardware shall be marked with not less than 406 mm2 (16 square inches) of lum"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":406,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" be marked with not less than 406 mm2 (16 square inches) of lumino"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":16,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"d with not less than 406 mm2 (16 square inches) of luminous mate"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b3e4bb6a5c4a13308fa05bb0d0266fef9aa148be9992011f983580171eef37ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10500','GHBC-REQ-010500','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.2','GHBC-C-003024','This marking shall be located behind, immediately adjacent to, or on the door handle or escutcheon.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4277eddc020964099870672a4094a5339a55faa186683feb5a845455f84d7593','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-10501','GHBC-REQ-010501','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.2','GHBC-C-003024','Where a panic bar is installed, such material shall be not less than 25 mm (1 inch) wide for the entire length of the actuating bar or touchpad.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":25,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"alled, such material shall be not less than 25 mm (1 inch) wide for the enti"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"terial shall be not less than 25 mm (1 inch) wide for the entire "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"shall be not less than 25 mm (1 inch) wide for the entire length"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7374236fd36cfa290175c1cdc0df6ee029eb95ba5b09a81a057e37afe0ca46a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10502','GHBC-REQ-010502','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.3','GHBC-C-003025','The top and sides of the door frame shall be marked with a solid and continuous 25 mm to 51 mm (1-inch- to 2-inch-wide) stripe.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"d with a solid and continuous 25 mm to 51 mm (1-inch- to 2-inch-w"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":51,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"solid and continuous 25 mm to 51 mm (1-inch- to 2-inch-wide) stri"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','626c8e0f265986fdb799dd586dc701b76fc07fa63bd629d044e880a0ed2c781f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10503','GHBC-REQ-010503','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.2.6.3','GHBC-C-003025','Where the door molding does not provide sufficient flat surface on which to locate the stripe, the stripe shall be permitted to be located on the wall surrounding the frame.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','61dd2fee35af7f10f083a3e8d7146d9ce7bfcb6296256a09195d1d3ee9b5c2b1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10504','GHBC-REQ-010504','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','Placement and dimensions of markings shall be consistent and uniform throughout the same enclosure.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cfb2cd4766ef201f0634d3aa1265cb8c1e2457be92526aa0f3bbb427ea9433b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10505','GHBC-REQ-010505','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','11.25.4 Self-luminous and photoluminescent.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25.4,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"11.25.4 Self-luminous and photoluminesc"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','296fa0da2245c0735c41005cbce861575eefb9d5df609145d06933b81b4e068e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10506','GHBC-REQ-010506','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','Luminous escape path markings shall be permitted to be made of any material, including paint, provided that an electrical charge is not required to maintain the required luminance.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9c0957a751a28d8a3fafb22826739d367d11badfebb8e782497aca9bc6def22c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10507','GHBC-REQ-010507','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','Such materials shall include, but not be limited to, self-luminous materials and photoluminescent materials.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','36681dedc7d80ecebce1d1f2ee4f477ce1be602b94f82ef0e7088e857bc43fb5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10508','GHBC-REQ-010508','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','Materials shall comply with either of the following standards:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a76f60881bc0517134da4ce64afdfaa31f2141c70a6e696c6cc2592c071cd673','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10509','GHBC-REQ-010509','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','236c130bdecb58ab8bb04937c026c48410732f55236008c139d744d5b99e702b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10510','GHBC-REQ-010510','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.3','GHBC-C-003026','ASTM E2072, except that the charging source shall be 1 footcandle (11 lux) of fluorescent illumination for 60 minutes, and the minimum luminance shall be 30 milicandelas per square meter at 10 minutes and milicandelas per square meter after 905 minutes.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"foot","operator":null,"context":" the charging source shall be 1 footcandle (11 lux) of fluorescent"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":11,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"source shall be 1 footcandle (11 lux) of fluorescent illuminatio"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" fluorescent illumination for 60 minutes, and the minimum lumina"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"he minimum luminance shall be 30 milicandelas per square meter a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"icandelas per square meter at 10 minutes and milicandelas per sq"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":905,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ndelas per square meter after 905 minutes."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6023cfc92a9014bbc415dab378dcd881a9876f1cf5fd8efdae1fe04386c2cdb8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10511','GHBC-REQ-010511','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.5','GHBC-C-003027','Where photoluminescent exit path markings are installed, they shall be provided with not less than 1 footcandle (11 lux) of illumination for not less than 60 minutes prior to periods when the building is occupied and continuously during occupancy.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":", they shall be provided with not less than 1 footcandle (11 lux) of illumi"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" (11 lux) of illumination for not less than 60 minutes prior to periods when"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"foot","operator":null,"context":"e provided with not less than 1 footcandle (11 lux) of illuminatio"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":11,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"h not less than 1 footcandle (11 lux) of illumination for not le"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"llumination for not less than 60 minutes prior to periods when t"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e37b1c54a0d6c6c24f4106e1c02ac9c956002749c616e5b7c288203920bea56','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10512','GHBC-REQ-010512','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','Horizontal exits serving as an exit in a means of escape system shall comply with the requirements of this Clause.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a2e6c9261a2cc34f632f45c2ea1e150c8fb955cbc575e0aa2c98ce4b9e29a259','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10513','GHBC-REQ-010513','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','A horizontal exit shall not serve as the only exit from a portion of a building, and where two or more exits are required, not more than one-half of the total number of exits or total exit minimum width or required capacity shall be horizontal exits.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9502371b5689d310bbc2bfa2da4f16099cf21a5ecf50e53b9454d3d193776348','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10514','GHBC-REQ-010514','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','Exceptions:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0544296f14d46188b28a6ae529159390bdd5f02b5f0a46e5e0dd86a622f8a0a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10515','GHBC-REQ-010515','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b90f34a10e6971ca8b1ed9086b0e633ebc1a1832d679a00b319e58fa1a9c64db','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10516','GHBC-REQ-010516','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','Horizontal exits are permitted to comprise two-thirds of the required exits from any building or floor area for occupancies in Group I-2.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ffb6d0840f3579a10e591503b0fad7492e9692fa95691d06b5e13797c80d3e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10517','GHBC-REQ-010517','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2b55aea28e26cec9d23768bb52484f78d2f36ed1b022ce3f2a938cacddf8ffb4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10518','GHBC-REQ-010518','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','Horizontal exits are permitted to comprise 100 percent of the exits required for occupancies in Group I-3.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"its are permitted to comprise 100 percent of the exits required for occ"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23eb9d5094ffded75d458c70a026878e625396e8295b752dd2a1857a1e166c65','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10519','GHBC-REQ-010519','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','Not less than 0.6 m2 (6 square feet) of accessible space per occupant shall be provided on each side of the horizontal exit for the total number of people in adjoining compartments.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.6,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"Not less than 0.6 m2 (6 square feet) of accessi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.6,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"Not less than 0.6 m2 (6 square feet) of accessible"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"Not less than 0.6 m2 (6 square feet) of accessible spac"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2381549a6ce1218b699d1bd4e28c6549ca48e41506ffc9ec82cad8c8fc5c9456','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10520','GHBC-REQ-010520','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','The separation between buildings or refuge areas connected by a horizontal exit shall be provided by a fire wall complying with Clause 8.6; or by a fire barrier complying with Clause 8.7 or a horizontal assembly complying with Clause 8.11, or both.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2dea20ba1a2e241a80a08424ea3fea631cdf29ea5942f8c522652c8c9936dd10','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10521','GHBC-REQ-010521','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','The minimum fireresistance rating of the separation shall be 2 hours.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ng of the separation shall be 2 hours."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','97c87fc1eac3c067c862371613896e28d770b61442cad524b271f53279261f0d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10522','GHBC-REQ-010522','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','Opening protectives in horizontal exits shall also comply with Clause 8.16.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc14ba339810bf712b8dc610b892c8e92aac42c74d73e8ed145d970a2c48beb7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
