('rowid-10524','GHBC-REQ-010524','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','air transfer openings in a fire wall or fire barrier that serves as a horizontal exit shall also comply with Clause 8.17.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','37033e0d7bdee6815073e21e5bfe812b0f6924eee1f0651eac70c491cea0c5b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10525','GHBC-REQ-010525','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','The horizontal exit separation shall extend vertically through all levels of the building unless floor assemblies have a fire-resistance rating of not less than 2 hours and do not have unprotected openings.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"e a fire-resistance rating of not less than 2 hours and do not have unprote"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"tance rating of not less than 2 hours and do not have unprotect"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a829785960ee4a5476326cc938a96f50ddf0a4185fd57aed85c463c3fc23677','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10526','GHBC-REQ-010526','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','Horizontal exits constructed as fire barriers shall be continuous from exterior wall to exterior wall so as to divide completely the floor served by the horizontal exit.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34abc0920ec367433fcb00d51628480e5fb6a94e55103d5e851ac5a898e96563','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10527','GHBC-REQ-010527','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.2','GHBC-C-003029','EXCEPTIONS: A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A fire-resistance rating is not required at horizontal exits between a building area and an above-grade pedestrian walkway constructed in accordance with Clause 32.4, provided that the distance between connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6096,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"etween connected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6096,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"nected buildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ildings is more than 6096 mm (20 feet)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dbc2f95b6f01034bc1c4fde063f64b233e397b0c41611a70d8598aab3e3013de','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10528','GHBC-REQ-010528','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.3','GHBC-C-003030','Fire doors in horizontal exits shall be selfclosing or automatic-closing when activated by a smoke detector in accordance with Clause 8.16.2.6.6.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','013c06a51fc503b66c57f0a15d02fc72a05c596ae6e0433a5fd53d17117f7a9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10529','GHBC-REQ-010529','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.3','GHBC-C-003030','Doors, where located in a crosscorridor condition, shall be automatic-closing by activation of a smoke detector installed in accordance with Clause 8.16.2.6.6.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','247a7e716bc4776e2d856f89df6eee966c58bf79adde8c782bfd7c7d78b35f5c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10530','GHBC-REQ-010530','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4','GHBC-C-003031','The refuge area of a horizontal exit shall be a space occupied by the same tenant or a public area and each such refuge area shall be adequate to accommodate the original occupant load of the refuge area plus the occupant load anticipated from the adjoining compartment.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be844133f834faf00282a2b0778d3f3b79d3331223f7c1cdcf83ac3b41e0fd21','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10531','GHBC-REQ-010531','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4','GHBC-C-003031','The anticipated occupant load from the adjoining compartment shall be based on the capacity of the horizontal exit doors entering the refuge area or the total occupant load of the adjoining compartment, whichever is less.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2befcef1ebaf39a687b4945a7456448ccc2cd7d81a68ffc0df624b5cf9c02769','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10532','GHBC-REQ-010532','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4.1','GHBC-C-003032','The capacity of the refuge area shall be computed based on a net floor area allowance of 0.2787 m2 (3 square feet) for each occupant to be accommodated therein.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.2787,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"a net floor area allowance of 0.2787 m2 (3 square feet) for each occu"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" area allowance of 0.2787 m2 (3 square feet) for each occupant "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1597842d30d12192b0781a3fa4e948dca017a985b08db191ea017065cc42fa1a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10533','GHBC-REQ-010533','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4.1','GHBC-C-003032','Where the horizontal exit also forms a smoke compartment, the capacity of the refuge area for Group I-1, I-2 and I-3 occupancies and Group B ambulatory care facilities shall comply with Clauses 4.7.5.3, 4.8.6.2, 4.20.6.1 and 4.22.3.2 as applicable.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4b9c743dc97af4ebb9bfc21ca12a917183c3e81784f54224d26cac082325acc6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10534','GHBC-REQ-010534','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4.2','GHBC-C-003033','The refuge area into which a horizontal exit leads shall be provided with exits adequate to meet the occupant requirements of this part, but not including the added occupant load imposed by persons entering the refuge area through horizontal exits from other areas.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The adjoining compartment shall not be required to have a stairway or door leading directly outside, provided that the refuge area into which a horizontal exit leads has stairways or doors leading directly outside and are so arranged that escape shall not require the occupants to return through the compartment from which escape originates."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c8ded3f874a5fba4d4816bfd4d6e35e13324bed061b91c8f66f7534fcd59909e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10535','GHBC-REQ-010535','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4.2','GHBC-C-003033','Not less than one refuge area exit shall lead directly to the exterior or to an interior exit stairway or ramp.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The adjoining compartment shall not be required to have a stairway or door leading directly outside, provided that the refuge area into which a horizontal exit leads has stairways or doors leading directly outside and are so arranged that escape shall not require the occupants to return through the compartment from which escape originates."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2d0dd20f6458d81368e67979fd15c2d9d4a07b02ad9f5eafe61398de8ffc6ae1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10536','GHBC-REQ-010536','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.4.2','GHBC-C-003033','EXCEPTIONS: The adjoining compartment shall not be required to have a stairway or door leading directly outside, provided that the refuge area into which a horizontal exit leads has stairways or doors leading directly outside and are so arranged that escape shall not require the occupants to return through the compartment from which escape originates.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The adjoining compartment shall not be required to have a stairway or door leading directly outside, provided that the refuge area into which a horizontal exit leads has stairways or doors leading directly outside and are so arranged that escape shall not require the occupants to return through the compartment from which escape originates."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f0b4522bcb66d8b3c89e36efb0185e7e5b93447c99bc869627151c887d1925ed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10537','GHBC-REQ-010537','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.5','GHBC-C-003034','Standpipes and Fire hydranthose connections shall be provided where required by Clauses 10.5.3 and 10.5.4.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f483f5b51b333b86369eb57299bd2ebf75fc7577a882df3727135799dccb729a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
