('rowid-10744','GHBC-REQ-010744','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.9.2','GHBC-C-003066','The aisle shall provide sufficient capacity for the number of persons accommodated by the catchment area served by the aisle.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c3dc9f2e196571ee2a05c5833d54322a688c403775262359c02f09fb632363c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10745','GHBC-REQ-010745','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.9.2','GHBC-C-003066','The catchment area served by an aisle is that portion of the total space served by that Clause of the aisle.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2214a4058fe1a75681c60ac7c7e82504fffd685b6d6f1f5e23b2c2b37ae3662d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10746','GHBC-REQ-010746','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.9.2','GHBC-C-003066','In establishing catchment areas, the assumption shall be made that there is a balanced use of all means of escape, with the number of persons in proportion to Escape capacity.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','587518c38666ae04ad56d2e5e20e617da9c48cc3dc065acde4696de10ce3db34','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10747','GHBC-REQ-010747','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.9.3','GHBC-C-003067','Where aisles converge to form a single path of escape travel, the required capacity of that path shall be not less than the combined required capacity of the converging aisles.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7de855d69b0ebd7056f734bf2de182aa8ddc1be8a86c4005a636b2681d38e521','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10748','GHBC-REQ-010748','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.9.4','GHBC-C-003068','Those portions of aisles, where Escape is possible in either of two directions, shall be uniform in minimum width or required capacity.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01a2aa19a584d5b833c824357655a4ece6abcd839d9034c27dd2d3bdd495d39b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
